omari.com/electronics/219771/amazfit-band-5-smart-fitness-tracker-with-spo2-black?affId=5rraOArAO81rOoO&amp;affs=15207&amp;cma=259200">\nCheck for Price</a>', 'Smartwatches are currently at the peak of the most demanded smart gadgets in the Bangladeshi market. Along with the demand, the market is flooded with smartwatches with new designs', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/20240118_102541.png', 2, NULL, 'publish', 49, 1, '4.96', 40, '2024-01-17 10:41:26', '2024-01-17 10:41:26', '2026-09-18 10:55:24');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (2, 769, 1, '10 Best Bengali World Literature Books of Alltime', 'best-world-literature-books-of-alltime-in-bengali', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Literature feeds the human mind. <a href="/?s=Literature">Literature</a> not only enriches people\'s thinking, but literature also educates people in the education of humanity. There is no substitute for reading literature to understand the history and culture of human civilization. Although literature is written in different languages in many languages around the world, nowadays we get a taste of that literature by reading translated literature. By reading this article you will find the top 10 books of world literature. Finding the right book for readers is an important objective of the SERA10 team.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/girl-woman-read-3528292-1024x682.jpg" alt="girl, woman, read-3528292.jpg"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Top 10 World Literature Books of All Time</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choosing the top 10 world literature books of all time is a difficult task. Again those books must have Bengali translation. Otherwise, Bengali readers will not be able to enjoy the best world literature. We have selected 10 world literature books by researching various foreign articles. These books have been enthralling the readers of the world for years. The literary quality and story quality of these books are so high that the readers want to read the books again and again.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Below is the list of best 10 books in Bengali translation o