INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (8, 1428, 1, 'The Best RDP Hosting Provider in Bangladesh', 'the-best-rdp-hosting-provider-in-bangladesh', '&nbsp;\r\n<h4>Best RDP Hosting Provider in Bangladesh</h4>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h4>What is RDP Hosting?</h4>\r\nRDP Hosting refers to Remote Desktop Protocol Hosting, which is a service that allows users to access a virtualized desktop environment remotely over the internet. With RDP hosting, users can connect to a server where their desktop environment is hosted and interact with it as if they were sitting in front of a physical computer.\r\n\r\nHere\'s how it typically works:\r\n\r\n1. Server Hosting: The desktop environment is hosted on a remote server, often in a data center.\r\n\r\n2. Remote Access: Users connect to this server using Remote Desktop Protocol (RDP) client software from their own devices, such as a PC, laptop, tablet, or smartphone.\r\n\r\n3. Desktop Environment: Once connected, users see and interact with a desktop environment that looks and feels like a traditional desktop operating system, such as Windows or Linux.\r\n\r\n4. Applications and Data: Users can run applications installed on the remote desktop and access files and data stored there. This allows for easy collaboration and access to resources from anywhere with an internet connection.\r\n\r\nRDP Hosting is commonly used by businesses to provide remote access to employees, allowing them to work from anywhere securely. It\'s also used for hosting virtual desktops for specific tasks or projects, as well as for software testing and development environments.\r\n<h4>Quality of a Good RDP Hosting Provider?</h4>\r\nThe quality of a good RDP hosting service can be determined by several key factors:\r\n\r\n1. Reliability and Uptime: A good RDP hosting provider should offer high uptime and reliability, ensuring that the remote desktop environment is accessible whenever needed without frequent disruptions.\r\n\r\n2. Performance: The hosting service should provide fast and responsive performance, with minimal lag or latency when interacting with the remote desktop environment. This includes factors such as processing power, memory, and network speed.\r\n\r\n3. Security: Security is paramount when accessing a remote desktop environment over the internet. The hosting service should employ robust security measures to protect data and prevent unauthorized access, including encryption, firewalls, and access controls.\r\n\r\n4. Scalability: A good RDP hosting service should be scalable, allowing for easy expansion or contraction of resources based on demand. This ensures that the service can accommodate growing or changing needs without sacrificing performance or reliability.\r\n\r\n5. Technical Support: Responsive and knowledgeable technical support is essential for resolving issues and ensuring a smooth user experience. The hosting provider should offer prompt assistance and troubleshooting for any problems that may arise.\r\n\r\n6. Compatibility: The RDP hosting service should support a wide range of devices and operating systems, allowing users to connect from various platforms such as Windows, macOS, iOS, Android, and Linux.\r\n\r\n7. Ease of Use: The hosting service should be user-friendly, with intuitive interfaces and easy setup processes for both administrators and end-users. This includes features such as remote management tools and simplified account management.\r\n\r\n8. Data Backup and Recovery: Regular backups of data stored on the remote desktop environment should be performed to prevent data loss in case of hardware failure or other unforeseen events. The hosting provider should have robust backup and recovery procedures in place.\r\n\r\nOverall, a good RDP hosting service should offer a combination of reliability, performance, security, scalability, support, compatibility, ease of use, and data protection to meet the needs of businesses and individuals requiring remote desktop access.\r\n<h4>Why <a href="https://client.onehostbd.com/aff.php?aff=2">OneHost BD</a> is the Best RDP Hosting Seller in Bangladesh</h4>\r\n<a href="https://client.onehostbd.com/aff.php?aff=2"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/logo-300x52.png" alt="" width="300" height="52" /></a>\r\n\r\n<strong style="color: #0000ff; font-style: inherit; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; background-color: var(--ast-global-color-5);">Details about the product</strong>\r\n\r\nএকটি ভালো RDP হোস্টিং-এর গুণাবলি নিশ্চিত করার জন্য OneHost BD যা করে থাকেঃ\r\n\r\n1. স্থিতিশীলতা এবং অপটাইম: একটি ভালো RDP হোস্টিং Provider-কে উচ্চ অপটাইম এবং স্থিতিশীলতা অফার করতে হয়, যেটি কোম্পানিটি নিশ্চিত করে।\r\n\r\n2. কার্যক্ষমতা: কোম্পানিটি হোস্টিং সেবাটি দ্রুত এবং কার্যক্ষমভাবে সরবরাহ করে থাকে এবং RDP হোস্টিং সেটিং করে দেয়।\r\n\r\n3. নিরাপত্তা: RDP হোস্টিং-এর ক্ষেত্রে নিরাপত্তা একটি গুরুত্বপূর্ণ বিষয়, যেটা এই হোস্টিং Provider নিশ্চিত করে থাকে।\r\n\r\n4. স্টেলাবিলিটি: যেহেতু কোম্পানিটি সুনামের সাথে দীর্ঘদিন RDP হোস্টিং সেল করছে তাই স্টেলাবিলিটি নিয়ে প্রশ্ন তোলার কোনো অবকাশ নেয়।\r\n\r\n5. টেকনিক্যাল সাপোর্ট: RDP হোস্টিং-এর ক্ষেত্রে কোনো সমস্যা হলে তার দ্রুত ও যথাযথ সমাধানের প্রয়োজন হয় যা কোম্পানিটি সরবারহ করে থাকে।\r\n<h4><a href="https://client.onehostbd.com/aff.php?aff=2">Offers for the RDP Hosting</a></h4>\r\n<a href="https://client.onehostbd.com/aff.php?aff=2"><strong>1800tk/month</strong></a>\r\n<strong>3 Core 4gb RAM</strong>\r\n\r\n<a href="https://client.onehostbd.com/aff.php?aff=2"><strong>2300tk/month</strong></a>\r\n<strong>4 Core 6gb RAM</strong>\r\n\r\n<a href="https://client.onehostbd.com/aff.php?aff=2"><strong>2700tk/month</strong></a>\r\n<strong>4 Core 8gb RAM</strong>\r\n\r\n<a href="https://client.onehostbd.com/aff.php?aff=2"><strong>5100tk/month</strong></a>\r\n<strong>8 Core 16gb RAM</strong>\r\n<h4><strong><a href="https://client.onehostbd.com/aff.php?aff=2">Special Features of the RDP Hosting</a>\r\n</strong></h4>\r\n<strong>Dedicated IP\r\nFull Root Access\r\n10GB Port Network\r\nIPV4 &amp; IPV6 Support\r\n</strong>\r\n\r\n<a href="https://client.onehostbd.com/aff.php?aff=2">\r\nGET NOW\r\n</a>', '&nbsp; Best RDP Hosting Provider in Bangladesh &nbsp; What is RDP Hosting? RDP Hosting refers to Remote Desktop Protocol Hosting, which is a service that allows users to access a v', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/20240405_154425.png', 2, NULL, 'publish', 42, 0, '4.51', 24, '2024-04-05 03:01:33', '2024-04-05 03:01:33', '2026-09-18 10:45:38');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (9, 1445, 1, 'Top Air Conditioner Alternatives in Bangladesh', 'top-air-conditioner-alternatives-in-bangladesh', '<!-- wp:heading {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color"><em><strong>Air Conditioner Alternatives:</strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An electric air cooler is a device that uses electricity to provide cooling, typically through the process of evaporative cooling or refrigeration. Here\'s a brief overview of the two main types of electric air coolers:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">1. Evaporative Air Cooler:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also known as swamp coolers, these devices work by drawing warm air through water-saturated pads. As the air passes through the wet pads, the water evaporates, which cools the air. The cooled air is then blown into the room. Evaporative air coolers are most effective in dry climates where humidity levels are low. They are energy-efficient and relatively affordable to operate compared to traditional air conditioners.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">2. Refrigerative Air Cooler:</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These air coolers operate similarly to traditional air conditioners but on a smaller scale. They use a refrigeration cycle to cool the air. A compressor compresses a refrigerant gas, which then absorbs heat from the indoor air. The cooled air is then circulated back into the room. Refrigerative air coolers can provide more precise temperature control and are effective in a variety of climates, including humid environments. However, they typically consume more energy than evaporative air coolers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When choosing an electric air cooler, consider factors such as the climate of your location, the size of the area you need to cool, energy efficiency, noise level, and any specific features you may require, such as remote control or air purification capabilities. Additionally, ensure that the cooler\'s cooling capacity matches your needs to achieve optimal cooling performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>সাধারণত দুই প্রকারের এয়ার কুলার এসির বিকল্প হিসেবে ব্যবহার করা হয়। এর মধ্যে&nbsp; Evaporative Air Cooler বর্তমানে বাংলাদেশের বাজারে অধিক জনপ্রিয়।</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color"><strong><em>Why people use "Evaporative Air Cooler"?</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>People use evaporative air coolers for several reasons:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>1. Energy Efficiency: Evaporative air coolers consume significantly less energy compared to traditional air conditioners. They operate by using a fan to draw warm air through water-saturated pads, where the water evaporates, cooling the air. Since they do not rely on refrigerants or compressors, they have lower electricity consumption, making them more cost-effective to operate.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>2. Environmentally Friendly: Because evaporative air coolers use water as the primary cooling agent and do not emit harmful greenhouse gases, they are considered more environmentally friendly than traditional air conditioners.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3. Cost-Effectiveness: Not only are evaporative air coolers typically cheaper to purchase than air conditioning units, but they also have lower operating costs due to their reduced energy consumption.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>4. Suitability for Dry Climates: Evaporative coolers are particularly effective in dry climates with low humidity levels. In these environments, the cooling effect of water evaporation is more pronounced, leading to more efficient cooling compared to humid areas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5. Air Moisturizing: In addition to cooling the air, evaporative coolers also add moisture to it, which can be beneficial in arid regions where dry air can cause discomfort, such as dry skin, irritated respiratory systems, and static electricity buildup.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>6. Easy Installation and Maintenance: Evaporative air coolers are typically easier to install and maintain compared to traditional air conditioning units. They do not require complex ductwork, and maintenance usually involves simple tasks such as cleaning the water tank and replacing the cooling pads periodically.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>7. Portability: Many evaporative air coolers are designed to be portable, allowing users to move them easily from room to room or even take them outdoors, providing cooling wherever needed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Overall, evaporative air coolers offer an efficient, cost-effective, and environmentally friendly alternative to traditional air conditioning systems, particularly in dry climates.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color"><strong><em>The Best AC Alternatives in Bangladesh</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Top Notch: <a style="color: #0000ff;" href="https://rkmri.co/o3emyeyNelIR/">Vision Evaporative Super Air Cooler 45L</a></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image"><a href="https://rkmri.co/o3emyeyNelIR/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Vision_Evaporative_Air_Cooler_45L_Super_-Vision-783eb-366674-300x300.jpeg" alt="Vision_Evaporative_Air_Cooler"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><b>কেন কিনবেন?</b><br> <b>এসির তুলনায় দাম অনেক কম</b>শক্তিশালী মোটরহেভি ডিউটি Turbo মোটরফ্যান ব্লেড ইঞ্জিনিয়ারড অ্যাঙ্গেলে করা<strong>ব্যবহারকারী সহজে ব্যবহার করতে পারে</strong>পরিবেশ বান্ধবনীরব, অযাচিত শব্দ নেইবায়ু প্রবাহের দিকনির্দেশের জন্য মোটর চালিত লউভার<strong>মেইনটেন্যান্স খরচ কম</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-tnst8","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-tnst8 { margin-top:28px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-tnst8.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-tnst8 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-tnst8 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:51px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-tnst8 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BUY ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/o3emyeyNelIR/","hoverEffect":"","btnPaddingTop":15,"btnPaddingRight":30,"btnPaddingBottom":15,"btnPaddingLeft":30,"wrpMarginTop":28,"wrpMarginRight":0,"wrp