 28 hours of continuous cooling, eliminating the need for frequent recharges, which is particularly convenient for extended periods of use.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Customizable Cooling:</strong> With 5-speed control and Nature Wind mode, users can adjust the fan\'s settings to suit their preferences, whether they require a gentle breeze for sleep or a powerful blast of cool air.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Quiet Operation:</strong> The whisper-quiet operation, with a working noise of less than 45 dB, ensures minimal disturbance, making it suitable for various environments, including bedrooms or offices where noise levels need to be kept low.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Efficient Design:</strong> The brushless DC motor and vertical rotation contribute to efficient performance while maintaining a sleek and modern appearance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Convenient Features:</strong> The timer function, child-lock feature, and fast-charging USB Type-C port enhance usability and safety, catering to diverse user needs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Portability:</strong> Its lightweight and compact design, coupled with the detachable cover for easy cleaning, make it suitable for both stationary and portable use, allowing users to move it between locations effortlessly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Cons:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"ordered":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Limited Warranty Period:</strong> A warranty period of only 7 days might be considered relatively short compared to other products in the market, potentially raising concerns about long-term reliability and after-sales support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>