 on a single charge, ensuring continuous cooling without frequent recharges.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Quiet Operation:</strong> Designed to operate quietly, the fan provides cooling comfort without disruptive noise, making it suitable for use in various settings, including bedrooms or office spaces.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Adjustable Features:</strong> Users can customize their cooling experience with three adjustable speed settings and 360-degree manual rotation, allowing for precise airflow control.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Durable Construction:</strong> Crafted from high-quality materials, the fan is built to last, offering durability and reliability for long-term use.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Cons:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"ordered":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Limited Warranty:</strong> The product comes with a relatively short warranty period of only 7 days, which may raise concerns about long-term reliability and after-sales support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Charging Time:</strong> The fan\'s charging time of 5-6 hours may be considered relatively lengthy, requiring users to plan ahead for extended use periods.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Limited Color Options:</strong> The fan is available only in brown, limiting choices for customers who prefer alternative color options to match their home decor.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Limited Rotation Angle:</strong> While the fan offers 360-degree manual rotation, some users may find the absence of automated oscillation limiting in terms of coverage area.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Variable Performance:</strong> The fan\'s wind speed and operating time may vary depending on usage conditions, potentially leading to inconsistent performance in certain scenarios.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Moderate Weight:</strong> While relatively lightweight, some users may find the fan\'s weight of 430 grams slightly cumbersome for extended handheld use.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-zuypd","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-zuypd { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-zuypd.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-zuypd .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-zuypd .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(246,144,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-zuypd .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BUY ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/mRpyRemyS3E5/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(246,144,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".wp-admin .eb-parent-eb-button-zuypd { display:block; opacity:1 }.eb-parent-eb-button-zuypd { display:block }","tab":".editor-styles-wrapper.wp-embed-responsive .eb-parent-eb-button-zuypd { display:block; opacity:1 }.eb-parent-eb-button-zuypd { display:block }","mobile":".editor-styles-wrapper.wp-embed-