tic, 90-degree range</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Speed Settings:</strong>&nbsp;3</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Fan Size:</strong>&nbsp;5.5 inches</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Material:</strong>&nbsp;Not specified</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Weight:</strong>&nbsp;Not specified (likely lightweight due to compact size)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Dimensions:</strong>&nbsp;140 x 115 x 229 mm (compact)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Charging Interface:</strong>&nbsp;Type-C</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Additional Features:</strong>&nbsp;Adjustable tilting head</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Pros:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"ordered":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Large Panel and Air Supply:</strong> The 5.5-inch panel and substantial air supply ensure effective cooling, making it suitable for various settings, including desks, tables, or countertops.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Stable and Durable:</strong> The directly connected shaking head structure enhances stability and durability, ensuring reliable performance over time.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Adjustable Panel Angle:</strong> The adjustable panel angle allows users to customize the airflow direction according to their preferences and height requirements, providing personalized comfort.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Powerful Motor and Fan:</strong> Equipped with a high-speed brushless motor and seven-blade fan, the Awei F29 delivers strong airflow across three adjustable speeds, ensuring efficient cooling even in hot conditions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Rechargeable and Portable:</strong> The rechargeable design provides flexibility and convenience, allowing users to place the fan anywhere without the need for a power outlet. Its compact size also enhances portability.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Brushless Servo Motor:</strong> The use of a brushless servo motor contributes to energy efficiency, quieter operation, and longer lifespan compared to traditional brushed motors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Cons:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"ordered":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Limited Warranty:</strong> The product comes with a warranty period of only 7 days, which may not be sufficient for users seeking long-term coverage and support.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Charging Backup Time:</strong> The charging backup time of 3-13 hours may vary depending on usage patterns and battery condition, potentially leading to inconvenience if a longer backup is required.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Limited Color Options:</strong> The fan is available only in black, limiting choices for customers who prefer alternative color options to match their preferences or decor.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>May Require Regular Charging:</strong> Depending on usage, the fan may require frequent recharging, especially at higher speed settings, which could be inconvenient for users who require continuous cooling for extended periods.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Fixed Speed Settings:</strong> While the fan offers three adjustable speeds, some users may prefer additional speed options for more precise control over airflow intensity.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Size and Weight:</strong> While compact and portable, some users may find the dimensions (140 * 115 * 229mm) and weight of the fan slightly bulky for certain applications or travel purposes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Overall, the Awei F29 Desktop Oscillating Rechargeable Fan offers a range of features and benefits, but potential buyers should consider factors such as warranty coverage, charging time, and personal preferences before making a purchase decision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-c1i0x","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-c1i0x { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-c1i0x.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-c1i0x .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-c1i0x .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(246,144,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-c1i0x .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BUY ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/0py5MNIl00yA/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(246,144,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".wp-admin .eb-parent-eb-button-c1i0x { display:block; opacity:1 }.eb-parent-eb-button-c1i0x { display:block }","tab":".editor-styles-wrapper.wp-embed-responsive .eb-parent-eb-button-c1i0x { display:block; opacity:1 }.eb-parent-eb-button-c1i0x { display:block }","mobile":".editor-styles-wrapper.wp-embed-responsive .eb-parent-eb-button-c1i0x { display:block; opacity:1 }.eb-parent-eb-button-c1i0x { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-c1i0x "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-c1i0x"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/0py5MNIl00yA/" rel="noopener">BUY ON ROKOMARI</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":1,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h1 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color"><em>Sera 10 <strong>Latest Reviews</strong></em></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:latest-posts {"postsToShow":10} /-->', 'Rechargeable mini fans are lifesavers during hot weather, especially when you\'re on the go. They\'re compact and lightweight, so you can easily toss one in your bag or purse. Plus, they come in a variety of styles to suit your needs, from handheld fans to clip-on fans to misting fans.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Shoes-Sale_20240423_183348_0002.jpg', 2, NULL, 'publish', 45, 0, '4.67', 39, '2024-04-23 07:57:48', '2024-04-23 07:57:48', '2026-09-18 10:45:38');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (21, 1713, 1, '\\"Nobody\'s Dying - Kew Morse Na\\" - A Kabir Rana Masterpiece', 'nobodys-dying-kew-morse-na-a-kabir-rana-masterpiece', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><em>Who is Kabir Rana?</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kabir Rana, born in 1968 in Kushtia, is a multifaceted author and educator currently serving in a government college. His literary journey is adorned with contributions to various little magazines, showcasing his diverse writing prowess. As the editor of the little mag "Nijkalpa," Rana has played a pivotal role in nurturing emerging voices in the literary sphere.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Renowned for his evocative storytelling, Rana has published several acclaimed works, including the short story collections "Water Comes in Human Ponds(জল আসে মানুষের দীঘিতে)," "The Cartographer(মানচিত্রকর)," "There\'s a Bird Thief in Our Village(আমাদের গ্রামে একটা পাখিচোর আছে)," "Neighbors with Cats(বিড়াল পোষা প্রতিবেশিনীরা)," "Where We Slept(কোথায় কোথায় ঘুমিয়েছিলাম) ," and "Expired Security(মেয়াদোত্তীর্ণ নিরাপত্তাসমূহ)." His novel "Nobody\'s Dying(কেউ মরছে না)" stands as a testament to his narrative depth and ability to delve into the complexities of human existence. Through his writing, Rana captures the intricacies of life, often exploring themes of identity, community, and the human condition with poignant insight.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":1714,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/165617_129.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-1714"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color"><em>Why Kabir Rana is must-read?</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zkcJ0u82hGY","type":"video","providerNameSlug":"youtube","responsive":true,"className":"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zkcJ0u82hGY\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kabir Rana stands as a luminary in the realm of Bangladeshi contemporary fiction, renowned for his captivating short stories and novels that intricately weave together elements of reality and the fantastical. His mastery lies in the realm of Magical Realism, where he effortlessly blends the mundane with the magical, crafting narratives that resonate deeply with readers. In a time where escapism is sought after, Rana\'s works serve as a refuge, offering readers an enchanting journey into worlds where the ordinary is intertwined with the extraordinary. Through his unique storytelling prowess, Rana not only entertains but also prompts introspection, inviting readers to explore profound themes embedded within the folds of his narratives. As such, delving into Rana\'s literary creations becomes not only a pleasure but also a necessity in this contemporary age, where the allure of imagination and the depth of human experience converge in his prose, offering solace and enlightenment alike.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><em>About Nobody\'s Dying - <a href="https://rkmri.co/eA5M20M2oeME/">কেউ মরছে না</a></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":1715,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/eA5M20M2oeME/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/FireShot-Capture-012-কেউ-মরছে-না-_-কবীর-রানা-Keu-Morche-Na_-Kabir-Rana-Rokomari.com_-www.rokomari.com_.png" alt="" class="wp-image-1715"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>নিজকল্পা ইবনে বতুতার গ্রাম। এ গ্রামের কেউ মরছে না, কিছুই মরছে না। দুনিয়ার সকল গ্রাম ঘুরে ইবনে বতুতা ফিরে এসেছে নিজের গ্রাম নিজকল্পায়। সে প্রতিদিন আবিষ্কার করছে নিজ গ্রামকে। এ গ্রামের ঐতিহাসিক দিদার ফকির তাকে চেনাচ্ছে এ গ্রাম। এ গ্রাম পৃথিবীর প্রথম গ্রাম। এ গ্রাম চিনলে পৃথিবীর সকল গ্রাম চেনা যাবে, পৃথিবীর সকল মানুষ চেনা যাবে। চেনা যাবে পৃথিবীর সকল চিন্তা, স্বপ্ন, সৌন্দর্য, দর্শন , রাজনীতি, অর্থনীতি, ইতিহাসনীতি, প্রত্ননীতি। এ গ্রামে কোনো মৃত্যু নাই। মানুষ মৃত্যুকে জয় করার জন্য যেসব প্যারালেল ওয়ার্ল্ড আবিষ্কার করেছে, ভ্রমণ আবিষ্কার করেছে, সেসব কথা আছে এই উপন্যাসে।<br>মানুষ অমরতা আবিষ্কার করেছে তার নানা চিন্তা, স্বপ্ন, আবিষ্কার আর ভ্রমণ দিয়ে। চিন্তা, স্বপ্ন, কল্পনার ভ্রমণের ঘোর-লাগা এ উপন্যাস। উপন্যাসের শুরু থেকে শেষ পর্যন্ত একজন পাঠক থাকবে সে ঘোরের ভেতর। হয়তো এই প্রথমবার পাঠক আবিষ্কার করবে সবকিছুর অমরতা। এ উপন্যাস কোনো কালের নয়, সব কালের; কোনো একক মানুষের নয়, সব মানুষের। এ উপন্যাস পাঠে ভ্রমণ করা হবে পৃথিবীর সকল চিন্তা, দর্শন, রাজনীতি, অর্থনীতি, মানুষ, প্রকৃতি, স্বপ্ন, দুঃস্বপ্ন, প্রেম, অপ্রেম। উপন্যাস পাঠের পর যদি কেউ বলে, সব কাল এক কাল, সব স্থান এক স্থানÑতাকে ভুল প্রমাণ করার কেউ থাকবে না। তবে ভ্রমণে যাওয়া যেতে পারে অমর গ্রাম নিজকল্পায়, যা ইবনে বতুতার গ্রাম, আমাদের সবার গ্রাম।</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><em>Readers Opinions</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class="wp-block-quote"><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|ast-global-color-1"}}}},"textColor":"ast-global-color-1"} -->\n<p class="has-ast-global-color-1-color has-text-color has-link-color"><em><strong>Shumogno Shubid</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>A book that conveys a lot of thoughts. Its syntax isn\'t conventional, and that\'s what makes it exceptionally pleasant to read.</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class="wp-block-quote"><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|ast-global-color-0"}}}},"textColor":"ast-global-color-0"} -->\n<p class="has-ast-global-color-0-color has-text-color has-link-color"><em><strong>Anonymous</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>বইটি সবার পড়া দরকার বলে মনে করি, কেননা বইটি অনন্য ব্যক্তিত্ব গঠনের জন্য সহায়ক হবে। লেখকের কাছে থেকে আরও নতুন বই পাওয়ার প্রত্যাশায় রইলাম।</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class="wp-block-quote"><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|ast-global-color-0"}}}},"textColor":"ast-global-color-0"} -->\n<p class="has-ast-global-color-0-color has-text-color has-link-color"><em><strong>Anonymous</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>"কেউ মরছে না" বইটির শব্দ চয়ন,সিনটেক্স, চরিত্র এবং বণনা এক কথায় অসাধারণ।</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class="wp-block-quote"><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|ast-global-color-0"}}}},"textColor":"ast-global-color-0"} -->\n<p class="has-ast-global-color-0-color has-text-color has-link-color"><em><strong>Anonymous</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>অসাধারণ বই। একাধিকবার পড়ার মতো বই এটি।লেখককে ধন্যবাদ।</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><em>বইটির তথ্য:</em></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>শিরোনাম: কেউ মরছে না</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>লেখক: কবীর রানা</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>প্রকাশক: দেশ পাবলিকেশনস</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item 