ualities (more research might be needed to confirm its specific sustainability attributes).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Comfort:</strong> Boasts a 160+ GSM fabric, indicating a medium weight that could be breathable and comfortable for summer wear.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Quality:</strong> Goes through a 100% QC Check, aiming to ensure consistent quality throughout.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Style:</strong> Features a classic half-sleeve and round collar design, offering a versatile look.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Size Chart:</strong> Available in sizes M to XXL for a good fit range. Here\'s the breakdown:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>M: Chest 38 inches, Length 27 inches</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>L: Chest 40 inches, Length 28 inches</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>XL: Chest 42 inches, Length 29 inches</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>XXL: Chest 44 inches, Length 30 inches</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Price:</strong> Listed as "reasonable," suggesting it falls within your 300 taka budget.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This t-shirt could be a good option if you prioritize sustainability and classic style at an affordable price.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-24ux6","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 .eb-button-anchor { background-colo