st --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong> This set provides a complete outfit at a potentially affordable price. It emphasizes comfort and ease of wear.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-mklae","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BUY ON DARAZ","buttonURL":"https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_C6Shwb","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }.root-eb-button-mklae { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-mklae"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-mklae "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-mklae"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_C6Shwb" rel="noopener">BUY ON DARAZ</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">6. <strong><em>Navy Cool Combo</em></strong>: Printed T-Shirt &amp; Pant Set</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":1934,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CWP2hH"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2a2e8c67d5543151364f4faff237e451.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-1934"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This summer combo offers a stylish and potentially budget-friendly option (under 300 taka based on Bangladeshi pricing) with a printed twist. Here\'s a breakdown of the t-shirts:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Price:</strong> Not explicitly mentioned, but being a two-piece set, there\'s a chance it falls within your budget.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Style:</strong> Features a printed design on the navy blue t-shirt, adding a touch of personality to your look.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Comfort:</strong> Made from a cotton-polyester blend (GSM around 160), which can offer breathability from cotton and durability from polyester.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> A blend of cotton and polyester. Cotton provides breathability, while polyester adds wrinkle resistance and durability.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Versatility:</strong> The navy blue color is versatile, and the printed design can elevate a casual outfit.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Size:</strong> No size chart provided, so check with the seller for available sizes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Pros:</strong> This combo provides a complete outfit with a stylish printed element, potentially at an affordable price. The cotton-polyester blend offers a balance of comfort and practicality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This set could be a great option if you prioritize a stylish and potentially affordable summer outfit with a printed design. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-jxr7n","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BUY ON FABRILIFE","buttonURL":"https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CWP2hH","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-jxr7n { display:block }.root-eb-button-jxr7n { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-jxr7n { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-jxr7n { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-b