tion for everyday wear. Without knowing the price, it\'s difficult to say definitively whether it falls under your budget of 700 taka.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-5011y","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:51px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BUY ON FABRILIFE","buttonURL":"https://fabrilife.com/product/71914-single-jersey-knitted-cotton-polo-anthra-melange?ref=HEARTLOCKER","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"51","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-5011y { display:block }.root-eb-button-5011y { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-5011y { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-5011y { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-5011y"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-5011y "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-5011y"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://fabrilife.com/product/71914-single-jersey-knitted-cotton-polo-anthra-melange?ref=HEARTLOCKER" rel="noopener">BUY ON FABRILIFE</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->', 'Polo shirts are a must-have for any closet. They\'re great for casual Fridays, trips on the weekend, or even a little smart casual at work. But it can be hard to find a good polo shirt that fits the bill, especially if you are on a tight budget.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Red-Modern-Summer-Sale-Facebook-Post_20240507_122050_0000.jpg', 5, NULL, 'publish', 52, 0, '4.51', 20, '2024-05-06 20:21:34', '2024-05-06 20:21:34', '2026-09-18 10:45:38');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (34, 2086, 1, '10 Bestseller Books of Humayun Ahmed', '10-best-books-of-humayun-ahmed', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the most famous and important writers in Bangladeshi writing is Humayun Ahmed. His many literary works, such as books, short stories, and plays, have left an indelible mark on the country\'s literary scene. The goal of this blog post is to look at the important things that Humayun did.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He was born in Mohongonj, Netrokona, a small town in Bangladesh, on November 13, 1948. He graduated and then went on to get a master\'s degree in chemistry from Dhaka University. Even though Ahmed had a background in science, his love of books and writing grew a lot while he was in college.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ahmed\'s books often showed how people really live in Bangladesh. His writing style easily mixed satire, humor, and moving stories. Some of his most well-known <a href="/?s=books">books</a> are "<strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/ARNE2TopE3NM/">Nondito Noroke</a></em></strong>," "<strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/MReTlpp3N0AN/">Shonkhonil Karagar</a></em></strong>," and "<strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/2AeTeM5eyAIM/">Gouripur Junction</a></em></strong>" are some of his works. These books talk about many social problems, like poverty, corruption, and the struggles of groups that are on the outside.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/eSmo0eMT2epy/">Misir Ali Series</a></em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2089,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/eSmo0eMT2epy/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Misir_Ali_Samagra_1-Humayun_Ahmed-3ad64-56.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2089"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>he Misir Ali series is a captivating blend of psychology and suspense. Penned by Bangladeshi author Humayun Ahmed, the series features Misir Ali, a professor of psychology with a keen interest in parapsychology.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Misir Ali tackles perplexing psychological issues, offering a unique perspective that sheds light on the human mind. The stories are woven in a way that keeps the reader on the edge of their seat, eager to unravel the mysteries alongside Misir Ali.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The series has garnered immense popularity not just in Bangladesh but also among Bengali literature enthusiasts worldwide. With over 20 books, the Misir Ali series is a treasure trove for readers seeking a thrilling exploration of the human psyche.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-kf1a8","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/eSmo0eMT2epy/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-kf1a8 { display:block }.root-eb-button-kf1a8 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-kf1a8 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-kf1a8 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-kf1a8"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-kf1a8 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-kf1a8"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/eSmo0eMT2epy/" rel="noopener">CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/eMTM3yeMSe3R/">Himu Series</a></em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2090,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/eMTM3yeMSe3R/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/f7b4fe493_201.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2090"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Himu is a captivating character created by the renowned Bangladeshi author Humayun Ahmed. Unlike a traditional series with a linear storyline, the Himu series features Himu appearing in a collection of disjointed novels. Each book unveils a new facet of Himu\'s personality and explores unique themes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Himu\'s enigmatic charm lies in his unconventional approach to life. He possesses a unique blend of wisdom, wit, and humor that shines through in every story. Readers are drawn to Himu\'s ability to find the extraordinary in the ordinary and his insightful observations on life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Himu series is a delightful treasure for readers seeking a heartwarming and thought-provoking exploration of life\'s complexities. Each book offers a fresh perspective, leaving a lasting impression on the reader.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-24ux6","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/eMTM3yeMSe3R/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 { display:block }.root-eb-button-24ux6 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-24ux6"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-24ux6"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/eMTM3yeMSe3R/" rel="noopener">CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><a href="https://rkmri.co/ARNE2TopE3NM/"><strong><em>Nondito Noroke</em></strong></a></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2092,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/ARNE2TopE3NM/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/53db8fb15_1162.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2092"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nondito Noroke (translated as "In Blissful Hell" in English) is a thought-provoking novel written by Bangladeshi author Humayun Ahmed. Published in 1972, it was actually Ahmed\'s debut novel, written while he was still an undergraduate student at the University of Dhaka.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The novel delves into critical social issues, addressing societal norms and challenging prevailing stereotypes. It offers a unique perspective on the struggles faced by women in a patriarchal society.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-wcgb9","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/ARNE2TopE3NM/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }.root-eb-button-wcgb9 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-wcgb9"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-wcgb9"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/ARNE2TopE3NM/" rel="noopener">CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/ImRIeee2y2mp/">Deyal</a></em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2094,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/ImRIeee2y2mp/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1b3707c61_62834.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2094"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Deyal, by Humayun Ahmed, is indeed a critically acclaimed novel that delves into the murky waters of Bangladeshi politics. Here\'s what we know:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Political Landscape:</strong> Published in 2013, Deyal is believed to be a commentary on the socio-political turmoil that followed Bangladesh\'s war of independence. It likely explores the power struggles and complexities that emerged during that period.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Psychological and Moral Dilemmas:</strong> The novel might focus on the psychological toll and moral ambiguities faced by those in positions of power. It could depict the difficult decisions they have to make and the personal consequences of those choices.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Historical Context:</strong> Understanding the historical context of Bangladesh\'s post-independence period would likely enrich your reading experience. Knowing about events like the assassination of Sheikh Mujibur Rahman and the rise of military rule could provide a deeper understanding of the situations and dilemmas presented in the novel.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-cbp1b","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/ImRIeee2y2mp/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b { display:block }.root-eb-button-cbp1b { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-cbp1b"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-cbp1b"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/ImRIeee2y2mp/" rel="noopener">CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/AE2p2ell2N0e/">Science Fiction Collection</a></em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2097,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/AE2p2ell2N0e/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3f05e65b0_1189.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2097"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Humayun Ahmed is considered a pioneer of Bengali science fiction. Though many of his works dabble in the fantastical and surreal, some of his most well-known sci-fi works are in this collection book.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-mklae","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/AE2p2ell2N0e/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }.root-eb-button-mklae { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-mklae"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-mklae "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-mklae"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/AE2p2ell2N0e/" rel="noopener">CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><em><strong><a href="https://rkmri.co/pSTNEo3eNllA/">Jochona O Jononir Golpo</a></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2100,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/pSTNEo3eNllA/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/36dd62638_968.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2100"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em class="">Jochona O Jononir Golpo</em> is a novel written by Bangladeshi author Humayun Ahmed. Published in February 2004, the novel is based on the Bangladesh Liberation War of 1971.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-jxr7n","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/pSTNEo3eNllA/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-jxr7n { display:block }.root-eb-button-jxr7n { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-jxr7n { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-jxr7n { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-jxr7n"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-jxr7n "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-jxr7n"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/pSTNEo3eNllA/" rel="noopener">CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/IApyyA3ylIAe/">Opekkha</a></em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2103,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/IApyyA3ylIAe/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Opekkha-Humayun_Ahmed-9a14b-222273.png" alt="" class="wp-image-2103"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The book Opekkha was written by Humayun Ahmed. The story of this book, like Humayun Ahmed\'s other books, is about a middle-class family. The book shows both the problems that come with being middle class and true love for family and friends.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The novel is quite long for one by Humayun Ahmed. Their other books are generally short. The page number is 220.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-5011y","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/IApyyA3ylIAe/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-5011y { display:block }.root-eb-button-5011y { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-5011y { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-5011y { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-5011y"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-5011y "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-5011y"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/IApyyA3ylIAe/" rel="noopener">CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/MlNMSlNeIo2I/">Badshah Namdar</a></em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2104,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/MlNMSlNeIo2I/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/e71eda8aa_1171.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2104"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Badshah Namdar is a historical novel in Bengali written by Humayun Ahmed. It was published in 2011 by Onno Prokash. The book is considered to be one of the best works of Humayun Ahmed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-frnzc","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-frnzc { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-frnzc.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-frnzc .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-frnzc .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-frnzc .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/MlNMSlNeIo2I/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-frnzc { display:block }.root-eb-button-frnzc { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-frnzc { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-frnzc { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-frnzc"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-frnzc "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-frnzc"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/MlNMSlNeIo2I/" rel="noopener">CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/MReTlpp3N0AN/">Shonkhonil Karagar</a></em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2106,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/MReTlpp3N0AN/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/fef28b5e8_1163.png" alt="" class="wp-image-2106"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Shonkhonil Karagar is a contemporary novel by Bangladeshi writer Humayun Ahmed. It was published in 1973.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-752no","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-752no { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-752no.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-752no .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-752no .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-752no .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/MReTlpp3N0AN/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-752no { display:block }.root-eb-button-752no { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-752no { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-752no { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-752no"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-752no "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-752no"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/MReTlpp3N0AN/" rel="noopener">CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><em><strong><a href="https://rkmri.co/AAoeRmE0MAe0/">Kothau Keu Nei</a></strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2108,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/AAoeRmE0MAe0/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Kothao_Kew_Nei-Humayun_Ahmed-f86bd-1241.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2108"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This heartbreaking story follows Muna, who lives with her idealistic uncle and his family, and Baker Bhai, a biker gang boss. As the narrative progresses, Muna takes on more serious obligations, while Baker Bhai devotes himself to assisting others.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This novel is genuine and heartbreaking. Baker Bhai is a timeless character in Bangla literature, whose benevolence and integrity never fail to captivate readers. Muna is elegant and sensible, and her misjudgments and often stiff behavior do not detract from her charm and grace. The novel has an indelible impression on every mind.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-iis2w","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-iis2w { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-iis2w.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-iis2w .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-iis2w .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-iis2w .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/AAoeRmE0MAe0/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-iis2w { display:block }.root-eb-button-iis2w { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-iis2w { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-iis2w { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-iis2w"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-iis2w "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-iis2w"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/AAoeRmE0MAe0/" rel="noopener">CHECK PRICE ON ROKOMARI</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->', 'One of the most famous and important writers in Bangladeshi writing is Humayun Ahmed. His many literary works, such as books, short stories, and plays, have left an indelible mark on the country\'s literary scene.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Orange-Red-Yellow-Modern-Top-10-Youtube-Thumbnail_20240507_225624_0000.jpg', 3, NULL, 'publish', 156, 0, '4.56', 10, '2024-05-07 10:00:32', '2024-05-07 10:00:32', '2026-09-18 10:45:38');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (35, 2128, 1, 'The Most Controversial Books of Bengali Literature', 'the-most-controversial-books-of-bengali-literature', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are many books in Bengali writing that have often gone into controversial areas, starting arguments and questioning social norms. Bengali culture will never be the same because of these controversial works from a wide range of styles and time periods. Bengali literature has always pushed the limits of what is possible in art. It has explored sexuality and gender roles in provocative ways and sharply criticized religious dogma and political beliefs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At the heart of this literary heritage is a strong desire to talk about taboo topics, question accepted beliefs, and make people think. Writers have bravely written about touchy subjects, diving into the complicated nature of human life and the political and social climate with unwavering honesty. Their stories show how complicated Bengali society really is, often by showing its flaws and unfair circumstances.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">5. <strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/MeeN5ES0ERle/">Mukta Mon: Satyer Sandhan, Srishti Rohossho, Onuman Etc</a></em> by Aroj Ali Matubber (2019-Edition)</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2131,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/MeeN5ES0ERle/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Mukto_Mon__Sotyer_Sondhan_Srishti_Rohosy-Aroj_Ali_Matubbar-52f5d-175176-1.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2131"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mukta Mon: Satyer Sandhan, Srishti Rohossho, Onuman Etc" is a collection of essays by Aroj Ali Matubber, published in 2019. Aroj Ali Matubber, a renowned Bangladeshi writer and intellectual, is known for his insightful analysis of various socio-political issues and his commitment to promoting secularism, humanism, and rationalism.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In this collection, Matubber explores a wide range of topics, delving into the complexities of contemporary society, politics, and culture. From probing examinations of religious fundamentalism and communalism to reflections on literature, philosophy, and human rights, Matubber\'s essays offer thought-provoking insights into the challenges facing Bangladesh and the broader global community.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-wcgb9","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BUY NOW","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/MeeN5ES0ERle/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }.root-eb-button-wcgb9 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-wcgb9"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-wcgb9"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/MeeN5ES0ERle/" rel="noopener">BUY NOW</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">4. <strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/M2yRETomle03/">Paradoxical Sajid</a> by Arif Azad</em></strong> (2017)</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2132,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/M2yRETomle03/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/b2edadac5cd4_129384.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2132"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>"Paradoxical Sajid" by Arif Azad presents a narrative centered around the conflict between atheists and a devout Muslim character named Sajid. The book portrays Sajid as adept at using logical arguments to counter the atheist perspective, positioning him as intellectually superior in these exchanges. However, some readers have criticized the portrayal of the atheist character as not being sufficiently robust or compelling in their arguments, thus weakening the overall conflict and tension within the narrative.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-cbp1b","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BUY NOW","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/M2yRETomle03/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b { display:block }.root-eb-button-cbp1b { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-cbp1b"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-cbp1b"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/M2yRETomle03/" rel="noopener">BUY NOW</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">4. <strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/Aee5oyeeo25e/">Naree</a> by Humayan Azad</em></strong> (1992)</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2130,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/Aee5oyeeo25e/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Nari-Humayun_Azad-073d4-2411.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2130"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Humayun Azad wrote the 1992 Bangladeshi book Naree, which means "woman" in English. It is an non-fiction book on feminism. The book was banned by the government of Bangladesh on November 19, 1995, because it was thought to be dangerous. But after a court case that Azad won, the ban was lifted five years later, in 2000. The ban wasn\'t legal, according to the High Court of Bangladesh.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-24ux6","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:51px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BUY NOW","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/Aee5oyeeo25e/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"51","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 { display:block }.root-eb-button-24ux6 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-24ux6"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-24ux6"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/Aee5oyeeo25e/" rel="noopener">BUY NOW</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">2. <strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/SeI0mIy2Mopy/">Agnibina</a> by Kazi Nazrul Islam</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2133,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/SeI0mIy2Mopy/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/393be1e52_5612.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2133"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>"Agnibina" by Kazi Nazrul Islam, one of the most celebrated poets and literary figures in Bengali literature, is often considered controversial due to its revolutionary themes and bold expressions of dissent against societal norms and injustices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here are some reasons why "Agnibina" is perceived as controversial:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"ordered":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Revolutionary Themes</strong>: "Agnibina" is known for its revolutionary themes, advocating for social justice, freedom, and equality. Nazrul\'s poems in this collection express radical ideas and challenge the existing power structures, including colonialism, religious orthodoxy, and social hierarchy. His fervent call for revolution and resistance against oppression was seen as a direct challenge to the status quo and stirred controversy among conservative circles.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Anti-Establishment Stance</strong>: Nazrul\'s poems in "Agnibina" often criticize authority figures, including rulers, clergy, and oppressors. His bold and uncompromising stance against tyranny and exploitation, coupled with his fiery rhetoric, unsettled those in positions of power and authority. This anti-establishment sentiment was perceived as subversive by some, leading to attempts to censor or suppress his works.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Religious Critique</strong>: Nazrul\'s critique of religious dogma and orthodoxy in "Agnibina" also sparked controversy. He challenged traditional interpretations of Islam and Hinduism, advocating for a more inclusive and egalitarian understanding of religion. This questioning of religious authority and norms, coupled with his embrace of syncretic elements, drew criticism from conservative religious groups.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Despite the controversy surrounding "Agnibina," the collection remains a seminal work in Bengali literature, showcasing Nazrul\'s poetic genius and his unwavering commitment to social justice and freedom of expression. It continues to inspire readers and writers alike, challenging them to confront societal injustices and strive for a more equitable and compassionate world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-mklae","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BUY NOW","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/SeI0mIy2Mopy/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }.root-eb-button-mklae { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-mklae"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-mklae "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-mklae"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/SeI0mIy2Mopy/" rel="noopener">BUY NOW</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. <strong><em>Lajja (Shame) by Taslima Nasrin (1993)</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":2129,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/images.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2129"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Lajja is a Bengali novel by Bangladeshi author Taslima Nasrin. The rioting, rape, looting, and murders of Bengali Hindus that occurred in December 1992 following the demolishment of the Babri Masjid in India are the subject of this book. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The book was first published in Bengali in 1993 and then outlawed by Bangladesh. In the six months following its release, it nevertheless sold 50,000 copies, but Taslima fled her own Bangladesh after getting death threats from Islamic organizations. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-z185t","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-z185t { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-z185t.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-z185t .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-z185t .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(168,168,168,1); border-radius:51px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-z185t .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"THIS BOOK IS NOT AVAILABLE IN BANGLADESH","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(168,168,168,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"51","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-z185t { display:block }.root-eb-button-z185t { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-z185t { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-z185t { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-z185t"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-z185t "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-z185t"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="" rel="noopener">THIS BOOK IS NOT AVAILABLE IN BANGLADESH</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->', 'There are many books in Bengali writing that have often gone into controversial areas, starting arguments and questioning social norms. Bengali culture will never be the same because of these controversial works from a wide range of styles and time periods.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Colorful-Bold-5-Timestable-Multiplication-Math-Facts-Quiz_20240508_224017_0000.jpg', 3, NULL, 'publish', 66, 0, '4.64', 21, '2024-05-08 09:36:55', '2024-05-08 09:36:55', '2026-09-18 10:45:38');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (36, 2157, 1, '4 Best Scientific Calculators for Students in Bangladesh', '4-best-scientific-calculators-in-bangladesh', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the bustling educational scene of Bangladesh, students rely on dependable tools to conquer complex calculations. When it comes to scientific exploration and mathematical mastery, a scientific calculator becomes an essential companion. But with a variety of options available, selecting the perfect one can feel overwhelming. This guide dives into the top choices for scientific calculators in <a href="/?s=Bangladesh">Bangladesh</a>, equipping you to make an informed decision and conquer your academic journey with confidence.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Necessity of Scientific Calculators:</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Scientific tools are not just "nice to have" for students who want to learn more about math and science. You have to have them for these reasons:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Powerhouse of Functions: </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Scientific computers, on the other hand, have a huge number of functions. They do complicated math with trigonometry, logarithms, exponents, and other concepts that are important in many scientific areas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br>Efficiency and Accuracy: </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Picture having to solve a huge number of problems that have fractions, roots, and many steps. Scientific calculators make the process easier by giving you accurate answers quickly. This saves you time and keeps mistakes to a minimum.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br>Advanced Math Made Easier: </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Scientific computers are very useful as you learn more about science and math. They can work with matrices, solve problems with variables, and do other complicated math that would be very time-consuming to do by hand.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><br>Exploring New Ideas: </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Scientific tools let you explore new areas of math. By doing complicated numbers for you, they let you focus on understanding the ideas themselves, which helps you understand the subject better.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|ast-global-color-8"}}}},"textColor":"ast-global-color-8"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-ast-global-color-8-color has-text-color has-link-color">Four Best Original Scientific Calculators Available in Bangladesh</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">1. <strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/eNAeR5I0RAee/">Casio fx-991ES Plus:</a></em></strong> A Total Pack</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is a popular choice for students because it\'s relatively affordable and has a wide range of features, including 417 functions, natural textbook display, and the ability to solve equations with variables.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2158,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/eNAeR5I0RAee/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/FireShot-Capture-073-Original-Casio-Scientific-Calculator-fx-991ES-Plus-2-Best-Price-in-Ba_-www.rokomari.com_.png" alt="" class="wp-image-2158"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:pullquote -->\n<figure class="wp-block-pullquote"><blockquote><p>This is a good product . this is very useful for the students of school , college or admission as they should do some big operations in trigonometry and it is also useful in conversions in digital electronics this also had a guide as we purchase it through which we can learn how to use this calculator as this performs more operations when compared to normal calculator.</p><cite>Customer Review</cite></blockquote></figure>\n<!-- /wp:pullquote -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-askkb","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-askkb { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-askkb.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-askkb .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-askkb .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:51px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-askkb .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳2,220 ‍at Rokomari","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/eNAeR5I0RAee/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"51","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-askkb { display:block }.root-eb-button-askkb { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-askkb { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-askkb { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-askkb"><div class="eb-