preciate fashion without compromising on functionality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The watch features a 32mm analog dial protected by durable Hardlex glass, offering excellent resistance against everyday scratches. Its reliable Japan Quartz movement ensures accurate timekeeping, while the long-lasting battery provides up to three years of dependable performance. The luminous hands make it easy to read the time in low-light conditions, adding extra convenience to daily use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With a comfortable bracelet clasp and a sleek, lightweight design, the Curren 9052 is suitable for work, parties, and casual outings. It also offers 3 ATM water resistance, making it safe from light splashes and rain. Backed by a 12-month warranty, this elegant timepiece delivers impressive value for women seeking style, quality, and affordability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button {"textColor":"vivid-red","className":"is-style-outline","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-element-button" href="https://rkmri.co/Apy5EISpMA22/">Buy Now</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em>3. Casio Analog Dial Ladies Watch - LQ-139L-4B2DF</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'re searching for a lightweight and elegant everyday wristwatch, the <strong>Casio Analog Dial Ladies Watch LQ-139L-4B2DF</strong> is an excellent option. Its beautiful peach-pink leather strap, paired with a clean white analog dial, creates a feminine and timeless design that complements both casual and formal outfits. The compact 25mm round case and ultra-lightweight construction ensure maximum comfort, making it ideal for all-day wear.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Powered by a reliable Japanese Quartz movement, this watch offers precise timekeeping with an accuracy of ±20 seconds per month. The durable mineral glass protects the dial from everyday scratches, while the resin case keeps the watch lightweight without compromising durability. A 30-meter water resistance rating provides protection against splashes and light rain, and the long-lasting battery delivers approximately three years of worry-free performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Backed by Casio\'s trusted quality and a 3-year warranty, the <strong>LQ-139L-4B2DF</strong> is a stylish, practical, and affordable choice for women looking for a dependable watch that combines elegance, comfort, and everyday functionality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button {"textColor":"vivid-red","className":"is-style-outline","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-element-button" href="https://rkmri.co/lE35TMMS23NT/">Buy Now</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em>4. CURREN 9092 New Rhinestone Fashion Women Elegant Quartz Watch</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>CURREN 9092 New Rhinestone Fashion Women Elegant Quartz Watch</strong> is a stylish accessory designed for women who love a touch of sparkle in their everyday fashion. Featuring a sophisticated dial adorned with elegant rhinestone accents, this watch effortlessly adds charm and luxury to both casual and formal outfits. Whether you\'re heading to the office, attending a party, or celebrating a special occasion, the CURREN 9092 complements your style with its refined and fashionable appearance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Powered by a reliable quartz movement, the watch offers accurate timekeeping while requiring minimal maintenance. Its sleek design and comfortable fit make it suitable for extended daily wear, and the durable construction ensures long-lasting performance. The elegant finish and eye-catching details make it more than just a timepiece—it\'s a fashionable statement accessory.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Manufactured in China under the trusted <strong>CURREN</strong> brand, the <strong>CURREN 9092</strong> is an excellent choice for women seeking an affordable yet elegant wristwatch. It combines modern style, dependable performance, and everyday practicality, making it a perfect addition to any watch collection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button {"textColor":"vivid-red","className":"is-style-outline","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-element-button" href="https://rkmri.co/Iell2ARIpemN/">Buy Now</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em>5. POEDAGAR Watch for Women - 719</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>POEDAGAR Watch for Women 719</strong> is a stylish analog wristwatch that combines modern elegance with practical everyday functionality. Crafted with a premium stainless steel case and matching stainless steel bracelet, this watch offers a sophisticated look that pairs effortlessly with both casual and formal attire. Its slim 6mm case thickness and 32mm dial create a sleek, feminine profile that sits comfortably on the wrist, making it ideal for all-day wear.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Designed for durability, the POEDAGAR 719 features a sturdy stainless steel construction and water-resistant design, providing protection against everyday splashes and light rain. The secure push-button hidden clasp ensures a comfortable fit while giving the bracelet a seamless, premium appearance. Its minimalist analog display offers clear readability, making it a practical choice for daily use as well as office meetings, parties, and special occasions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Backed by a <strong>12-month warranty</strong>, the <strong>POEDAGAR Watch for Women 719</strong> delivers excellent value for money. With its elegant styling, durable build quality, and comfortable fit, this watch is an ideal choice for women looking for an affordable yet fashionable timepiece that complements any wardrobe.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button {"textColor":"vivid-red","className":"is-style-outline","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-element-button" href="https://rkmri.co/MEyoeNNIo0pT/">Buy Now</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em>6. Olevs Japan Movement Exclusive Ladies Watch - 5501</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>OLEVS Japan Movement Exclusive Ladies Watch 5501</strong> is a sophisticated timepiece designed for women who appreciate elegance, precision, and everyday comfort. Featuring a unique rectangular dial, this watch offers a modern alternative to traditional round designs, making it a stylish accessory for both casual and formal occasions. The premium stainless steel strap, paired with a sleek push-button hidden clasp, provides a secure and comfortable fit while enhancing its luxurious appearance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Powered by a dependable <strong>Japan movement</strong>, the OLEVS 5501 delivers accurate timekeeping with long-lasting battery performance. The coated glass protects the dial from daily wear, while the luminous hands improve visibility in low-light conditions. Its lightweight construction and slim 7.5mm case ensure comfortable all-day wear without feeling bulky.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With a <strong>3 ATM water resistance</strong> rating, the watch can withstand light rain, hand washing, and everyday splashes, making it practical for daily use. Combining elegant styling, durable materials, and dependable performance, the <strong>OLEVS 5501</strong> is an excellent choice for women looking for a fashionable yet affordable wristwatch that complements any wardrobe with timeless charm.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button {"textColor":"vivid-red","className":"is-style-outline","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-element-button" href="https://rkmri.co/ySMRAoeyNMeR/">Buy Now</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em>7. Q And Q White Dial Watch For Women - AA37-J017Y</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>Q&amp;Q White Dial Watch for Women AA37-J017Y</strong> is a beautiful combination of timeless elegance and dependable Japanese craftsmanship. Featuring a polished gold-tone stainless steel bracelet and a clean white analog dial, this watch adds a sophisticated touch to both everyday outfits and formal attire. Its 38mm round metal case offers a bold yet elegant appearance, while the durable mineral glass helps protect the dial from everyday scratches.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Powered by a <strong>Japanese Quartz movement</strong> manufactured by <strong>Miyota (Citizen Watch Co.)</strong>, the watch delivers reliable accuracy of approximately <strong>±20 seconds per month</strong>, ensuring precise timekeeping with minimal maintenance. The three-hand analog display provides clear readability, and the long-lasting <strong>SR626SW battery</strong> offers around three years of dependable performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With <strong>30-meter water resistance</strong>, the AA37-J017Y can handle light rain and accidental splashes, making it suitable for daily wear, though it is not intended for swimming or diving. Combining elegant styling, durable stainless steel construction, and trusted Japanese movement, the <strong>Q&amp;Q AA37-J017Y</strong> is an excellent choice for women seeking a stylish, reliable, and affordable wristwatch.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button {"textColor":"vivid-red","className":"is-style-outline","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-element-button" href="https://rkmri.co/p3E55eeT5SAy/">Buy Now</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em>8. Blisbond Pearl AMOLED Display Bluetooth Calling Smart Watch for Women Review</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>he <strong>Blisbond Pearl AMOLED Display Bluetooth Calling Smart Watch for Women</strong> is a stylish and feature-rich smartwatch designed for modern women who want both fashion and functionality. Its vibrant <strong>1.75-inch AMOLED display</strong> with a sharp <strong>466 × 466 resolution</strong> delivers crisp visuals and excellent visibility, even in bright outdoor conditions. The elegant pink and golden color options, combined with a lightweight 30.8g design and soft silicone strap, ensure comfortable all-day wear.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Equipped with <strong>Bluetooth 5.3</strong>, the smartwatch supports <strong>Bluetooth calling</strong> through its built-in speaker and microphone, allowing you to answer calls directly from your wrist. It also includes advanced health features such as <strong>heart rate monitoring</strong>, <strong>SpO2 tracking</strong>, <strong>women\'s health monitoring</strong>, sleep tracking, and supports over <strong>100 sports modes</strong> to help you stay active. Additional features like <strong>music control</strong>, <strong>NFC support</strong>, and compatibility with Android and iOS devices make it a versatile daily companion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Powered by a <strong>260mAh battery</strong>, the watch offers <strong>7–10 days of battery life</strong> on a single charge and is fully recharged in about two hours using magnetic charging. With <strong>IP68 water resistance</strong> and a <strong>12-month warranty</strong>, the <strong>Blisbond Pearl Smart Watch</strong> is an excellent choice for women seeking a fashionable, reliable, and feature-packed smartwatch.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button {"textColor":"vivid-red","className":"is-style-outline","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-element-button" href="https://rkmri.co/5SMMeIEM0ART/">Buy Now</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em>9. SKMEI 1400 Stainless Steel Analog Watch for Women Review: Minimalist Style with Everyday Durability</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>SKMEI 1400 Stainless Steel Analog Watch for Women</strong> is a stylish and practical timepiece that combines modern elegance with dependable everyday performance. Its unique <strong>22mm rectangular dial</strong> gives the watch a sophisticated and contemporary look, making it an ideal accessory for office wear, casual outings, and special occasions. The polished stainless steel bracelet with a hidden clasp enhances its premium appearance while ensuring a secure and comfortable fit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Powered by a reliable quartz movement, the SKMEI 1400 delivers accurate timekeeping with minimal maintenance. The durable zinc alloy case provides strength without adding unnecessary weight, and at just <strong>57 grams</strong>, the watch remains comfortable for extended daily wear. The stainless steel band is resistant to corrosion, making it suitable for regular use in different weather conditions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With a <strong>3 ATM water resistance</strong> rating, the watch can withstand everyday splashes, hand washing, and light rain, although it is not designed for swimming or diving. Backed by a <strong>12-month warranty</strong>, the <strong>SKMEI 1400</strong> offers excellent value for women looking for an affordable, elegant, and durable analog wristwatch that complements both formal and casual styles.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button {"textColor":"vivid-red","className":"is-style-outline","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-element-button" href="https://rkmri.co/NeIE2Roe5AEe/">Buy Now</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Poedagar 783 Luxury Rose Gold Ladies Watch Review: A Unique Blend of Elegance and Style</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>Poedagar 783 Luxury Rose Gold Ladies Watch</strong> is a fashionable timepiece designed for women who want to stand out with a unique and elegant accessory. Its eye-catching <strong>irregular-shaped dial</strong> sets it apart from traditional watch designs, while the luxurious <strong>rose gold stainless steel bracelet</strong> adds a touch of sophistication that complements both casual and formal outfits. Whether you\'re attending a party, heading to work, or enjoying a special occasion, this watch enhances your overall look with effortless style.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Powered by a reliable <strong>quartz movement</strong>, the Poedagar 783 provides accurate and dependable timekeeping for everyday use. The <strong>luminous hands</strong> make it easy to read the time in low-light environments, while the <strong>waterproof design</strong> offers protection against everyday splashes and light rain, making it practical for daily wear. Its durable stainless steel construction also ensures long-lasting performance and a premium feel.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Combining a distinctive design, elegant rose gold finish, and practical features, the <strong>Poedagar 783 Women Watch</strong> is an excellent choice for women seeking an affordable luxury watch that delivers both fashion and functionality in one stylish package.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button {"textColor":"vivid-red","className":"is-style-outline","style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-element-button" href="https://rkmri.co/loemNEy2eeee/">Buy Now</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->', 'In the heart of Bangladesh, where fashion meets function, there\'s a perfect timepiece waiting for every woman\'s wrist. Whether you crave timeless elegance or a touch of playful personality, 2024 offers a stunning selection of watches to elevate your style.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/NEW-ARRIVAL-ELEGANT-WATCH-INSTAGRAM-POST_20240519_211606_0000.jpg', 5, NULL, 'publish', 1505, 0, '4.79', 45, '2024-05-13 20:41:46', '2024-05-13 20:41:46', '2026-09-18 15:33:45');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (40, 2238, 1, 'Oppo A38 Review : Feature Packed Budget Option', 'oppo-a38-review-big-battery-big-screen-on-a-budget-in-bangladesh', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="/?s=oppo">Oppo</a> A38</em></strong> Review, Specs</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In September 2023, the affordable smartphone Oppo A38 was introduced. With a weight of 190 grams and a thin 8.2mm profile, it boasts a stylish appearance. Bright images are guaranteed even in direct sunshine thanks to the 6.56-inch IPS LCD display\'s peak brightness of 720 nits and seamless 90Hz refresh rate. The ratio of the screen to the body is a remarkable 84.2%.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2252,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CYQHtz"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/a38-black.png" alt="" class="wp-image-2252"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Top specifications:</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Display:</strong> 6.56-inch IPS LCD, 720 x 1612 pixels (HD+), 90Hz refresh rate</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Processor:</strong> MediaTek Helio G85</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>RAM:</strong> 4GB or 6GB</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Storage:</strong> 128GB</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Rear Camera:</strong> Dual camera system: 50MP main sensor + 2MP depth sensor</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Front Camera:</strong> 5MP</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Battery:</strong> 5000mAh with 33W fast charging</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Operating System:</strong> Android 13 (upgradable to Android 14 with ColorOS 14)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Colors:</strong> 3 Colors Available</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Oppo A38\'s internal components include a MediaTek MT6769 Helio G85 CPU and either 4GB or 6GB of RAM. This combination guarantees seamless multitasking and effective execution of daily chores. With a roadmap to upgrade to Android 14 and ColorOS 14, the smartphone is currently running Android 13.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When the lighting is favorable, the 50MP dual-camera combination produces detailed images, while the 5MP front camera is used for selfies. Features that improve photography include panorama, HDR, and LED flash. Nevertheless, video recording is restricted to 1080p at 30 frames per second, and low-light performance is not very good.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Oppo A38\'s long-lasting 5000mAh battery, which allows for 33W rapid charging for speedy top-ups, is another benefit.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Pros</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Affordable price</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Large display with 90Hz refresh rate</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Long battery life with fast charging</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Decent camera performance in good lighting</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Cons</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Average processor</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Unimpressive low-light camera performance</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lacks high refresh rate display</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Overall, the Oppo A38 is a good option for budget-conscious users who are looking for a smartphone with a large display, long battery life, and decent camera performance. If you are a gamer or a power user, you might want to consider a different option with a more powerful processor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-zpr9t","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-zpr9t { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-zpr9t.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-zpr9t .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-zpr9t .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:51px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-zpr9t .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳14,990 at Daraz (4/128)","buttonURL":"https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CYQHtz","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"51","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-zpr9t { display:block }.root-eb-button-zpr9t { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-zpr9t { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-zpr9t { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-zpr9t"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-zpr9t "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-zpr9t"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CYQHtz" rel="noopener">৳14,990 at Daraz (4/128)</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-fcztu","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-fcztu { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-fcztu.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-fcztu .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-fcztu .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:51px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-fcztu .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳15,990 at Daraz (6/128)","buttonURL":" https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_C6qg4X","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"51","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-fcztu { display:block }.root-eb-button-fcztu { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-fcztu { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-fcztu { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-fcztu"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-fcztu "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-fcztu"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_C6qg4X" rel="noopener">৳15,990 at Daraz (6/128)</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->', 'In September 2023, the affordable smartphone Oppo A38 was introduced. With a weight of 190 grams and a thin 8.2mm profile, it boasts a stylish appearance. Bright images are guaranteed even in direct sunshine thanks to the 6.56-inch IPS LCD display\'s peak brightness of 720 nits and seamless 90Hz refresh rate. The ratio of the screen to the body is a remarkable 84.2%.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1_20240516_080856_0000.jpg', 2, NULL, 'publish', 45, 0, '4.58', 32, '2024-05-16 19:54:14', '2024-05-16 19:54:14', '2026-09-18 10:45:38');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (41, 2242, 1, 'Samsung Galaxy A55 : The Perfect Mid-Range Phone in BD?', 'samsung-galaxy-a55-the-perfect-mid-range-phone-in-bangladesh', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <a href="/?s=Samsung">Samsung</a> Galaxy A55 is a strong offering in the mid-range smartphone market, particularly for Bangladeshi users. Here\'s a breakdown of its specs and why it might be a great choice:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Specifications:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Display:</strong> 6.6-inch Super AMOLED with 120Hz refresh rate and HDR10+ support for vibrant colors and smooth visuals.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Processor:</strong> Exynos 1480, offering good performance comparable to the Snapdragon 778G. Handles everyday tasks and some gaming well.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>RAM &amp; Storage:</strong> Comes in variants with 6GB/8GB RAM and 128GB/256GB storage, expandable via microSD card for extra space.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Camera:</strong><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Rear: Triple camera system with a 50MP main sensor, 12MP ultrawide sensor, and a 5MP macro sensor for capturing various shots.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Front: 32MP selfie camera for clear video calls and selfies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Battery:</strong> 5000mAh battery with 25W fast charging, offering good endurance on a single charge.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Why Samsung Galaxy A55 is the best mid-range option in Bangladesh</strong>?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2256,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CY8wHD"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/10261966.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-2256"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Display:</strong> The Super AMOLED display is a major selling point, providing excellent viewing experience for movies, games, and everyday use.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Software:</strong> Runs Android 14 with Samsung\'s One UI on top, ensuring a user-friendly experience with the latest features.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Camera:</strong> The camera system is versatile enough to capture good quality photos in most lighting conditions, especially considering the price range.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> The 5000mAh battery with fast charging is ideal for users who need their phone to last throughout the day.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Brand Reputation:</strong> Samsung is a trusted brand in Bangladesh, offering reliable after-sales service.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Things to Consider:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Performance:</strong> While good for everyday use, the processor might not be ideal for heavy gamers who need top-of-the-line performance.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Competition:</strong> There are other strong mid-range phones in the market, so compare features and prices before deciding.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Overall, the Samsung Galaxy A55 is a compelling option for Bangladeshi users seeking a feature-packed mid-range phone with a gorgeous display, good cameras, and long battery life. It offers excellent value for the price.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-9c7le","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-9c7le { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-9c7le.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-9c7le .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-9c7le .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:51px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-9c7le .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳45,999 at Daraz","buttonURL":"https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CY8wHD","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"51","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-9c7le { display:block }.root-eb-button-9c7le { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-9c7le { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-9c7le { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-9c7le"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-9c7le "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-9c7le"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CY8wHD" rel="noopener">৳45,999 at Daraz</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you are interested in Samsung Galaxy A55, you may also interested in more budget friendly mid-range <strong><em><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CZJt3t">Samsung Galaxy A54 </a></em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'The Samsung Galaxy A55 is a strong offering in the mid-range smartphone market, particularly for Bangladeshi users. Here\'s a breakdown of its specs and why it might be a great choice:', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Gadgets-Store-Presentation_20240516_081239_0000.jpg', 2, NULL, 'publish', 35, 0, '4.87', 43, '2024-05-16 19:59:50', '2024-05-16 19:59:50', '2026-09-18 10:45:38');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (42, 2247, 1, 'The Budget-Minded Bangladeshi User\'s Dream: Realme Note 50 Review', 'the-budget-minded-bangladeshi-users-dream-realme-note-50-review', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em>Realme Note 50</em></strong>: Big Screen, Smooth Scrolling on a Budget</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Looking for a smartphone that won\'t break the bank but still offers a great user experience? The <a href="/?s=realme">realme</a> Note 50 might be the perfect choice for you. Let\'s dive into the specs and see why it excels as a budget-friendly phone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2259,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CWZUNP"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/note-50.png" alt="" class="wp-image-2259"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Specs at a Glance</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Display:</strong> 6.74-inch HD+ LCD display with a 90Hz refresh rate</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Processor:</strong> Unisoc T612 processor</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>RAM:</strong> 4GB or 6GB</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Storage:</strong> 64GB or 128GB (expandable up to 2TB)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Camera:</strong> 13MP rear camera, 8MP front camera</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Battery:</strong> 5000mAh battery with 10W fast charging</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Why It\'s Budget-Friendly</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Note 50 cuts corners strategically to deliver a great experience at a lower price point. Here\'s what makes it budget-friendly:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Affordable Price:</strong> This phone is priced competitively, making it accessible to a wider range of users.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Unisoc Processor:</strong> While not a top-of-the-line chip, the Unisoc T612 processor provides enough power for everyday tasks and light gaming.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>HD+ Display:</strong> The display offers a large screen size and a smooth 90Hz refresh rate, keeping things enjoyable without needing the highest resolution.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Expandable Storage:</strong> With expandable storage options, you can increase storage capacity without a significant price bump.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Beyond the Basics</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While it focuses on affordability, the realme Note 50 doesn\'t skimp on everything. Here are some additional features to consider:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Design:</strong> The phone boasts a sleek design with a comfortable grip and a water-resistant rating (IP54).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Battery Life:</strong> The 5000mAh battery offers excellent battery life, keeping you going throughout the day.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Is the realme Note 50 Right for You?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'re a casual user who prioritizes affordability and a large, smooth display, the realme Note 50 is a great option. It handles everyday tasks well and won\'t disappoint for browsing, social media, and casual gaming. However, if you\'re a power user who needs top-of-the-line performance or a fantastic camera, you might want to look elsewhere.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ultimately, the realme Note 50 proves that you don\'t have to spend a fortune to get a good smartphone experience. It offers excellent value for the price, making it a strong contender in the budget phone market.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-tixwk","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-tixwk { margin-top:0px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:0px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-tixwk.eb-button-alignment { align-items:flex-start }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-tixwk .eb-button { justify-content:flex-start }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-tixwk .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(255,255,255,1); border-width:2px; border-color:rgba(0,0,0,1); border-style:solid; border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:rgba(255,0,0,1); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-tixwk .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"Buy on Daraz (4/128gb)","textColor":"rgba(255,0,0,1)","buttonURL":"https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CYNwJn","buttonAlign":"flex-start","hoverEffect":"","wrpMarginTop":"0","wrpMarginBottom":"0","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwborderColor":"rgba(0,0,0,1)","btnBrdShwborderStyle":"solid","btnBrdShwBdr_Top":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Right":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Bottom":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Left":"2","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","showBlockContent":false,"commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-tixwk { display:block }.root-eb-button-tixwk { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-tixwk { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-tixwk { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-tixwk"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-tixwk "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-tixwk"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CYNwJn" rel="noopener">Buy on Daraz (4/128gb)</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-bv9yd","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-bv9yd { margin-top:0px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:0px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-bv9yd.eb-button-alignment { align-items:flex-start }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-bv9yd .eb-button { justify-content:flex-start }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-bv9yd .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(255,255,255,1); border-width:2px; border-color:rgba(0,0,0,1); border-style:solid; border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:rgba(255,0,0,1); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-bv9yd .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"Buy on Daraz (4/64gb)","textColor":"rgba(255,0,0,1)","buttonURL":"https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CWZUNP","buttonAlign":"flex-start","hoverEffect":"","wrpMarginTop":"0","wrpMarginBottom":"0","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwborderColor":"rgba(0,0,0,1)","btnBrdShwborderStyle":"solid","btnBrdShwBdr_Top":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Right":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Bottom":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Left":"2","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","showBlockContent":false,"commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-bv9yd { display:block }.root-eb-button-bv9yd { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-bv9yd { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-bv9yd { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-bv9yd"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-bv9yd "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-bv9yd"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CWZUNP" rel="noopener">Buy on Daraz (4/64gb)</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->', 'Looking for a smartphone that won\'t break the bank but still offers a great user experience? The realme Note 50 might be the perfect choice for you. Let\'s dive into the specs and see why it excels as a budget-friendly phone.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/RealmeNote50-sera10.jpg', 2, NULL, 'publish', 52, 0, '4.68', 34, '2024-05-16 20:22:33', '2024-05-16 20:22:33', '2026-09-18 10:45:38');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (43, 2261, 1, 'Realme C65 in BD : The Perfect Blend of Performance and Style', 'newly-released-realme-c65-in-bangladesh-the-perfect-blend-of-performance-and-style', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong><em>Realme C65</em></strong> is a standout addition to the budget smartphone market, offering a perfect blend of performance, style, and value. Packed with impressive features and specifications, this device is designed to meet the needs of modern smartphone users without breaking the bank. Let\'s dive into what makes the Realme C65 a compelling choice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Design and Display: Sleek and Comfortable</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the first things you\'ll notice about the <a href="/?s=Realme">Realme</a> C65 is its ultra-slim design. At just 7.64mm thick and weighing 185g, it\'s comfortable to hold and easy to carry. The Shining Starlight design, available in Starlight Purple and Starlight Black, adds a touch of elegance, making it as stylish as it is functional.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The 6.67\'\' Eye Comfort Display is another highlight, offering vibrant colors and clear visuals. With a 90Hz refresh rate, 180Hz touch sampling rate, and a brightness of up to 625 nits, the display is responsive and easy on the eyes, thanks to TÜV SÜD Low Blue Light Certification. Whether you\'re browsing, gaming, or watching videos, the Realme C65 provides a smooth and immersive experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2263,"width":"588px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CXougV"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IDC-story-57-1024x683.png" alt="" class="wp-image-2263" style="width:588px;height:auto"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Performance: Powerhouse Under the Hood</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Under the hood, the Realme C65 is powered by the MediaTek Helio G85 chipset. This octa-core processor, combined with the ARM Mali-G52 GPU, ensures smooth performance for everyday tasks and gaming. The device offers up to 8GB of LPDDR4x RAM and 256GB of internal storage, expandable up to 2TB via a microSD card. This ample storage capacity means you can keep all your photos, videos, and apps without worrying about running out of space.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Camera: Capture Every Moment</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Realme C65 comes equipped with a 50MP AI camera that excels in various photography scenarios. With features like Night mode, Professional mode, Panorama, Portrait, and more, you can capture stunning photos regardless of the conditions. The 8MP selfie camera also supports 1080P video recording, ensuring your selfies and video calls are sharp and clear.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Battery and Charging: Long-Lasting Power</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Battery life is crucial, and the Realme C65 doesn\'t disappoint. It houses a massive 5000mAh battery, ensuring you get through your day without constantly reaching for the charger. When you do need to charge, the 45W fast charging capability gets you back up to speed quickly, so you\'re never left stranded without power.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Connectivity and Features: All You Need</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Realme C65 supports dual SIM cards and a microSD card simultaneously, thanks to its 3-card slot. It covers a wide range of cellular bands, ensuring good connectivity no matter where you are. Additionally, it features Bluetooth 5.0, dual-band Wi-Fi, and various navigation systems (GPS, GLONASS, GALILEO, Beidou, QZSS) to keep you connected and on track.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The inclusion of essential sensors like the geomagnetic sensor, proximity sensor, light sensor, and software gyroscope enhances the overall user experience, making everyday interactions smooth and intuitive.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Software: Up-to-Date and User-Friendly</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Running on Realme UI 5.0 based on Android 14, the Realme C65 offers a clean and user-friendly interface. The latest software ensures you have access to the newest features and security updates up to 4 years, providing a reliable and enjoyable user experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">A Smart Choice?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In conclusion, the Realme C65 is a remarkable smartphone that delivers exceptional value. Its sleek design, powerful performance, impressive camera capabilities, and long-lasting battery make it a great choice for anyone looking for a reliable and stylish device. Whether you\'re a student, a professional, or someone who loves to stay connected, the Realme C65 has something to offer. If you\'re in the market for a new smartphone, the Realme C65 should be at the top of your list.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Key Specifications:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Design &amp; Dimensions</strong>:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ultra Slim: 7.64mm</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Weight: 185g</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Colors: Starlight Purple, Starlight Black</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Display</strong>:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Size: 6.67\'\' Eye Comfort Display</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Refresh Rate: 90Hz</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Brightness: 500nit (typ), 625nit (HBM)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Resolution: 1604*720</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>TÜV SÜD Low Blue Light Certification</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Performance</strong>:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Chipset: MediaTek Helio G85</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>CPU: Octa-core, 12nm, up to 2.0GHz</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>GPU: ARM Mali-G52</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>RAM: 8GB LPDDR4x</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Storage: 128GB/256GB ROM (expandable up to 2TB)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Camera</strong>:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Rear Camera: 50MP AI, f/1.8, 5P Lens, FOV: 79.5°<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Modes: Photo, Video, Night, Street, High-Res, Professional, Panorama, Portrait, Time-Lapse, Slow Motion, Movie, Super Text, Google Lens</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Video: 1080P@30fps, 720P@30fps</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Front Camera: 8MP, f/2.05, 4P Lens, FOV: 80°<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Modes: Photo, Video, Nightscape, Portrait, Time-Lapse</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Video: 1080P@30fps, 720P@30fps</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Battery &amp; Charging</strong>:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery: 5000mAh (typ), 4880mAh (min)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Fast Charge: 45W</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>USB Type-C Port</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Connectivity</strong>:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Dual SIM + Micro SD Slot</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>GSM: 850/900/1800/1900MHz</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>WCDMA: Bands 1/5/8</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>FDD-LTE: Bands 1/3/5/7/8/20/28</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>TD-LTE: Bands 38/40/41 (2496-2690MHz)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Wireless: 2.4/5GHz, Bluetooth 5.0</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Navigation &amp; Sensors</strong>:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Navigation: GPS, GLONASS, GALILEO, Beidou, QZSS</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sensors: Geomagnetic, Proximity, Light, Acceleration, Software Gyroscope</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Operating System</strong>:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Realme UI 5.0 based on Android 14</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Additional Features</strong>:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ports: 3.5mm Headset Jack, Type-C Port, 3-Card Slot</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>In the Box</strong>:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Realme C65, USB Type-C Cable, Power Adapter, Protect Case, SIM Card Needle, Quick Guide, Important Info Booklet (including Warranty Card)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-a8r32","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-a8r32 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-a8r32.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-a8r32 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-a8r32 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:51px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-a8r32 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳19,599 at Daraz (Official)","buttonURL":"https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CXougV","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"51","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"51","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-a8r32 { display:block }.root-eb-button-a8r32 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-a8r32 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-a8r32 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-a8r32"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-a8r32 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-a8r32"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_CXougV" rel="noopener">৳19,599 at Daraz (Official)</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->', 'The Realme C65 is a standout addition to the budget smartphone market, offering a perfect blend of performance, style, and value. Packed with impressive features and specifications, this device is designed to meet the needs of modern smartphone users without breaking the bank. Let\'s dive into what makes the Realme C65 a compelling choice.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/RealmeC65sera10.jpg', 2, NULL, 'publish', 39, 0, '4.93', 10, '2024-05-17 00:57:21', '2024-05-17 00:57:21', '2026-09-18 10:45:38');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (44, 2285, 1, 'Fiverr Pro : Boost Your Business Easily and Effectively', 'fiverr-pro-boost-your-business-easily-and-effectively', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">What is fiverr?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fiverr pro is a well-known online marketplace that links companies and consumers with <strong><a href="/?s=freelancers">freelancers</a></strong> that provide a variety of digital services. It began with an original idea: all jobs were listed at <strong>$5</strong>, even though freelancers are now free to choose their own rates. This is a summary of how Fiverr operates:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>&gt;&gt;&gt;<a href="https://go.fiverr.com/visit/?bta=980294&amp;brand=fp">Join Fiverr Pro and Boost Your Business</a></em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Independent Contractors:</strong> A wide range of freelancing services are available on Fiverr, ranging from general categories like writing, graphic design, and video editing to more specialist ones like data analysis, social media marketing, and even virtual help.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Price Based on Project:</strong> Fiverr charges based on projects, as opposed to hourly rates like other traditional freelance services. Independent contractors draft "gigs" that detail their offerings and establish a predetermined fee for the duration of the job.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Locating Independent Contractors: Customers can use the filters and search features in Fiverr\'s large catalog to look for freelancers that fit their needs and budget.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Opinions and Scores:</strong> Customers can rate and review freelancers on Fiverr, which promotes transparency and confidence on the platform.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Payment and Security:</strong> Fiverr provides safe ways to process payments. Until the buyer approves the finished project, the platform keeps the funds in escrow.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For companies and individuals in need of particular digital services to be accomplished without the commitment of hiring a full-time staff, Fiverr is a perfect choice. It serves as a platform for independent contractors to market their abilities and locate work across the globe.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://go.fiverr.com/visit/?bta=980294&amp;brand=fp">fiverr Pro</a></em></strong> for Business Boost?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fiverr Pro is an upgrade to the standard Fiverr platform designed specifically for businesses seeking <strong>top-tier freelance talent</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Say hello to a platform built for seamless collaboration and exceptional talent.</strong> Here\'s what elevates Fiverr Pro:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Centralized Control:</strong> Manage everything with ease! The advanced project management dashboard keeps track of projects, orders, your favorite freelancers, and shared budgets – all in one convenient location.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Verified Expertise:</strong> Stop searching endlessly. Fiverr Pro\'s curated catalog connects you with pre-vetted, top-tier freelancers. Each expert undergoes a rigorous vetting process, ensuring you collaborate only with the best in their field.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Effortless Teamwork:</strong> Communication is key! Enhanced collaboration tools make working with your team and freelancers a breeze. Monitor project progress, consult with colleagues, and navigate outsourced tasks seamlessly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Smart Matching:</strong> Finding the perfect freelancer just got easier. Fiverr Pro offers a multi-pronged approach:<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>AI-powered matching:</strong> Let the system find the perfect fit based on your project needs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Business Success Manager:</strong> Receive customized suggestions from a dedicated expert.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Project Partner:</strong> Get start-to-finish guidance for a truly hands-off experience.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The Pro Advantage:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By combining a curated pool of top-tier talent with advanced project management tools, Fiverr Pro guarantees successful project completion. Elevate your business and achieve exceptional results with Fiverr Pro today!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>&gt;&gt;&gt;<a href="https://go.fiverr.com/visit/?bta=980294&amp;brand=fp">Join Fiverr Pro and Boost Your Business</a></em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Why fiverr pro is better option than fiverr for Business?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fiverr Pro offers several advantages over the standard Fiverr platform, making it a better option for businesses seeking specific results:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Quality and Expertise:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Pre-vetted Freelancers:</strong> Fiverr Pro rigorously vets freelancers to ensure they possess the <strong>skills, experience, and proven track record</strong> businesses require for complex projects. You\'re guaranteed to be working with top-tier talent.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Targeted Audience:</strong> Unlike sifting through a vast pool on Fiverr, Fiverr Pro connects you with <strong>freelancers specifically catering to businesses</strong>. This ensures you\'re reaching qualified professionals with a strong understanding of business needs.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Project Management and Collaboration:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Streamlined Workflow:</strong> Fiverr Pro offers a <strong>centralized project management dashboard</strong> for easy project tracking, order management, and communication with your chosen freelancer.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Enhanced Collaboration Tools:</strong> Effective communication is key. Fiverr Pro provides advanced tools to collaborate seamlessly with your team and freelancers, ensuring everyone stays on the same page.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Project Scope and Value:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Premium Projects:</strong> Fiverr Pro caters to businesses with <strong>complex and ongoing projects</strong>. You\'ll find opportunities to develop long-term client relationships and tackle bigger initiatives that can significantly impact your business growth.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Higher Value:</strong> While typically more expensive than standard Fiverr gigs, Fiverr Pro freelancers offer a <strong>higher level of expertise and experience</strong>, often leading to better project outcomes and a higher return on investment.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>In summary, Fiverr Pro is ideal for businesses that prioritize quality, efficiency, and successful project completion.</strong> If you require basic services or have a limited budget, the standard Fiverr platform might be suitable. But for complex projects and long-term partnerships with top-tier talent, Fiverr Pro is the better option.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>&gt;&gt;&gt;<a href="https://go.fiverr.com/visit/?bta=980294&amp;brand=fp">Join Fiverr Pro and Boost Your Business</a></em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Fiverr is a well-known online marketplace that links companies and consumers with freelancers that provide a variety of digital services. It began with an original idea: all jobs were listed at $5, even though freelancers are now free to choose their own rates. ', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/OIG4.jpg', 4, NULL, 'publish', 42, 0, '4.91', 26, '2024-05-17 09:05:56', '2024-05-17 09:05:56', '2026-09-18 10:45:38');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (45, 2323, 1, 'Must Read Bengali Books of 2024 - A Review of \\"Galposangroho\\" by Shimul Mahmud', 'must-read-bengali-books-of-2024-a-review-of-galposangroho-by-shimul-mahmud', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After completing his studies in the Bengali Department at Jahangirnagar University, Shimul Mahmud earned a doctorate by researching mythological subjects. His engagement with poetry began during the oppressive era of the 1980s. Concurrently, he has made significant contributions to fiction and has established himself as a skilled critic. Currently, he is a professor in the <a href="/?s=Bengali">Bengali</a> Department at Begum Rokeya University in Rangpur. He has been editing the literary magazine \'Karuj\' for many years. Mahmud has received several accolades, including the Kolkata Little Magazine Library and Research Award in 2000, the Bogura Lekhak Chakra Fiction Award in 2012, and recognition from West Bengal\'s \'Ochena Jatri o Dwaipayana\' in 2015. He was born on May 3, 1967.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><em><strong><a href="https://rkmri.co/RSo0Me2AymIS/">Galposangroho (2024)</a></strong></em>: <em><strong>Enchantment in Every Page</strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2354,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/RSo0Me2AymIS/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1000009072-scaled.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2354"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>"Galposangroho," a short story collection by Shimul Mahmud, published in 2024, stands as a testament to the author\'s mastery of magical realism. This book, comprising 29 short stories, delves into the psychological landscapes of the writer, offering readers a diverse and enriching experience. Each story is crafted with an intricate blend of reality and fantasy, drawing readers into a world where the mundane and the magical coexist seamlessly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the most striking features of "Galposangroho" is its exploration of the psychological stages of the writer. Shimul Mahmud skillfully navigates through various mental and emotional states, providing readers with a profound understanding of human nature and the complexities of the mind. This thematic depth is complemented by the enchanting use of magical realism, making each story a unique journey into the unknown.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The collection\'s premium build quality further enhances the reading experience. The high-quality cream-colored pages and the overall superior construction of the book reflect the care and attention to detail that went into its production. At 365 pages, "Galposangroho" promises to be a substantial read, with every page offering new surprises and insights.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In summary, "Galposangroho" is more than just a collection of short stories; it is an exploration of the human psyche through the lens of magical realism. Shimul Mahmud\'s adept storytelling and the book\'s exceptional quality make it a must-read for anyone interested in the genre. Each of the 29 stories promises to captivate and enchant, ensuring that readers remain engaged from start to finish.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-wcgb9","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳671 at Rokomari","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/RSo0Me2AymIS/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }.root-eb-button-wcgb9 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-wcgb9"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-wcgb9"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/RSo0Me2AymIS/" rel="noopener">৳671 at Rokomari</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->', 'His engagement with poetry began during the oppressive era of the 1980s. Concurrently, he has made significant contributions to fiction and has established himself as a skilled critic. Currently, he is a professor in the Bengali Department at Begum Rokeya University in Rangpur.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Blue-Yellow-Black-Photo-How-To-Sell-Online-Youtube-Thumbnail_20240528_152656_0000.jpg', 3, NULL, 'publish', 48, 0, '4.94', 49, '2024-05-27 19:10:12', '2024-05-27 19:10:12', '2026-09-18 10:45:38');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (46, 2326, 1, 'Best Bengali Detective Books of Alltime', 'best-bengali-detective-books-of-alltime', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Enter the exciting world of Bengali <a href="/?s=detective">detective</a> fiction, where smart detectives solve complicated crimes in both familiar and strange places. People who read these classic stories are taken to a world where suspense rules and every turn holds the promise of a reveal. Bengali mystery books have a wide range of stories that are interesting and captivating. These stories include traditional whodunits and modern thrillers that are packed with tension. These stories show the unbreakable spirit of agents who never give up on their quest for justice and the truth, whether they\'re in the busy city or the quiet countryside. With their sharp minds, sharp observations, and unwavering drive, these fictional heroes find their way through a web of lies and deceit and beat the odds in the end. Get ready to be enchanted as you start on an exciting journey through the history of Bengali detective literature. Each page will bring you one step closer to solving the ultimate puzzle.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":1} -->\n<h1 class="wp-block-heading">Best Bengali Detective Books</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bengali detective fiction boasts a rich tradition, captivating readers for generations. Here are the titans of the genre whose works are widely considered the best Bengali detective books of all time, some translated books are listed here:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/yM0EMe5eAlpR/">Sherlock Holmes</a> by Sir Arthur Conan Doyle (Translated)</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2327,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/yM0EMe5eAlpR/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/imgrok0529_37472.gif" alt="" class="wp-image-2327"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sir Arthur Conan Doyle made Sherlock Holmes, who is one of the most famous and long-lasting detectives in fiction. When readers first met Sherlock Holmes in "A Study in Scarlet" in 1887, he quickly became a literary star, enthralling readers with his unmatched intelligence, sharp observation skills, and amazing ability to draw conclusions from clues.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Holmes lives at 221B Baker Street in Victorian London with his loyal friend Dr. John Watson. Together, they go on a series of exciting adventures where they solve puzzles and trick crooks with unmatched skill. Holmes approaches each case with methodical precision, using his keen eye for detail to find hints that other people miss. He always wears his famous deerstalker hat and has his trusty pipe with him.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From stopping bad plans in their tracks to figuring out secret codes, Holmes always stays one step ahead of his enemies as he navigates a web of evil. His legendary intelligence and sharp wit have made him a culture icon, and many films, TV shows, and books have been based on him.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sherlock Holmes has amazing skills, but he is also a complicated and mysterious person who fights with his own inner demons and problems. Even though he seems cold, Holmes\'s humanity shines through when he\'s vulnerable, which makes fans love him and ensures that he will always be remembered as the perfect detective hero.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-kf1a8","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳688 at Rokomari","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/yM0EMe5eAlpR/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-kf1a8 { display:block }.root-eb-button-kf1a8 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-kf1a8 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-kf1a8 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-kf1a8"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-kf1a8 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-kf1a8"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/yM0EMe5eAlpR/" rel="noopener">৳688 at Rokomari</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><em><strong><a href="https://rkmri.co/SmlIEAoS0eI5/">James Bond</a> by Ian Fleming (Translated)</strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2328,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/SmlIEAoS0eI5/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2582fb5a4_21160.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2328"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ian Fleming made up the character of James Bond, a British Secret Service agent. He is now a cultural icon and one of the most enduring characters in literature, movies, and pop culture. In Fleming\'s 1953 book "Casino Royale," Bond, whose code number is 007, was first presented. He quickly became associated with sophistication, mystery, and adventure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>James Bond is portrayed as a cool and charming agent who likes fast cars, hot women, and dangerous spy work. With his licence to kill, Bond navigates a world of international intrigue, stopping terrorist plans, finding out about conspiracies, and fighting dangerous enemies with amazing skill and resourcefulness.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In Fleming\'s books and the films that followed, Bond is known for his unwavering devotion to Queen and country, his perfect style, and his calm demeanour even when he knows he is in danger. Bond has an air of confidence and sophistication that has captivated audiences for generations, whether he is outsmarting bad guys at baccarat, in high-speed chases, or in hand-to-hand fighting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bond is more than just a man of action. He is also a complicated and multidimensional character who struggles with morals, loyalty, and the nature of power. His flaws and weaknesses make him more likeable by giving him depth and complexity and making him more appealing over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After more than 60 years of books and films, James Bond is still a cultural icon who has inspired many copycats and left a lasting mark on the spy genre. Between books and films, James Bond\'s daring adventures and famous lines continue to thrill and entertain fans, solidifying his place as one of the best fictional characters of all time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-24ux6","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-24ux6 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳602 at Rokomari","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/SmlIEAoS0eI5/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 { display:block }.root-eb-button-24ux6 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-24ux6"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-24ux6 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-24ux6"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/SmlIEAoS0eI5/" rel="noopener">৳602 at Rokomari</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/SN5emAMAAElN/">Feluda Series</a> by Satyajit Ray</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2329,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/SN5emAMAAElN/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/rokimg_20140928_42888.gif" alt="" class="wp-image-2329"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Feluda series by Satyajit Ray</strong><!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Satyajit Ray, the iconic filmmaker, also penned a popular detective series featuring the intelligent and observant sleuth, Feluda.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Feluda, accompanied by his cousin Topshe, tackles puzzling cases, traveling across India and even venturing abroad.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ray\'s masterful storytelling, infused with wit and cultural references, makes the Feluda series a timeless classic.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Some of the most beloved Feluda stories include "Sonar Kella" (The Golden Fortress), "Jahangirer Swarnamudra" (The Emperor\'s Gold Coin), and "Baksho Rohoshyo" (The Mystery of the Box).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-wcgb9","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳540 at Rokomari","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/SN5emAMAAElN/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }.root-eb-button-wcgb9 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-wcgb9"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-wcgb9"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/SN5emAMAAElN/" rel="noopener">৳540 at Rokomari</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/55lMeeRR3RAE/">Masud Rana Series</a> by Qazi Anwar Hussain</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2332,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/55lMeeRR3RAE/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/831ef9e7f_48659.png" alt="" class="wp-image-2332"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Masud Rana is a character in a story written by Qazi Anwar Hussain. Since 1966, Masud Rana has been the lead in a spy action show for adults. Millions of copies of the series have been sold in Bangladesh, where it is very famous.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He used to be a Major in the Bangladesh Army and now works as a spy for the Bangladesh Counter Intelligence. He fights criminal groups, rogue states, and supervillains all over the world on his travels. People love this series because it has exciting stories, strange settings, and characters that seem bigger than life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He wrote more than 470 books in the Masud Rana series before he died in 2001. The story is still being written by different people now. Masud Rana\'s long-lasting popularity shows how good Hussain is at telling stories and how well he created a figure that Bengali readers can relate to.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-cbp1b","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-cbp1b .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳107 at Rokomari","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/55lMeeRR3RAE/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b { display:block }.root-eb-button-cbp1b { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-cbp1b"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-cbp1b "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-cbp1b"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/55lMeeRR3RAE/" rel="noopener">৳107 at Rokomari</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/eA50pmM3SIAM/">Kakababu Series</a> by Sunil Gangopadhyay</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2335,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/eA50pmM3SIAM/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/98bf57fb0_43045.png" alt="" class="wp-image-2335"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The well-known Bengali author Sunil Gangopadhyay wrote the "Kakababu" series, which is a treasure in Bengali writing. These books take readers on exciting trips all over the world as they follow the tales of Kakababu (real name Pradosh Chandra Mitra), who used to be the Director of the Archaeological Survey of India, and his nephew Santu.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Even though Kakababu has to use a wheelchair because of an injury he got on an adventure in Afghanistan, he is a brave and clever main character. With his huge amount of knowledge, unbreakable spirit, and unwavering determination, Kakababu goes on dangerous adventures to solve riddles, find lost treasures, and stop evil plans.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sunil Gangopadhyay\'s masterful writing and vivid images take readers to faraway places like the dense jungles of the Amazon and the ancient ruins of Egypt. With each turn of the page, readers feel a sense of adventure and wonder. Along with Kakababu, fans meet a wide range of interesting characters who give the stories more depth and mystery.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Kakababu series is unique because it seamlessly combines mystery, action, and history. This makes it a great read for people of all ages. Kakababu and Santu\'s adventures will keep readers interested and spark their imaginations, whether they are trying to figure out mysterious hints, facing dangerous situations, or digging into the secrets of the past.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Kakababu series has a lot of books and a lot of loyal fans. Its timeless stories of adventure, courage, and discovery continue to enchant readers, solidifying its status as a beloved standard in Bengali literature.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-mklae","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-mklae .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳990 at Rokomari","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/eA50pmM3SIAM/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }.root-eb-button-mklae { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-mklae { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-mklae"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-mklae "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-mklae"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/eA50pmM3SIAM/" rel="noopener">৳990 at Rokomari</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/eyeeSRmypIMl/">Misir Ali Series</a> by Humayun Ahmed</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2336,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/eyeeSRmypIMl/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Misir_Ali_Samagra_1-Humayun_Ahmed-3ad64-56-1.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2336"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Misir Ali series by Humayun Ahmed is a cornerstone of Bengali detective fiction, offering a unique blend of psychological insight, supernatural elements, and social commentary. Here\'s a breakdown of what makes the series so captivating:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The Intriguing Protagonist: Misir Ali</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Professor of Parapsychology and Psychiatrist</strong>: Misir Ali is not your typical detective. He\'s a professor who uses his knowledge of psychology and the paranormal to unravel mysteries that often defy conventional explanation.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Rational with a Twist</strong>: While grounded in logic, Misir Ali is open to the possibility of the supernatural. He approaches cases with a scientific mind but remains receptive to the unexplained.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Unconventional Cases</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Beyond the Mundane</strong>: The Misir Ali series delves into mysteries that go beyond everyday crimes. Expect encounters with ghosts, djinns, and other paranormal phenomena alongside psychological thrillers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Social Commentary</strong>: Woven into the narratives are subtle critiques of social issues prevalent in Bangladeshi society. Ahmed cleverly uses the fantastical to address real-world concerns.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Some Popular Misir Ali Novels</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The series boasts a staggering 21 primary works, with additional short story collections. Here are a few well-known titles to get you started:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Misir Alir Ghor (The House of Misir Ali)</strong>: This debut novel introduces Misir Ali and his unconventional methods as he investigates a haunting.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Misir Alir Abhijaan (The Curse of Misir Ali)</strong>: Misir Ali tackles a case involving a mysterious curse and a hidden family secret.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Annobhaba (The Future)</strong>: This story explores the concept of time travel and its consequences.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Bhony (Fear)</strong>: A collection of three short stories featuring encounters with the supernatural.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Beyond the Books</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The popularity of the Misir Ali series has transcended the written word. Adaptations include television dramas and films, further solidifying Misir Ali\'s place as a pop culture icon in Bangladesh.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-jxr7n","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-jxr7n .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳860 at Rokomari","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/eyeeSRmypIMl/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-jxr7n { display:block }.root-eb-button-jxr7n { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-jxr7n { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-jxr7n { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-jxr7n"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-jxr7n "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-jxr7n"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/eyeeSRmypIMl/" rel="noopener">৳860 at Rokomari</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/ASNlpRSmmM0M/">Byomkesh Series</a> by Sharadindu Bandyopadhyay</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2338,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/ASNlpRSmmM0M/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/00f3c01be834_50985.gif" alt="" class="wp-image-2338"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Byomkesh Bakshi, the "Satyanweshi" (truth-seeker) detective created by Sharadindu Bandyopadhyay, is a legendary figure in Bengali literature. Here\'s a closer look at this iconic character:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The Birth of Byomkesh</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>First Appearance</strong>: Byomkesh debuted in the 1932 story "Satyanweshi" (The Inquisitor).</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>The Setting</strong>: The stories are set in Kolkata, India, during the 1930s and 1940s, offering a glimpse into the social and political climate of the era.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The Man Behind the Mystery</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Brilliant Mind</strong>: Byomkesh is a young, sharp, and observant man with a keen intellect. He excels at deduction, logic, and reasoning.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Unconventional Methods</strong>: Unlike detectives who rely solely on physical evidence, Byomkesh incorporates keen observation of human behavior and psychological insight into his investigations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>The Ideal Partner</strong>: Byomkesh\'s adventures are narrated by his friend, Ajit, who provides a window into Byomkesh\'s thought process and the thrilling world of solving crimes.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Facing the Unknown</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>A Range of Cases</strong>: Byomkesh tackles a variety of cases, from murders and thefts to forgeries and political conspiracies.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>More Than Just Crime</strong>: The stories delve into human nature, exploring themes of deception, greed, revenge, and the pursuit of justice.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The Legacy of Byomkesh Bakshi</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Enduring Popularity</strong>: Byomkesh Bakshi remains a beloved figure in Bengali pop culture. His stories have been adapted for television, radio, film, and theater.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>A Bengali Sherlock Holmes</strong>: Often compared to Sherlock Holmes, Byomkesh offers a unique perspective rooted in Bengali culture and social realities.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>A Gateway to Bengali Literature</strong>: Byomkesh Bakshi\'s adventures are a fantastic entry point for those interested in exploring Bengali detective fiction and literature in general.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you\'d like to delve deeper, here are some suggestions:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Explore collections of Byomkesh Bakshi stories, either in Bengali or translated editions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Watch adaptations (films or TV shows) featuring Byomkesh to visually experience his world.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Byomkesh Bakshi\'s intelligence, integrity, and unique approach to solving mysteries continue to enthrall readers and inspire new generations of fans.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-5011y","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5011y .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳2520 at Rokomari","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/ASNlpRSmmM0M/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-5011y { display:block }.root-eb-button-5011y { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-5011y { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-5011y { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-5011y"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-5011y "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-5011y"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/ASNlpRSmmM0M/" rel="noopener">৳2520 at Rokomari</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/5MyTIImmApA3/">Tin Goyenda Series</a> by Rakib Hasan</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2340,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/5MyTIImmApA3/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/rokimg_20140907_46938.gif" alt="" class="wp-image-2340"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Tin Goyenda (Three Detectives) series by Rakib Hasan is a pillar of Bangladeshi juvenile detective fiction, captivating young readers for over five decades. Here\'s a breakdown of what makes the series so enduring:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>The Intrepid Trio</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Kishore Pasha</strong>: The leader of the group, Kishore is known for his sharp intellect, strategic thinking, and unwavering determination.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Robin Milford</strong>: The team\'s athletic member, Robin provides his agility, bravery, and quick reflexes during their investigations.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Musa Aman</strong>: The bookworm of the trio, Musa\'s extensive knowledge and research skills prove invaluable in solving mysteries.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Thrilling Adventures</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Unraveling Mysteries</strong>: The Tin Goyenda face a variety of cases, from robberies and kidnappings to uncovering hidden secrets and solving puzzles.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Action and Adventure</strong>: The narratives are packed with action sequences, daring escapes, and suspenseful moments, keeping readers on the edge of their seats.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Influences and Inspiration</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Early Inspiration</strong>: The series\' early stories drew inspiration from Western juvenile detective series like "The Three Investigators" by Robert Arthur.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Evolving Identity</strong>: Over time, the Tin Goyenda stories incorporated more Bengali cultural elements and social issues, creating a unique identity.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Legacy of the Tin Goyenda</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Rakib Hasan\'s Contribution</strong>: Rakib Hasan penned over 160 stories featuring the Tin Goyenda, establishing them as household names in Bangladesh.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Shamsuddin Nawab\'s Continuation</strong>: After Hasan, writer Shamsuddin Nawab continued the series, ensuring its longevity.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Beyond Books</strong>: The Tin Goyenda\'s popularity extends to comics, television adaptations, and mobile apps, solidifying their place in Bangladeshi pop culture.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-frnzc","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-frnzc { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-frnzc.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-frnzc .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-frnzc .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-frnzc .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳145 at Rokomari","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/5MyTIImmApA3/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-frnzc { display:block }.root-eb-button-frnzc { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-frnzc { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-frnzc { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-frnzc"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-frnzc "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-frnzc"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/5MyTIImmApA3/" rel="noopener">৳145 at Rokomari</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->', 'Bengali detective fiction boasts a rich tradition, captivating readers for generations. Here are the titans of the genre whose works are widely considered the best Bengali detective books of all time, some translated books are listed here', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1_20240528_103519_0000.jpg', 3, NULL, 'publish', 234, 0, '4.97', 41, '2024-05-27 19:41:09', '2024-05-27 19:41:09', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (47, 2359, 1, '10 Best Budget Smartphones of 2025 in Bangladesh', 'best-budget-smartphones-of-bangladesh-2025', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Looking for a high-quality budget smartphone in Bangladesh? In 2025, you can find amazing smartphones priced between <strong>BDT 10,000 to BDT 25,000</strong> that offer great performance, camera quality, and display. Here’s our updated list of the <strong>10 best budget smartphones</strong> for 2025, all within this affordable price range.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. <strong>Xiaomi Redmi Note 13</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price</strong>: BDT 21,999<br><strong>Why it’s great</strong>: AMOLED display, MediaTek Dimensity 6100+, 50MP main camera, 5000mAh battery, and 33W fast charging — a reliable all-rounder.<br><strong>Order on Daraz</strong>: <a href="https://s.daraz.com.bd/s.Z3Wo5">Order on Daraz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">2. <strong>Realme C75</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price</strong>: BDT 20,199<br><strong>Why it’s great</strong>: A sharp 6.72" FHD+ display with 120Hz refresh rate, Snapdragon 685 processor, 5000mAh battery with 33W fast charging — perfect for smooth multitasking and entertainment.<br><strong>Order on Daraz</strong>: <a href="https://s.daraz.com.bd/s.Z33zr">Order on Daraz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">3. <strong>Samsung Galaxy A05s</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price</strong>: BDT 17,499<br><strong>Why it’s great</strong>: Snapdragon 680, 6.7" FHD+ display, and Samsung’s trusted durability make this a solid mid-range pick.<br><strong>Order on Daraz</strong>: <a href="https://s.daraz.com.bd/s.Z3WsL">Order on Daraz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">4. <strong>Infinix Hot 50 Pro Plus</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price</strong>: BDT 23,999<br><strong>Why it’s great</strong>: A 6.7" FHD+ display, 120Hz refresh rate, 50MP primary camera, MediaTek Helio G99, and 5000mAh battery with 33W fast charging — a fantastic option for entertainment and gaming.<br><strong>Order on Daraz</strong>: <a href="https://s.daraz.com.bd/s.Z3ed5">Order on Daraz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">5. <strong>Tecno Spark 30 Pro</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price</strong>: BDT 20,199<br><strong>Why it’s great</strong>: 6.78" FHD+ display, 120Hz refresh rate, Helio G99 Ultimate chip, 5000mAh battery, and 33W fast charging — a great pick for gamers and casual users alike.<br><strong>Order on Daraz</strong>: <a href="https://s.daraz.com.bd/s.Z33u3">Order on Daraz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">6. <strong>POCO M6 Plus</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price</strong>: BDT 17,999<br><strong>Why it’s great</strong>: Snapdragon 4 Gen 2 chip, 90Hz FHD+ display, 50MP camera, and long-lasting 5000mAh battery — ideal for power users.<br><strong>Order on Daraz</strong>: <a href="https://s.daraz.com.bd/s.Z3WzP">Order on Daraz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">7. <strong>Motorola G45</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price</strong>: BDT 18,999<br><strong>Why it’s great</strong>: A stunning 6.6" 120Hz display, large 5000mAh battery, clean Android interface, and Snapdragon performance make it a hidden gem.<br><strong>Order on Daraz</strong>: <a href="https://s.daraz.com.bd/s.Z33pS">Order on Daraz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">8. <strong>Itel S24</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price</strong>: BDT 13,499<br><strong>Why it’s great</strong>: The most affordable 108MP camera phone in the market — perfect for content creators and social media users.<br><strong>Order on Daraz</strong>: <a href="https://s.daraz.com.bd/s.Z33Y9">Order on Daraz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">9. <strong>Symphony Z70</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price</strong>: BDT 9,299<br><strong>Why it’s great</strong>: One of the best ultra-budget phones with smooth performance, sleek design, and solid software for the price.<br><strong>Order on Daraz</strong>: <a href="https://s.daraz.com.bd/s.Z33de">Order on Daraz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">10. <strong>Helio 50</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Price</strong>: BDT 13,499<br><strong>Why it’s great</strong>: A stylish newcomer offering a big battery, solid display, and reliable daily performance at a competitive price.<br><strong>Order on Daraz</strong>: <a href="https://s.daraz.com.bd/s.Z33iQ">Order on Daraz</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em>Final Thoughts</em></strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The budget smartphone market in Bangladesh is more competitive than ever. With smartphones ranging from <strong>BDT 10,000 to BDT 25,000</strong>, these phones offer great features, including powerful processors, high-quality displays, and strong cameras — all at affordable prices. Whether you need a phone for gaming, photography, or just general use, these models are sure to meet your needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Order your favorite now and enjoy fast delivery across Bangladesh!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Defining "budget" can be tricky, but in Bangladesh, most sources consider anything under 30,000 taka (around $250 USD) to be budget-friendly. Here are 10 options to consider, ranging from ultra-affordable to mid-range:', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/file_00000000dae461f98355931d4146f643.jpg', 2, NULL, 'publish', 95, 0, '4.65', 44, '2024-05-28 20:11:47', '2024-05-28 20:11:47', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (48, 2389, 1, '27 Best Historical Bengali Fiction Books in Literature', 'best-historical-fiction-novel-books-in-bengali-literature', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bengali literature, renowned for its rich and diverse storytelling traditions, has a distinguished legacy in the genre of historical <a href="/?s=fiction">fiction</a>. This genre offers a vivid window into the past, seamlessly blending fact and fiction to recreate bygone eras with remarkable authenticity. Through these narratives, readers embark on journeys to various historical periods, from ancient empires and medieval conflicts to the Renaissance of Bengal and the fervent years of the Indian independence movement.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The essence of these works lies in their meticulous research and deep understanding of historical contexts, which are woven into compelling plots filled with romance, adventure, and political intrigue. Characters, both real and fictional, are brought to life with vivid detail, navigating the complexities of their times. Themes of patriotism, identity, and social reform are prevalent, reflecting the zeitgeist of the periods they portray.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These stories do not merely recount historical events but delve into the human experiences behind them, exploring the socio-political landscapes and cultural transformations that shaped the course of history. They serve as a bridge between the past and the present, offering insights into how historical legacies continue to influence contemporary society. Through these timeless tales, Bengali historical fiction captivates and educates, enriching the reader\'s understanding of history and heritage.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bengali literature has a rich tradition of historical fiction, transporting readers to bygone eras and immersing them in the social, political, and cultural landscapes of the past. Here are some of the most acclaimed works in the genre:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color"><strong><em>Original Bengali Fiction Novels</em></strong>:</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"ordered":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://rkmri.co/ReE2IemMIp3A/"><em>Sansaptak</em></a> by Shahidullah Kaiser</strong>: British India, World War II, Pakistan Movement, Communal Riots, Events Leading to The Creation of Pakistan</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/2pImeeyyR3RA/">Purba-Paschim</a></em> by Sunil Gangopadhyay</strong>: Pre-partition Situation, 1947 Partition, Naxalite Movement, Bangladesh Liberation War</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/oReSNeAAlRAR/">Agunpakhi</a></em> by Hasan Azizul Huq</strong>: World War II and Partition of India</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/e00Allee3eNo/">Bishad Sindhu</a></em> by Mir Mosharraf Hossain</strong>: Battle of Karbala and Its Surrounding Events</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://rkmri.co/Ay2yeNAMeeTE/"><em>Chilekothar Sepai</em></a> by Akhteruzzaman Elias</strong>: 1969 Mass Uprising</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/epoomEoMeSNM/">Pitrigon</a></em> by Zakir Talukder</strong>: History of the Kaivarta Rebellion against The Pala Kings</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/oRA3epNN5MeE/">Deyal</a></em> by Humayun Ahmed</strong>: Post-Liberation War Political History</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/eMeeEe5ATeNe/">Pradoshe Prakritajan</a></em> by Shawkat Ali</strong>: Stories of Common People during the Turkish Invasions and the Sena Dynasty</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/ARepRETloSR2/">Nil Moyurer Joubon</a></em> <strong>by Selina Hossain</strong></strong>: Context of Charyapada during The 8th to 10th Centuries</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/eA0pMA3peMyl/">Krachher Colonel</a></em> by Shahaduzzaman</strong>: Life History of Colonel Taher</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/EATAREEe5pRo/">Moyur Singhason</a></em> by Shaheen Akhter</strong>: Mughal history, Story of Prince Suja</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/EAApeTel2IMe/">Arek Falgun</a></em> by Zahir Raihan</strong>: Language Movement</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/3mA2N3eeNS5p/">Dhorai Charit Manas</a></em> by Satinath Bhaduri</strong>: Situation in pre-partition of Bihar, end of British rule</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/ypeNeEpoRAST/">Prothom Alo</a></em> by <strong>Sunil Gangopadhyay</strong></strong>: Latter Half of The 19th century</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/Rp2A23elAeNA/">Onkar</a></em> by Ahmed Sofa</strong>: 1969 Mass Uprising</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/3Mp30eAp5llp/">Darabar Somoy</a></em> by Rafiqur Rashid</strong>: Post-Liberation War period</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/2SSMReleeIeA/">Puranbhumi</a></em> by Pintu Rahman</strong>: Partition of Bengal</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/5mAANpIIAE52/">Badshah Namdar</a></em> by Humayun Ahmed</strong>: Biography of Emperor Humayun</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/0o22ASoAEeyM/">Chimbuk Paharer Jatak</a></em> by Haripada Datta</strong>: History of the Indian Subcontinent and Buddhism</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/ppE5R3elM25p/">Matal Hawa</a></em> <strong> by Humayun Ahmed</strong></strong>: 1969 Mass Uprising</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/MMMeleyepEMl/">Jibon O Rajnaitik Bastobota</a></em> by Shahidul Zahir</strong>: Liberation War and The Rehabilitation of Collaborators in Post-war Bangladesh</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/MA53EIeAmAee/">Tungabhadrar Tire</a></em> by Sharadindu Bandyopadhyay</strong>: Vijayanagara Empire</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/NESMAmyAyeE3/">Sonali Dumur</a></em> by Selina Hossain</strong>: Partition of India</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color"><strong><em>Bengali Fiction Novels Translated</em></strong>:</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"ordered":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/eE53MAoAlNNo/">War and Peace</a></em> by Leo Tolstoy</strong>: Napoleon Bonaparte\'s Russian Campaign</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/S0R3M52ApmRo/">Train to Pakistan</a></em> by Khushwant Singh</strong>: Partition of India and Communal Riots</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/AN2p2oAMMmpN/">Chengis Khan</a></em> by Vasily Yan</strong>: Life and Political History of Chengis Khan</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><em><a href="https://www.rokomari.com/book/17412/warelock">Warlock</a></em> by Wilbur Smith</strong>: Ancient Egypt</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->', 'Bengali literature has a rich tradition of historical fiction, transporting readers to bygone eras and immersing them in the social, political, and cultural landscapes of the past. Here are some of the most acclaimed works in the genre:', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/All-About-Oil-Activity-Educational-Video-in-Brown-Beige-Scrapbook-Style_20240531_192206_0000.jpg', 3, NULL, 'publish', 73, 0, '4.72', 49, '2024-05-31 23:18:21', '2024-05-31 23:18:21', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (49, 2417, 1, 'The Top 10 Newspapers in Bangladesh: An In-Depth Look', 'the-top-10-newspapers-in-bangladesh-an-in-depth-look', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href="/?s=Bangladesh">Bangladesh</a>, a country with a vibrant media landscape, boasts a rich tradition of journalism that plays a crucial role in its democratic process. From hard-hitting investigative journalism to insightful analysis and comprehensive coverage of daily events, Bangladeshi newspapers offer a plethora of information to their readers. In this post, we explore the top 10 newspapers in Bangladesh, delving into their history, influence, and areas of focus.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. The Daily Star</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Language:</strong> English<br><strong>Founded:</strong> 1991<br><strong>Headquarters:</strong> Dhaka<br><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.thedailystar.net">The Daily Star</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Daily Star is the most widely read English-language newspaper in Bangladesh. Established in 1991, it quickly gained a reputation for its rigorous journalism and commitment to press freedom. With a wide-ranging coverage that includes politics, economics, culture, and international news, The Daily Star is a trusted source for both local and global readers. Its editorial stance is often seen as balanced and insightful, providing in-depth analysis and opinion pieces that are highly regarded.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">2. Prothom Alo</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Language:</strong> Bengali<br><strong>Founded:</strong> 1998<br><strong>Headquarters:</strong> Dhaka<br><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.prothomalo.com">Prothom Alo</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Prothom Alo is arguably the most influential Bengali-language newspaper in Bangladesh. Launched in 1998, it has grown rapidly to become the most circulated newspaper in the country. Known for its investigative journalism and comprehensive news coverage, Prothom Alo covers a wide range of topics including politics, sports, entertainment, and lifestyle. Its digital presence is also significant, with millions of readers engaging with its online content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">3. The Daily Ittefaq</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Language:</strong> Bengali<br><strong>Founded:</strong> 1953<br><strong>Headquarters:</strong> Dhaka<br><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.ittefaq.com.bd">The Daily Ittefaq</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Daily Ittefaq is one of the oldest newspapers in Bangladesh, with a storied history that dates back to the pre-independence era. Established in 1953, it played a pivotal role during the Bangladesh Liberation War. Known for its deep-rooted influence in Bengali journalism, The Daily Ittefaq continues to be a major player in the media landscape, offering extensive coverage of national and international news, politics, and societal issues.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">4. The Financial Express</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Language:</strong> English<br><strong>Founded:</strong> 1993<br><strong>Headquarters:</strong> Dhaka<br><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.thefinancialexpress.com.bd">The Financial Express</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Financial Express is Bangladesh’s premier English-language financial newspaper. Since its inception in 1993, it has been a key source of news for business professionals, economists, and policy-makers. The newspaper provides comprehensive coverage of economic policies, market trends, corporate news, and financial analysis, making it an essential read for anyone interested in the economic affairs of Bangladesh.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">5. Bangladesh Pratidin</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Language:</strong> Bengali<br><strong>Founded:</strong> 2010<br><strong>Headquarters:</strong> Dhaka<br><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.bd-pratidin.com">Bangladesh Pratidin</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bangladesh Pratidin is one of the highest circulated Bengali-language newspapers in Bangladesh. Despite being a relatively recent addition to the media scene, having been founded in 2010, it has quickly become a household name. Its wide-ranging coverage includes politics, business, sports, and entertainment, catering to a diverse readership across the country.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">6. Kaler Kantho</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Language:</strong> Bengali<br><strong>Founded:</strong> 2010<br><strong>Headquarters:</strong> Dhaka<br><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.kalerkantho.com">Kaler Kantho</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kaler Kantho is another leading Bengali-language daily that has made significant strides since its establishment in 2010. Known for its in-depth reporting and investigative journalism, Kaler Kantho covers a broad spectrum of news, from national and international affairs to sports and entertainment. Its commitment to journalistic integrity has earned it a loyal readership.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">7. The Daily Sun</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Language:</strong> English<br><strong>Founded:</strong> 2010<br><strong>Headquarters:</strong> Dhaka<br><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.daily-sun.com">The Daily Sun</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Daily Sun is a prominent English-language daily newspaper in Bangladesh. Launched in 2010, it provides extensive coverage of national and international news, business, sports, and features. The Daily Sun aims to cater to the educated middle and upper-middle classes, offering insightful editorials and opinion pieces alongside its news reporting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">8. Samakal</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Language:</strong> Bengali<br><strong>Founded:</strong> 2005<br><strong>Headquarters:</strong> Dhaka<br><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.samakal.com">Samakal</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Samakal is a widely circulated Bengali daily known for its robust news coverage and analysis. Established in 2005, it has become a trusted source for readers seeking detailed reporting on politics, business, culture, and society. Samakal is recognized for its commitment to journalistic ethics and its role in promoting social issues and public interests.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">9. New Age</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Language:</strong> English<br><strong>Founded:</strong> 2003<br><strong>Headquarters:</strong> Dhaka<br><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.newagebd.net">New Age</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>New Age is a prominent English-language daily that offers a critical perspective on news and current events. Since its launch in 2003, New Age has distinguished itself with its in-depth analysis and investigative journalism. The newspaper often takes a progressive stance on issues, advocating for social justice and human rights. Its editorial independence makes it a respected voice in the Bangladeshi media landscape.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">10. Manab Zamin</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Language:</strong> Bengali<br><strong>Founded:</strong> 1997<br><strong>Headquarters:</strong> Dhaka<br><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.mzamin.com">Manab Zamin</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Manab Zamin is renowned for its human interest stories and investigative journalism. Established in 1997, it has carved out a niche for itself with its focus on stories that highlight the human side of news. The newspaper covers a variety of topics, including politics, crime, entertainment, and sports, and is known for its bold reporting and engaging content.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>The newspapers in Bangladesh play an essential role in informing the public, shaping opinions, and holding those in power accountable. From the established giants like The Daily Star and Prothom Alo to the newer yet influential players like Bangladesh Pratidin and Kaler Kantho, the media landscape in Bangladesh is diverse and dynamic. Each of these top 10 newspapers contributes uniquely to the journalistic fabric of the country, providing readers with a rich source of information and analysis.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>For anyone looking to understand Bangladesh’s socio-political environment or stay updated on current events, these newspapers are invaluable resources.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Bangladesh, a country with a vibrant media landscape, boasts a rich tradition of journalism that plays a crucial role in its democratic process. From hard-hitting investigative journalism to insightful analysis and comprehensive coverage of daily events, Bangladeshi newspapers offer a plethora of information to their readers. In this post, we explore the top 10 newspapers in Bangladesh, delving into their history, influence, and areas of focus.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Top-10-Best-Bangla-Newspapers-of-Bangladesh-1.jpg', 4, NULL, 'publish', 46, 0, '4.82', 18, '2024-06-04 19:55:20', '2024-06-04 19:55:20', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (50, 2422, 1, 'Top 10 Clothing Brands in Bangladesh: A Fashionista\'s Guide', 'top-10-clothing-brands-in-bangladesh-a-fashionistas-guide', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bangladesh is not just known for being one of the largest garment producers in the world but also boasts a vibrant local <a href="/?s=fashion">fashion</a> scene. With a blend of traditional craftsmanship and contemporary designs, Bangladeshi clothing brands have carved a niche for themselves in the fashion industry. Whether you\'re looking for ethnic wear, casual outfits, or high-end fashion, these brands have something for everyone. Here’s a closer look at the top 10 clothing brands in Bangladesh that every fashion enthusiast should know about.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Aarong</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Aarong is synonymous with Bangladeshi heritage and craftsmanship. Founded by BRAC, the world\'s largest non-governmental development organization, Aarong has become a household name. It offers an extensive range of products, from traditional sarees and salwar kameez to home decor and accessories. Aarong\'s commitment to promoting local artisans and fair trade practices has made it a beloved brand in Bangladesh.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Wide range of traditional and contemporary clothing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Accessories, home decor, and handicrafts</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Promotes fair trade and supports local artisans</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.aarong.com/">Aarong</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Yellow</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yellow, a brand by Beximco, is known for its trendy and stylish apparel. Catering to both men and women, Yellow offers everything from casual wear to formal attire. The brand is particularly popular among the younger crowd for its fashionable and affordable clothing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Trendy and stylish clothing for men and women</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Casual, formal, and party wear</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Affordable pricing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.yellowclothing.net/">Yellow</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Sailor</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sailor has quickly risen to fame with its modern and youthful designs. It offers a variety of clothing options, including casual, formal, and ethnic wear for both men and women. Sailor is known for its high-quality fabrics and contemporary designs that appeal to the fashion-forward crowd.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Modern and youthful designs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Casual, formal, and ethnic wear</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High-quality fabrics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.sailor.clothing/">Sailor</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Cats Eye</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cats Eye has been a leading brand in men\'s fashion in Bangladesh for decades. It offers a range of products, including casual wear, formal wear, and accessories. Known for its stylish and sophisticated designs, Cats Eye is a go-to brand for men\'s fashion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Leading brand in men\'s fashion</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Stylish and sophisticated designs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Casual and formal wear</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://catseye.com.bd/">Cats Eye</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Ecstasy</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ecstasy is popular for its trendy and fashionable clothing, catering to both men and women. With a wide range of casual and formal wear, Ecstasy is a favorite among fashion enthusiasts who seek contemporary and stylish outfits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Trendy and fashionable clothing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Casual and formal wear</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Appeals to both men and women</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.ecstasybd.com/">Ecstasy</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Le Reve</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Le Reve blends traditional and contemporary designs to offer stylish clothing options for men, women, and children. The brand is known for its elegant and comfortable outfits that are perfect for any occasion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Blend of traditional and contemporary designs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Stylish clothing for men, women, and children</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Elegant and comfortable outfits</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.lerevecraze.com/">Le Reve</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Richman</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Richman specializes in high-quality men\'s clothing, offering a range of formal and casual wear. The brand is known for its premium fabrics and impeccable tailoring, making it a top choice for men\'s fashion in Bangladesh.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Specializes in men\'s clothing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High-quality formal and casual wear</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Premium fabrics and impeccable tailoring</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://richmanbd.com/">Richman</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Dorji Bari</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Dorji Bari focuses on handmade and bespoke clothing, offering unique and stylish designs for both men and women. The brand emphasizes quality craftsmanship and personalized service, making it a favorite for those who appreciate custom-made fashion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Handmade and bespoke clothing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Unique and stylish designs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Personalized service</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://dorjibari.com/">Dorji Bari</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Anjans</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Anjans is known for its traditional and ethnic wear, offering a wide range of clothing such as sarees, salwar kameez, and kurtis. The brand celebrates Bangladeshi culture through its elegant and intricately designed outfits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Traditional and ethnic wear</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Elegant sarees, salwar kameez, and kurtis</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Celebrates Bangladeshi culture</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://anjans.com/">Anjans</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Grameen UNIQLO</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Grameen UNIQLO is a social business initiative by UNIQLO, offering affordable and high-quality clothing while supporting local communities. The brand focuses on sustainability and ethical practices, making it a responsible choice for fashion-conscious consumers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Affordable and high-quality clothing</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Supports local communities</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Focus on sustainability and ethical practices</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.grameenuniqlo.com/">Grameen UNIQLO</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"fontSize":"medium"} -->\n<p class="has-medium-font-size"><strong>Bangladesh\'s fashion scene is rich and diverse, with each brand offering something unique. From traditional craftsmanship to modern designs, these top 10 clothing brands showcase the best of Bangladeshi fashion. Whether you\'re shopping for everyday wear or looking for something special, these brands provide a wide range of options that cater to various tastes and preferences. So, the next time you update your wardrobe, consider exploring these fantastic Bangladeshi brands!</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Bangladesh is not just known for being one of the largest garment producers in the world but also boasts a vibrant local fashion scene. With a blend of traditional craftsmanship and contemporary designs, Bangladeshi clothing brands have carved a niche for themselves in the fashion industry.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Top-Clothing-Brands-in-Bangladesh.webp', 5, NULL, 'publish', 151, 0, '4.51', 27, '2024-06-04 20:11:20', '2024-06-04 20:11:20', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (51, 2432, 1, 'Top 10 Tech Gadgets to Buy in Bangladesh: A Tech Enthusiast’s Wishlist', 'top-10-tech-gadgets-to-buy-in-bangladesh-a-tech-enthusiasts-wishlist', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bangladesh is experiencing a tech renaissance, with a wide variety of cutting-edge gadgets becoming readily available. From <a href="/?s=smartphones">smartphones</a> and smartwatches to gaming consoles and drones, there\'s something for every tech enthusiast. Whether you’re upgrading your tech arsenal or looking for the perfect gift, these top 10 tech gadgets in Bangladesh should be on your radar.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Smartphones</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Smartphones are an essential part of our daily lives, and having the latest model can make a big difference. Leading brands like Apple, Samsung, Xiaomi, and OnePlus offer a range of models catering to different budgets and preferences. The latest models, such as the iPhone 14, Samsung Galaxy S23, and Xiaomi Mi 12, come equipped with advanced features, powerful processors, and impressive camera systems.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Advanced camera systems</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Powerful processors</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Wide range of apps and features</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Where to Buy:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_bd8aF6T">Daraz</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://rkmri.co/eAlI0elSAeoo/">Rokomari</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Laptops</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Laptops are indispensable for work, study, and entertainment. Brands like Dell, HP, ASUS, and Lenovo offer high-performance laptops suitable for various needs. For gamers, the ASUS ROG and Dell Alienware series are excellent choices, while HP Spectre and Dell XPS are great for professionals.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High-performance capabilities</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Suitable for various needs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Wide range of models</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Where to Buy:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_bd8aF6T">Daraz</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://rkmri.co/eAlI0elSAeoo/">Rokomari</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Smartwatches</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Smartwatches have become increasingly popular for their health tracking and connectivity features. The Apple Watch Series 8, Samsung Galaxy Watch 5, and Fitbit Versa 3 are among the top choices, offering functionalities like heart rate monitoring, GPS tracking, and seamless smartphone integration.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Health and fitness tracking</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>GPS and connectivity features</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Stylish designs</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Where to Buy:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_bd8aF6T">Daraz</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://www.rokomari.com/">Rokomar</a><a href="https://rkmri.co/eAlI0elSAeoo/">i</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Wireless Earbuds</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Wireless earbuds provide a wire-free audio experience, making them perfect for on-the-go listening. Top-rated options include Apple AirPods Pro, Samsung Galaxy Buds Pro, and Sony WF-1000XM4, known for their sound quality, noise cancellation, and comfort.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High-quality sound</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noise cancellation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Comfortable fit</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Where to Buy:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_bd8aF6T">Daraz</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://www.rokomari.com/">Rokomar</a><a href="https://rkmri.co/eAlI0elSAeoo/">i</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Smart Home Devices</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Smart home devices like Amazon Echo, Google Nest Hub, and Xiaomi Mi Smart Home Kit enhance convenience and security. These devices allow you to control home appliances, set reminders, and get real-time updates using voice commands.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Home automation</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Voice control</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Enhanced security</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Where to Buy:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_bd8aF6T">Daraz</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://rkmri.co/eAlI0elSAeoo/">Rokomari</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Gaming Consoles</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For gaming enthusiasts, consoles like PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X, and Nintendo Switch offer immersive gaming experiences with high-definition graphics and extensive game libraries.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Immersive gaming experience</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High-definition graphics</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Extensive game libraries</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Where to Buy:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_bd8aF6T">Daraz</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://rkmri.co/eAlI0elSAeoo/">Rokomari</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Tablets</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tablets like the Apple iPad Pro, Samsung Galaxy Tab S8, and Microsoft Surface Pro are perfect for productivity, entertainment, and creative tasks. They offer powerful performance, high-resolution displays, and compatibility with accessories like keyboards and styluses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Powerful performance</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High-resolution displays</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Versatility with accessories</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Where to Buy:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_bd8aF6T">Daraz</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://rkmri.co/eAlI0elSAeoo/">Rokomari</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Cameras</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For photography enthusiasts, digital cameras such as the Canon EOS R5, Sony Alpha a7 III, and Nikon Z6 II provide exceptional image quality and versatility. These cameras are ideal for capturing both professional-grade photos and videos.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Exceptional image quality</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Versatile shooting modes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Suitable for both photos and videos</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Where to Buy:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_bd8aF6T">Daraz</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://rkmri.co/eAlI0elSAeoo/">Rokomari</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Portable Speakers</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Portable Bluetooth speakers like the JBL Charge 5, Bose SoundLink Revolve, and Sony SRS-XB43 are great for music on the go. They offer powerful sound, durability, and long battery life, making them perfect for outdoor activities and travel.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Powerful sound</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Durable design</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Long battery life</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Where to Buy:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_bd8aF6T">Daraz</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://rkmri.co/eAlI0elSAeoo/">Rokomari</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Drones</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Drones such as the DJI Mavic Air 2, DJI Mini 2, and Autel Robotics EVO Lite+ are popular for aerial photography and videography. They offer advanced features like high-resolution cameras, stable flight controls, and intelligent shooting modes.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>High-resolution cameras</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Stable flight controls</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Intelligent shooting modes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Where to Buy:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_bd8aF6T">Daraz</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href="https://rkmri.co/eAlI0elSAeoo/">Rokomari</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em><strong>The tech market in Bangladesh is booming, with a wide array of gadgets available to suit every need and budget. Whether you\'re looking to upgrade your smartphone, enhance your gaming experience, or add smart home functionality, these top 10 tech gadgets are excellent choices. Make sure to check out the recommended retailers, Daraz and Rokomari, to find the best deals and latest models. Happy shopping!</strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Bangladesh is experiencing a tech renaissance, with a wide variety of cutting-edge gadgets becoming readily available. From smartphones and smartwatches to gaming consoles and drones, there\'s something for every tech enthusiast. Whether you’re upgrading your tech arsenal or looking for the perfect gift, these top 10 tech gadgets should be on your radar.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/OIP.jpg', 2, NULL, 'publish', 50, 0, '4.68', 16, '2024-06-04 20:25:17', '2024-06-04 20:25:17', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (52, 2442, 1, '10 Reasons Why Mangoes are the Best Fruit', '10-reasons-why-mangoes-are-the-best-fruit', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When it comes to fruits, few can rival the mango. Often hailed as the "king of fruits," mangoes are celebrated for their delectable flavor, impressive nutrient profile, and numerous health benefits. In this blog post, we will delve into ten compelling reasons why mangoes are considered the best fruit and why they should be a staple in your <a href="/?s=diet">diet</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>BUY Mangoes in USA: <strong><em><a href="https://amzn.to/4cxNoJx">$2.49 Each</a></em></strong> / <strong><em><a href="https://amzn.to/3WaGYdJ">$1.00 Each</a></em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mango Bar in Bangladesh: <em><strong><a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_beSd2hf">BDT249 500gm</a></strong></em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Unparalleled Flavor</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mangoes are renowned for their unique and delightful flavor. Their sweet, juicy, and slightly tangy taste makes them a favorite among fruit lovers worldwide. The perfect balance of sweetness and tartness creates a rich, complex flavor profile that is simply irresistible. Whether you enjoy them fresh, dried, or as part of a dish, mangoes never fail to satisfy your taste buds.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Nutrient Powerhouse</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mangoes are a nutritional treasure trove. They are packed with essential vitamins and minerals that are crucial for maintaining good health. One cup of sliced mango provides:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Vitamin A:</strong> Important for vision, immune function, and skin health.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Vitamin C:</strong> An antioxidant that supports the immune system and helps the body absorb iron.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Vitamin E:</strong> Helps protect cells from oxidative damage and keeps the skin healthy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>B Vitamins:</strong> Including B6, which supports brain health and metabolism.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Minerals:</strong> Such as potassium and magnesium, which are vital for heart health and muscle function.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Rich in Antioxidants</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mangoes are loaded with antioxidants like quercetin, beta-carotene, and astragalin. These compounds play a crucial role in neutralizing harmful free radicals in the body, thereby reducing oxidative stress and lowering the risk of chronic diseases such as heart disease, cancer, and diabetes. The high antioxidant content also contributes to anti-aging properties, keeping your skin youthful and vibrant.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Supports Digestive Health</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mangoes contain digestive enzymes such as amylases that help break down carbohydrates into simple sugars, facilitating easier digestion. They are also high in dietary fiber, which promotes healthy digestion by preventing constipation and encouraging regular bowel movements. The combination of enzymes and fiber makes mangoes an excellent choice for maintaining a healthy digestive system.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Boosts Immunity</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The high vitamin C content in mangoes makes them a powerful ally for your immune system. Vitamin C stimulates the production of white blood cells, which are essential for fighting infections and diseases. Additionally, the presence of vitamin A in mangoes supports the immune system by maintaining the integrity of mucous membranes, which act as a barrier against pathogens.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Great for Skin and Hair</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The vitamins and antioxidants found in mangoes have significant benefits for your skin and hair. Vitamin A and C play a key role in collagen production, which is vital for maintaining the elasticity and firmness of your skin. Vitamin E, on the other hand, helps protect your skin from damage caused by UV rays and pollution. Regular consumption of mangoes can result in healthier, more radiant skin and stronger, shinier hair.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Hydrating and Refreshing</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With high water content, mangoes are an excellent way to stay hydrated, especially during the hot summer months. Proper hydration is crucial for maintaining overall health, as it helps regulate body temperature, keeps your skin moisturized, and supports various bodily functions. Eating mangoes can contribute to your daily fluid intake, ensuring you stay refreshed and energized.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Culinary Versatility</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the standout features of mangoes is their versatility in the kitchen. They can be enjoyed in countless ways, from eating them fresh to incorporating them into various dishes. Mangoes can be blended into smoothies, added to salads, used in desserts like mango sorbet or ice cream, made into sauces or salsas, and even cooked in savory dishes like mango chicken or mango curry. Their ability to complement both sweet and savory flavors makes them a valuable ingredient in many cuisines.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Promotes Eye Health</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mangoes are a rich source of beta-carotene and vitamin A, both of which are essential for maintaining good vision. Beta-carotene, a precursor to vitamin A, helps protect the surface of the eye (cornea) and is vital for low-light and color vision. Regular consumption of mangoes can help prevent night blindness, dry eyes, and reduce the risk of age-related macular degeneration, ensuring your eyes stay healthy as you age.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Natural Energy Booster</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mangoes are a great source of natural sugars such as fructose and glucose, providing a quick and healthy energy boost. These natural sugars are easily digested and converted into energy, making mangoes an ideal snack for replenishing your energy levels without the need for processed foods or sugary snacks. Whether you need a mid-afternoon pick-me-up or a post-workout snack, mangoes can provide the energy you need to power through your day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Mangoes are much more than just a delicious fruit. They are a powerhouse of essential nutrients, antioxidants, and health benefits. From boosting your immune system and promoting digestive health to enhancing your skin and eye health, mangoes offer a multitude of reasons to be considered the best fruit. Their incredible flavor, hydrating properties, and culinary versatility only add to their appeal. So, the next time you\'re looking for a tasty and nutritious treat, reach for a mango and enjoy the myriad benefits it has to offer.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'When it comes to fruits, few can rival the mango. Often hailed as the "king of fruits," mangoes are celebrated for their delectable flavor, impressive nutrient profile, and numerous health benefits. In this blog post, we will delve into ten compelling reasons why mangoes are considered the best fruit and why they should be a staple in your diet.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/OIP-1.jpg', 4, NULL, 'publish', 52, 0, '4.70', 12, '2024-06-05 19:24:08', '2024-06-05 19:24:08', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (53, 2445, 1, 'Top 10 Hollywood Movies of All Time', 'top-10-hollywood-movies-of-all-time', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hollywood has produced countless films over the decades, but only a few have left an indelible mark on cinema and popular culture. Here\'s a detailed look at ten of the greatest Hollywood <a href="/?s=movies">movies</a> of all time, considering critical acclaim, box office success, cultural impact, and enduring popularity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>Movie Title</th><th>Year</th><th>Director</th><th>Buy 4K on Amazon</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>The Godfather</td><td>1972</td><td>Francis Ford Coppola</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3yW16XN">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Citizen Kane</td><td>1941</td><td>Orson Welles</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3VjmnlN">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Casablanca</td><td>1942</td><td>Michael Curtiz</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3KADHgZ">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Schindler\'s List</td><td>1993</td><td>Steven Spielberg</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3KBHfj4">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Gone with the Wind</td><td>1939</td><td>Victor Fleming</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3x9qkkO">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Star Wars: Episode IV</td><td>1977</td><td>George Lucas</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3RHmPJJ">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Pulp Fiction</td><td>1994</td><td>Quentin Tarantino</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3XgKWCy">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>The Shawshank Redemption</td><td>1994</td><td>Frank Darabont</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3x5yueb">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>The Dark Knight</td><td>2008</td><td>Christopher Nolan</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/4aTAfc4">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Lawrence of Arabia</td><td>1962</td><td>David Lean</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/4cgfZCN">Buy</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">In-Depth Look at Each Film</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. The Godfather (1972)</strong><br>Directed by Francis Ford Coppola, "The Godfather" is often hailed as one of the greatest films in world cinema. It tells the story of the powerful Italian-American crime family of Don Vito Corleone, focusing on the transformation of his youngest son, Michael Corleone, from a reluctant outsider to a ruthless mafia boss. The film is renowned for its compelling characters, intricate plot, and masterful direction. It won three Oscars, including Best Picture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Citizen Kane (1941)</strong><br>Directed by and starring Orson Welles, "Citizen Kane" examines the life of publishing tycoon Charles Foster Kane, inspired by the real-life figure William Randolph Hearst. The film is celebrated for its groundbreaking use of deep focus, innovative narrative structure, and Welles\' towering performance. It\'s frequently cited as the greatest film ever made and has influenced countless filmmakers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Casablanca (1942)</strong><br>Set against the backdrop of World War II, "Casablanca" is a romantic drama that follows Rick Blaine, an American expatriate who runs a nightclub in Casablanca. When his former lover Ilsa Lund reenters his life, Rick must choose between his love for her and helping her husband, a resistance leader, escape the Nazis. Directed by Michael Curtiz, the film features iconic performances by Humphrey Bogart and Ingrid Bergman and won three Oscars, including Best Picture.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Schindler\'s List (1993)</strong><br>Steven Spielberg\'s "Schindler\'s List" is a harrowing portrayal of the Holocaust, focusing on the true story of Oskar Schindler, a German businessman who saved over a thousand Jews by employing them in his factories. The film is noted for its stark black-and-white cinematography, powerful performances, and its unflinching depiction of the horrors of the Holocaust. It won seven Oscars, including Best Picture and Best Director.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Gone with the Wind (1939)</strong><br>An epic romance set during the American Civil War and Reconstruction, "Gone with the Wind" follows the life of Scarlett O\'Hara, a headstrong Southern belle. Directed by Victor Fleming, the film is known for its grand scale, dramatic storytelling, and memorable performances, particularly by Vivien Leigh and Clark Gable. It won eight Oscars, including Best Picture, and remains one of the highest-grossing films of all time when adjusted for inflation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Star Wars: Episode IV – A New Hope (1977)</strong><br>George Lucas\'s "Star Wars: Episode IV – A New Hope" revolutionized the sci-fi genre and launched one of the most successful franchises in film history. The film follows Luke Skywalker as he joins forces with Princess Leia, Han Solo, and others to fight the evil Galactic Empire. Its groundbreaking special effects, imaginative storytelling, and enduring characters have made it a cultural phenomenon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. Pulp Fiction (1994)</strong><br>Quentin Tarantino\'s "Pulp Fiction" is known for its eclectic dialogue, ironic mix of humor and violence, and nonlinear storyline. The film weaves together multiple interconnected stories involving crime and redemption in Los Angeles. It won the Palme d\'Or at the Cannes Film Festival and has had a significant impact on independent filmmaking, influencing a generation of directors.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>8. The Shawshank Redemption (1994)</strong><br>Based on a novella by Stephen King, "The Shawshank Redemption" tells the story of Andy Dufresne, a man wrongfully imprisoned for the murder of his wife and her lover. Inside Shawshank Prison, he befriends fellow inmate Red and ultimately finds hope and redemption. Directed by Frank Darabont, the film was nominated for seven Oscars and frequently tops IMDb\'s list of highest-rated movies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>9. The Dark Knight (2008)</strong><br>Directed by Christopher Nolan, "The Dark Knight" is a critically acclaimed superhero film that transcends the genre. The film explores complex themes of chaos and morality through the battle between Batman and the Joker. Heath Ledger\'s portrayal of the Joker is considered one of the greatest performances in film history, earning him a posthumous Oscar. The film won two Oscars and set a new standard for comic book adaptations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>10. Lawrence of Arabia (1962)</strong><br>David Lean\'s "Lawrence of Arabia" is an epic historical drama that chronicles T.E. Lawrence\'s experiences in the Arabian Peninsula during World War I. The film is known for its stunning cinematography, sweeping landscapes, and complex portrayal of Lawrence\'s identity and motivations. It won seven Oscars, including Best Picture, and remains a landmark in cinematic history.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These ten films represent the pinnacle of Hollywood filmmaking, each offering unique contributions to the art of cinema and leaving a lasting legacy on audiences worldwide.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Hollywood has produced countless films over the decades, but only a few have left an indelible mark on cinema and popular culture. Here\'s a detailed look at ten of the greatest Hollywood movies of all time, considering critical acclaim, box office success, cultural impact, and enduring popularity.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/movie-director-clap-2545676.jpg', 12, NULL, 'publish', 108, 0, '4.83', 29, '2024-06-08 19:37:31', '2024-06-08 19:37:31', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (54, 2454, 1, 'Top 10 Bollywood Movies of All Time', 'top-10-bollywood-movies-of-all-time', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Over the years, Mumbai, India-based Bollywood, the Hindi-language film industry, has produced several timeless films. Here is a thorough examination of ten of the best <a href="/?s=Bollywood">Bollywood</a> movies ever made, taking into account their lasting appeal, cultural influence, box office performance, and critical acclaim.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {"hasFixedLayout":false} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>Movie Title</th><th>Year</th><th>Director</th><th>Buy on Amazon</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>Sholay</td><td>1975</td><td>Ramesh Sippy</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3KADPwZ">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Mughal-E-Azam</td><td>1960</td><td>K. Asif</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3KzH0oJ">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dilwale Dulhania Le Jayenge</td><td>1995</td><td>Aditya Chopra</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3KGAPz7">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Mother India</td><td>1957</td><td>Mehboob Khan</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3Kz0uKc">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Pyaasa</td><td>1957</td><td>Guru Dutt</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3XaxY9l">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Lagaan</td><td>2001</td><td>Ashutosh Gowariker</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3xcyOrx">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>3 Idiots</td><td>2009</td><td>Rajkumar Hirani</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3Ky5Pl5">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>Anand</td><td>1971</td><td>Hrishikesh Mukherjee</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/3Rfcqok">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Gully Boy</td><td>2019</td><td>Zoya Akhtar</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/4aTACmY">Buy</a></td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>Dangal</td><td>2016</td><td>Nitesh Tiwari</td><td><a href="https://amzn.to/4b2EaUg">Buy</a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">In-Depth Look at Each Film</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>1. Sholay (1975)</strong><br>Directed by Ramesh Sippy, "Sholay" is considered one of the greatest Bollywood Movies ever made. It tells the story of two criminals, Veeru and Jai, hired by a retired police officer to capture the ruthless bandit Gabbar Singh. The film is known for its memorable characters, dialogues, and music. It became a blockbuster and influenced generations of filmmakers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>2. Mughal-E-Azam (1960)</strong><br>Directed by K. Asif, "Mughal-E-Azam" is an epic historical drama that portrays the love story between Prince Salim (later Emperor Jahangir) and the court dancer Anarkali. The film is celebrated for its grand production design, exquisite costumes, and powerful performances. It is one of the most expensive films of its time and remains a milestone in Indian cinema.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>3. Dilwale Dulhania Le Jayenge (1995)</strong><br>Directed by Aditya Chopra, "Dilwale Dulhania Le Jayenge" is a romantic drama that follows the love story of Raj and Simran, who meet during a trip to Europe. The film has become a cultural phenomenon, defining romance for a generation. It is the longest-running film in Bollywood Movies history, still showing in theaters decades after its release.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>4. Mother India (1957)</strong><br>Directed by Mehboob Khan, "Mother India" is a powerful portrayal of a woman\'s struggle to raise her children in the face of adversity. The film is known for its strong performances, particularly by Nargis, and its social themes. It was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Foreign Language Film and remains a landmark in Bollywood Movies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>5. Pyaasa (1957)</strong><br>Directed by and starring Guru Dutt, "Pyaasa" is considered one of the greatest films ever made. It tells the story of a struggling poet trying to make his mark in a materialistic world. The film is known for its soulful music, poignant storyline, and Guru Dutt\'s visionary direction. It is often cited in lists of the greatest films of all time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>6. Lagaan (2001)</strong><br>Directed by Ashutosh Gowariker, "Lagaan" is a sports drama set in colonial India. The film follows a group of villagers who challenge the British to a cricket match to avoid paying high taxes. It was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Foreign Language Film and is known for its unique storyline, blending sports and historical drama.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>7. 3 Idiots (2009)</strong><br>Directed by Rajkumar Hirani, "3 Idiots" is a comedy-drama that follows the lives of three engineering students and their struggles with the rigid Indian educational system. It is one of the highest-grossing Bollywood Movies of all time and has had a profound impact on Indian society and education. The film is celebrated for its humor, performances, and social message.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>8. Anand (1971)</strong><br>Directed by Hrishikesh Mukherjee, "Anand" is a heart-wrenching story of a terminally ill cancer patient, Anand, and his friendship with his doctor. The film is known for its brilliant performances by Rajesh Khanna and Amitabh Bachchan, as well as its memorable music. It remains a beloved classic in Indian cinema.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>9. Gully Boy (2019)</strong><br>Directed by Zoya Akhtar, "Gully Boy" is a musical drama inspired by the lives of Mumbai\'s street rappers. The film follows the journey of an aspiring rapper from the slums of Mumbai as he rises to fame. It won multiple awards and was India\'s entry to the Oscars. The film is celebrated for its realistic portrayal of Mumbai\'s rap scene and its powerful performances.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>10. Dangal (2016)</strong><br>Directed by Nitesh Tiwari, "Dangal" is based on the true story of wrestler Mahavir Singh Phogat and his daughters, who become world-class wrestlers. The film is one of the highest-grossing Indian films and is known for its inspiring story and powerful performances, particularly by Aamir Khan. It has been praised for its depiction of women\'s empowerment and sportsmanship.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These ten films represent the pinnacle of Bollywood filmmaking, each offering unique contributions to the art of cinema and leaving a lasting legacy on audiences worldwide.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Over the years, Mumbai, India-based Bollywood, the Hindi-language film industry, has produced several timeless films. Here is a thorough examination of ten of the best Bollywood films ever made, taking into account their lasting appeal, cultural influence, box office performance, and critical acclaim.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/bollywood-movie-cinema-1687410.jpg', 12, NULL, 'publish', 48, 0, '4.57', 17, '2024-06-08 19:52:26', '2024-06-08 19:52:26', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (55, 2465, 1, 'Must Read Bengali Books of 2024 - A Review of \\"Adharmagrantha\\" by Aninda Akash', 'must-read-bengali-books-of-2024-a-review-of-adharmagrantha-by-aninda-akash', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><em><strong><a href="https://rkmri.co/SeeMy02oEATM/"><em><strong>Adharmagrantha</strong></em> (2024)</a></strong></em>: <em><strong>Aninda Akash\'s Poetic Journey in "Adharmagrantha"</strong></em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Aninda Akash is a poet known for his evocative works in <a href="/?s=Bengali">Bengali</a> literature. His notable collections include "Brishti O Borofer Gangchil" (2018) and "Old School Cafe Kingba Jolforing" (2021). His latest work, "Adharmagrantha," was released in February 2024 during the Ekushey Book Fair. This book is a collection of short poems, with many consisting of just one or two lines, offering a profound reflection on contemporary human philosophy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2468,"width":"415px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><a href="https://rkmri.co/SeeMy02oEATM/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/20240612_075343-768x1024.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2468" style="width:415px;height:auto"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>"Adharmagrantha" is divided into three parts: "Adharmagrantha," "Love in the Time of Corona," and "Ummad Somogro." Each section delves into different aspects of the human condition and societal observations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Originally penned in Bengali, the poems have been translated into English by Joytirmoy Chakrabarti. This bilingual approach ensures that the collection reaches a wider audience, making Aninda Akash\'s profound insights accessible to readers beyond the Bengali-speaking community.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The dedication of "Adharmagrantha" to two legendary literary figures, Moulana Jalaluddin Mohammad Rumi and Mirza Ghalib, adds a significant layer of depth to the collection. Rumi, a 13th-century Persian poet and Sufi mystic, and Ghalib, a 19th-century Urdu and Persian poet, are revered for their spiritual and philosophical contributions. By dedicating his work to these great poets, Aninda Akash acknowledges their enduring influence on his own poetic journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>"Adharmagrantha" is more than just a collection of poems; it is a mirror reflecting the complexities and contradictions of our times. Through his succinct and poignant verses, Aninda Akash invites readers to ponder the deeper meanings of existence, love, and madness. His ability to convey profound truths in such a condensed form is a testament to his poetic genius.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In an era often overwhelmed by noise and chaos, "Adharmagrantha" offers a moment of introspection and clarity. It challenges readers to look beyond the surface and engage with the philosophical underpinnings of their everyday experiences. This collection is a significant contribution to contemporary Bengali literature and a testament to Aninda Akash\'s enduring talent and vision.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-wcgb9","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-wcgb9 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"৳247 at Rokomari","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/SeeMy02oEATM/","hoverEffect":"","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(242,105,0,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }.root-eb-button-wcgb9 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-wcgb9"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-wcgb9 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-wcgb9"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/SeeMy02oEATM/" rel="noopener">৳247 at Rokomari</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->', 'Aninda Akash is a poet known for his evocative works in Bengali literature. His notable collections include "Brishti O Borofer Gangchil" (2018) and "Old School Cafe Kingba Jolforing" (2021). His latest work, "Adharmagrantha," was released in February 2024 during the Ekushey Book Fair.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Blue-Yellow-Black-Photo-How-To-Sell-Online-Youtube-Thumbnail_20240612_092758_0000.jpg', 3, NULL, 'publish', 41, 0, '4.65', 28, '2024-06-11 20:23:42', '2024-06-11 20:23:42', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (56, 2471, 1, 'Top 10 Religion Books in Bangladesh', 'top-10-books-to-understand-religion', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Religion has been a cornerstone of human civilization, shaping cultures, societies, and personal beliefs. To truly understand the diverse tapestry of religious thought, diving into the foundational texts and interpretive works is essential. Here’s a curated list of ten books that provide a comprehensive insight into the world’s major religions, offering perspectives on beliefs, practices, and philosophies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Best Religion Books to Understand Religion in Bangladesh</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><a href="https://rkmri.co/lRlyeeeMNe22/"><em>The Al-Quran</em></a></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As one the holy religion <a href="/?s=book">books</a> of Islam, the Quran is believed to be the word of God as revealed to the Prophet Muhammad. It provides comprehensive guidance on all aspects of life, including law, morality, and spirituality. The Quran\'s poetic and profound verses are central to the faith and practice of over a billion Muslims worldwide.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/N3IyESSIoSle/">The Bhagavad Gita</a></em></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A key scripture in Hinduism, the Bhagavad Gita is a dialogue between Prince Arjuna and the god Krishna. Set on the battlefield of Kurukshetra, it addresses profound spiritual and moral questions, exploring themes of duty, righteousness, and devotion. This text is essential for understanding Hindu philosophy and ethics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><a href="https://rkmri.co/lAp5IAoMTRTy/"><em>The Bible</em></a></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The sacred text of Christianity, the Bible is divided into the Old Testament and the New Testament. It encompasses religious teachings, historical narratives, poetry, and prophecy. The Bible\'s influence extends beyond religion into literature, art, and culture, making it a pivotal text for understanding Western civilization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><strong><a href="https://rkmri.co/53eyAeeEoeAm/"><em>The World\'s Religions</em></a> by Huston Smith</strong></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Huston Smith’s seminal work is one of the brilliant introduction to the major religions practiced around the globe, it is one of the best religion books to understand religion. Covering Hinduism, Buddhism, Confucianism, Taoism, Islam, Judaism, and Christianity, Smith\'s engaging narrative explores the essence of each tradition, providing readers with a balanced and insightful overview.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/TARAmAAAR3ep/">The Dhammapada</a></em></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A collection of sayings of the Buddha, the Dhammapada is a cornerstone of Buddhist literature. It emphasizes the principles of ethical conduct, mental discipline, and wisdom. The verses offer practical advice on leading a life of compassion, mindfulness, and inner peace.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://www.jibonerkotha.com/cat/%E0%A6%A4%E0%A7%8C%E0%A6%B0%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%A4-%E0%A6%B6%E0%A6%B0%E0%A7%80%E0%A6%AB/">The Torah</a></em></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Torah is the foundational text of Judaism, comprising the first five books of the Hebrew Bible. It covers law, ethics, and history, detailing the covenant between God and the people of Israel. The Torah is central to Jewish worship and identity, shaping the religious and cultural practices of Jewish communities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/eN5eeSepMR5e/">Tao Te Ching</a></em> by Laozi</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A fundamental text of Taoism, the Tao Te Ching offers profound wisdom on living in harmony with the Tao (the Way). Laozi’s teachings emphasize simplicity, humility, and compassion, advocating for a life of balance and naturalness. This text is a poetic guide to Taoist philosophy and practice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/STeERIRoTTpy/">Confucius: The Analects</a></em></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Analects is a collection of sayings and ideas attributed to Confucius, focusing on ethics, family, and social harmony. Confucianism, deeply embedded in Chinese culture, emphasizes virtues like respect, loyalty, and filial piety. The Analects remains a vital text for understanding East Asian moral and social philosophy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/NNl2IR3mAeeS/">The Upanishads</a></em></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Upanishads are ancient Indian texts that form the philosophical basis of Hinduism. They explore profound concepts such as Brahman (ultimate reality) and Atman (soul), delving into the nature of existence and the self. The Upanishads offer a contemplative and introspective look at the spiritual foundations of Hindu thought.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://www.rokomari.com/book/190505/the-book-of-mormon-the-original-text">The Book of Mormon</a></em> by Joseph Smith</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Book of Mormon is a sacred text of the Latter-day Saint movement, detailing the religious history of an ancient American civilization. It serves as another testament of Jesus Christ and complements the Bible. The text is central to the beliefs and practices of millions of Latter-day Saints.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><em>These ten books provide a window into the rich and diverse world of religious traditions. Each text offers unique insights into the beliefs, practices, and philosophies that have shaped human civilization for millennia. Whether you seek to deepen your own faith or understand the beliefs of others, these books are essential readings on the journey of religious exploration.</em></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Religion has been a cornerstone of human civilization, shaping cultures, societies, and personal beliefs. To truly understand the diverse tapestry of religious thought, diving into the foundational texts and interpretive works is essential. Here’s a curated list of ten books that provide a comprehensive insight into the world’s major religions, offering perspectives on beliefs, practices, and philosophies.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/hand-buddha-beads-religion-909626.jpg', 3, NULL, 'publish', 70, 0, '4.61', 34, '2024-06-11 20:42:19', '2024-06-11 20:42:19', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (57, 2492, 1, 'Top 10 Wireless Earphones in the USA for 2024', 'top-10-wireless-earphones-in-the-usa-for-2024', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Choosing the perfect pair of <a href="/?s=wireless">wireless</a> earphones can be a daunting task given the plethora of options available in the market. Whether you\'re looking for superior sound quality, advanced noise-canceling capabilities, or budget-friendly options, this guide will help you make an informed decision. Here are the top 10 wireless earphones for 2024, based on expert reviews and user feedback.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Best Wireless Earphones in the USA for 2024</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In 2024, the wireless earphone market in the USA is dominated by models featuring cutting-edge technology, superior sound quality, and innovative features. Key trends include active noise cancellation, seamless device integration, and exceptional sound clarity. Comfort and fit remain crucial, with many top models designed for extended wear without discomfort. Advanced features like adaptive sound control, long battery life, and water resistance are also prevalent. Additionally, many earphones offer customizable sound settings and intuitive touch controls, enhancing user experience. Whether for commuting, working out, or casual listening, the top wireless earphones cater to diverse needs, combining style, performance, and convenience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Comparison Table</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class="wp-block-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Earphones</th><th>Noise-Canceling</th><th>Battery Li