lass="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">Sony WF-1000XM5</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>The Sony WF-1000XM5 stands out with its excellent sound quality, effective active noise cancellation (ANC), and comfortable fit. These earphones are ideal for audiophiles and regular users alike.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noise-Canceling: Yes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 8 hours (earbuds) + 24 hours (charging case)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water Resistance: IPX4</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://amzn.to/45vsBn9">Buy on Amazon</a></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">Apple AirPods Pro (2nd Generation)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>Perfect for Apple enthusiasts, the AirPods Pro (2nd Gen) offer seamless integration with Apple devices, improved ANC, and spatial audio support for an immersive experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noise-Canceling: Yes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 6 hours (earbuds) + 24 hours (charging case)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water Resistance: IPX4</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://amzn.to/4enW7zm">Buy on Amazon</a></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">Bose QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>Known for their superior ANC performance, the Bose QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds also feature spatial audio and excellent sound quality, making them a great choice for travelers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noise-Canceling: Yes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 6 hours (earbuds) + 24 hours (charging case)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water Resistance: IPX4</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://amzn.to/4eqOQio">Buy on Amazon</a></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">Sennheiser Momentum True Wireless 4</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>These earbuds offer outstanding sound quality with support for high-resolution audio. They are ideal for audiophiles who value detail and clarity in their music.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noise-Canceling: Yes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 7 hours (earbuds) + 28 hours (charging case)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water Resistance: IP54</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://amzn.to/45nfuVf">Buy on Amazon</a></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">Google Pixel Buds Pro</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>Google Pixel Buds Pro provide excellent ANC, multipoint connectivity, and a customizable sound profile. These are great for Android users seeking versatility and quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noise-Canceling: Yes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 11 hours (earbuds) + 31 hours (charging case)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water Resistance: IPX4</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://amzn.to/3KMgV62">Buy on Amazon</a></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">Jabra Elite 10</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>Jabra Elite 10 earbuds are designed for active users, offering a stable fit, good sound quality, and effective ANC. They are perfect for workouts and everyday use.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noise-Canceling: Yes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 8 hours (earbuds) + 30 hours (charging case)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water Resistance: IP57</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://amzn.to/3KMxRti">Buy on Amazon</a></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">Anker Soundcore Space A40</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>These budget-friendly earbuds pack impressive features such as ANC, multipoint connectivity, and good battery life, making them a superb value option.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noise-Canceling: Yes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 10 hours (earbuds) + 50 hours (charging case)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water Resistance: IPX4</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://amzn.to/3zbZMQw">Buy on Amazon</a></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">Sony WF-C700N</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>Sony\'s mid-range WF-C700N earbuds offer strong ANC, comfortable fit, and good sound quality, making them an excellent choice for those on a budget.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noise-Canceling: Yes</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 7.5 hours (earbuds) + 15 hours (charging case)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water Resistance: Water-resistant</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://amzn.to/3zdPYp9">Buy on Amazon</a></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">Earfun Air</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>These affordable earbuds deliver a punchy sound, solid build, and decent battery life. They are a great choice for budget-conscious users who still want good performance.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noise-Canceling: No</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 7 hours (earbuds) + 28 hours (charging case)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water Resistance: IPX7</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://amzn.to/4erUcJW">Buy on Amazon</a></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"vivid-red"} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-vivid-red-color has-text-color has-link-color">JBL Vibe Buds</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>JBL Vibe Buds offer good sound quality, reliable performance, and a comfortable fit, making them a great choice for those looking for affordable wireless earbuds.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Noise-Canceling: No</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Battery Life: Up to 8 hours (earbuds) + 24 hours (charging case)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water Resistance: IPX5</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong><a href="https://amzn.to/4cm3dCF">Buy on Amazon</a></strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These wireless earphones cater to a variety of needs and preferences, ensuring there\'s an option for everyone, whether you\'re looking for high-end features, budget-friendly prices, or something in between. Make sure to check for the latest prices and deals on Amazon or other retailers before making your purchase.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Choosing the perfect pair of wireless earphones can be a daunting task given the plethora of options available in the market. Whether you\'re looking for superior sound quality, advanced noise-canceling capabilities, or budget-friendly options, this guide will help you make an informed decision. Here are the top 10 wireless earphones for 2024, based on expert reviews and user feedback.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/earphones-earbuds-music-5598952.jpg', 2, NULL, 'publish', 52, 0, '4.57', 45, '2024-06-16 04:57:50', '2024-06-16 04:57:50', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (58, 2500, 1, 'Bangladesh\'s 10 Most Iconic Animals', 'bangladeshs-10-most-iconic-animals', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bangladesh, a country renowned for its rich cultural heritage and stunning landscapes, is also home to an incredible array of wildlife. From the dense mangrove forests of the Sundarbans to the lush hills of the Chittagong Hill Tracts, Bangladesh boasts a diverse range of habitats that support a variety of iconic animals. These creatures not only contribute to the country’s biodiversity but also hold significant cultural and ecological importance. In this blog, we will explore ten of the most iconic animals of Bangladesh, each playing a vital role in maintaining the ecological balance and enhancing the natural beauty of the region. From the majestic Bengal tiger to the elusive clouded leopard, these animals embody the wild spirit of Bangladesh and highlight the urgent need for their conservation to preserve this unique natural heritage for future generations. Join us as we delve into the fascinating world of Bangladesh’s most iconic wildlife.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Read about Bangladesh\'s wildlife- <strong><em><a href="https://amzn.to/4ckznPk">Wildlife of Bangladesh: Checklist and Guide</a></em></strong>, <strong><em><a href="https://amzn.to/45M5g0w">Protected Areas of Bangladesh: A Guide to Wild</a></em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><em>Bangladesh\'s 10 Most Iconic Animals</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bangladesh, a country known for its lush green landscapes and the world\'s largest delta, the Sundarbans, is home to a rich variety of wildlife. Here are 10 of Bangladesh\'s most iconic animals:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">1. <strong>Royal Bengal Tiger</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":2504,"width":"291px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/tiger-royal-bengal-tiger-predator-6932184-1024x680.jpg" alt="tiger, royal bengal tiger, predator-6932184.jpg" class="wp-image-2504" style="width:291px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scientific Name</strong>: <em>Panthera tigris tigris</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Home</strong>: Sundarbans mangrove forest</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>About</strong>: The Royal Bengal Tiger is the national animal of Bangladesh. It lives in the Sundarbans, the largest mangrove forest in the world. These powerful tigers are vital for the ecosystem, and efforts are being made to protect them from poaching and habitat loss.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">2. <strong>Asian Elephant</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":2505,"width":"368px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/asian-elephant-cub-calf-2108970-1024x668.jpg" alt="asian elephant, cub, calf-2108970.jpg" class="wp-image-2505" style="width:368px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scientific Name</strong>: <em>Elephas maximus</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Home</strong>: Hill forests of Chittagong and Sylhet</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>About</strong>: Asian Elephants are very intelligent and live in the forests of Chittagong and Sylhet. They live in close family groups. However, they face threats from habitat destruction and conflicts with humans.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">3. <strong>Ganges River Dolphin</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":2514,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Ganges_River_Dolphin_cropped.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2514"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scientific Name</strong>: <em>Platanista gangetica</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Home</strong>: Ganges and Brahmaputra rivers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>About</strong>: Known as the "Susu," these dolphins use echolocation to navigate and hunt. They are endangered due to pollution and habitat changes, so protecting their river homes is essential.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">4. <strong>Saltwater Crocodile</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":2507,"width":"413px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/crocodile-alligator-predator-7560138-1024x682.jpg" alt="crocodile, alligator, predator-7560138.jpg" class="wp-image-2507" style="width:413px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scientific Name</strong>: <em>Crocodylus porosus</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Home</strong>: Sundarbans and coastal areas</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>About</strong>: The Saltwater Crocodile is the largest reptile in the world. Found in coastal areas and the Sundarbans, they play a crucial role in their ecosystem. Conservation efforts help reduce conflicts with humans.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>5. Indian Rhinoceros</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":2508,"width":"387px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/rhino-animal-wildlife-343884-1024x682.jpg" alt="rhino, animal, wildlife-343884.jpg" class="wp-image-2508" style="width:387px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scientific Name</strong>: <em>Rhinoceros unicornis</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Home</strong>: Grasslands and wetlands in northwest Bangladesh (now not found in Bangladesh)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>About</strong>: The Indian Rhinoceros, with its single horn, is a symbol of the grasslands. These rhinos are critically endangered due to poaching and habitat loss. Efforts to protect them focus on restoring their habitats and stopping poachers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">6. <strong>Bengal Fox</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":2509,"width":"447px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/fox-animals-animal-4516482-1024x682.jpg" alt="fox, animals, animal-4516482.jpg" class="wp-image-2509" style="width:447px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scientific Name</strong>: <em>Vulpes bengalensis</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Home</strong>: Grasslands and open forests</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>About</strong>: The Bengal Fox, with its bushy tail, helps control rodent populations. They face threats from habitat destruction and hunting.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">7. <strong>Fishing Cat</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":2510,"width":"392px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/fishingcat.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-2510" style="width:392px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scientific Name</strong>: <em>Prionailurus viverrinus</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Home</strong>: Wetlands and mangroves</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>About</strong>: Fishing Cats are great swimmers and hunt fish near water. They are essential for wetland health, but their homes are being destroyed, threatening their survival.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">8. <strong>Clouded Leopard</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":2511,"width":"396px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/main-qimg-e793ec61e4ac73df08d0cc0823ac433f-lq.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2511" style="width:396px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scientific Name</strong>: <em>Neofelis nebulosa</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Home</strong>: Forests of Chittagong Hill Tracts</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>About</strong>: Clouded Leopards have beautiful cloud-like spots and are excellent climbers. They are rare and threatened by deforestation and poaching.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">9. <strong>Pygmy Hog</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":2512,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/images.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2512"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scientific Name</strong>: <em>Porcula salvania</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Home</strong>: Grasslands in northwest Bangladesh</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>About</strong>: The Pygmy Hog is the smallest wild pig and critically endangered. Conservation programs focus on breeding them in captivity and releasing them into the wild.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">10. <strong>Hoolock Gibbon</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":2513,"width":"327px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Gibbon_Hoolock_de_louest-1024x714.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-2513" style="width:327px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Scientific Name</strong>: <em>Hoolock hoolock</em></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Home</strong>: Forests of Sylhet and Chittagong Hill Tracts</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>About</strong>: The Hoolock Gibbon is the only ape in Bangladesh, known for swinging between trees and their loud calls. They are threatened by deforestation and hunting.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><em><strong>Conservation Efforts</strong></em></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Protecting these animals requires the help of the government, organizations, and local communities. Key actions include:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Restoring Habitats</strong>: Planting trees and protecting forests.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Stopping Poaching</strong>: Enforcing laws and patrolling to prevent illegal hunting.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Involving Communities</strong>: Educating locals and providing sustainable ways to make a living.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Researching and Monitoring</strong>: Studying these animals to understand their needs and tracking their numbers.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bangladesh’s wildlife is a treasure that needs our protection. The survival of these animals is important for nature and the people living nearby. By working together and caring for our environment, we can ensure these amazing animals thrive for future generations to see and enjoy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Let’s celebrate and protect the wonderful wildlife of <a href="/?s=Bangladesh">Bangladesh</a>!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Bangladesh, a country known for its lush green landscapes and the world\'s largest delta, the Sundarbans, is home to a rich variety of wildlife. Here are 10 of Bangladesh\'s most iconic animals:', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/tiger-bengal-tiger-animal-5557120.jpg', 4, NULL, 'publish', 66, 0, '4.95', 30, '2024-06-17 11:06:22', '2024-06-17 11:06:22', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (59, 2521, 1, '5 Best Books of Asim Saha', '5-best-books-of-asim-saha', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Asim Saha, born on February 20, 1949, in Bangladesh, was a distinguished poet and novelist. Over his prolific career, he made significant contributions to <a href="/?s=Bengali">Bengali</a> literature. In recognition of his literary achievements, Saha was honored with the prestigious Bangla Academy Literary Award in 2011 for his poetry. His influence and contributions to the Bengali language and literature were further acknowledged in 2019 when he was awarded the Ekushey Padak, the second-highest civilian award in Bangladesh. Asim Saha passed away on June 18, 2024, leaving behind a rich legacy in Bengali literature.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Poetry of Asim Saha</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>One of the hallmarks of Saha\'s poetry is his ability to capture the essence of human emotions and experiences. He delves into themes of love, loss, identity, and existential musings, often drawing from personal experiences and observations of everyday life. His verses are imbued with a sense of melancholy and nostalgia, which resonates with readers on an intimate level.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nature plays a significant role in Saha\'s poems, serving as both a backdrop and a character in its own right. His vivid descriptions of landscapes, seasons, and natural elements create a sensory experience that transports readers to the heart of his poetic world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Saha\'s contribution to Bengali literature extends beyond his poetry. He is also known for his essays and literary critiques, further showcasing his versatility and depth as a writer. Overall, Asim Saha\'s poetry continues to inspire and touch the hearts of many, cementing his legacy in the annals of Bengali literature.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While he has written many books, here are five of his most notable works that are highly regarded:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><em><a href="https://rkmri.co/p22SMN3lMAo2/">Asim Sahar Shrestho Kabita</a> -অসীম সাহার শ্রেষ্ঠ কবিতা </em></strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":2522,"sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom","metadata":{"name":"Asim Saha"}} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><a href="https://rkmri.co/p22SMN3lMAo2/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Asim_Sahar_Shrestho_Kobita-Asim_Saha-4c873-223722.png" alt="" class="wp-image-2522"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-kf1a8","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 { margin-top:28px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:28px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(242,105,0,1); border-radius:50px; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-kf1a8 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BUY ON ROKOMARI","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/p22SMN3lMAo2/","hoverEffect":"","btnBac