ng>: Voila! Your 3% extra discount will be applied instantly, reducing the total cost of your order.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Start Saving Today Extra DISCOUNT!</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether you\'re a longtime customer or a first-time visitor to <a href="https://rkmri.co/SpeTI0M02EAS/">Rokomari.com</a>, now is the perfect time to take advantage of the "CHAMPION25" promo code. Treat yourself to that book you\'ve been eyeing, discover new titles to expand your reading list, or even pick up gifts for friends and family – all while enjoying extra savings!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Don\'t miss out on this opportunity to make your book-buying experience even more rewarding. <a href="https://www.rokomari.com/?utm_source=blog&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=influencer_promo">Visit Rokomari.com n</a><a href="https://rkmri.co/SpeTI0M02EAS/">ow</a> and apply the "CHAMPION26" or "CHAMPION2026" promo code at checkout. Embark on a literary journey filled with savings and satisfaction. Happy reading!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"elements":{"link":{"color":{"text":"var:preset|color|vivid-red"}}}},"textColor":"ast-global-color-0"} -->\n<p class="has-ast-global-color-0-color has-text-color has-link-color"><strong><em>Click this link to apply promocode and get the discount</em>- <em><a href="https://rkmri.co/SpeTI0M02EAS/">Rokomari.com</a></em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'In the bustling world of online shopping, finding great deals can make a big difference, especially when you\'re on the lookout for books. For avid readers and book enthusiasts in Bangladesh, Rokomari.com stands out as the go-to destination for a wide range of titles across various genres.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Rokomari-promocode-sera10.jpg', 3, NULL, 'publish', 199, 0, '4.85', 25, '2024-06-22 20:52:16', '2024-06-22 20:52:16', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (61, 2540, 1, '10 Key Political Events in Bangladesh 2024', 'bangladesh-in-2024-key-political-events-shaping-the-nations-future', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In 2024, Bangladesh\'s political landscape was marked by significant turmoil and notable events that shaped the nation\'s future. The January 7 general election was a pivotal moment, characterized by the opposition <a href="/?s=Bangladesh+">Bangladesh</a> Nationalist Party\'s (BNP) boycott, leading to the ruling Awami League (AL) securing a fourth consecutive term amidst allegations of electoral unfairness and low voter turnout. This election set the stage for a year of intense <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Politics_of_Bangladesh">political</a> activity, including nationwide strikes and blockades led by the BNP, which disrupted the economy and prompted mass arrests by the government. Throughout the year, the AL government faced increased pressure from Western nations like the U.S. and the EU to improve democratic processes, while balancing relations with major powers such as India and China. The internal struggles within the BNP, debates over the potential formation of a caretaker government, and significant grassroots mobilization efforts also defined the political narrative of Bangladesh in 2024.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Here are the top 10 political events in Bangladesh in 2024:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"ordered":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>January 7 General Election</strong>: The election was notable for the boycott by the opposition Bangladesh Nationalist Party (BNP). The ruling Awami League (AL) won a fourth consecutive term amid accusations of unfair practices and low voter turnout.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Opposition Boycott and Strikes</strong>: In response to the election process, the BNP initiated nationwide strikes and blockades, causing significant disruption and economic loss. The government responded by arresting many BNP members.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Formation of New Government</strong>: Following the election, Prime Minister Sheikh Hasina established a new government, continuing the AL\'s long-standing rule. This period saw increased tensions and scrutiny from the international community.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>U.S. and EU Pressure</strong>: Western countries, particularly the U.S. and the EU, pressured Bangladesh to enhance its democratic processes. The BNP supported this pressure, in contrast to India and China, who backed the AL.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Caretaker Government Debate</strong>: There were ongoing discussions and rumors about the possibility of a caretaker government to oversee future elections. While the AL showed some willingness to consider this, no definitive steps were taken.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Economic Challenges</strong>: Bangladesh faced economic difficulties, including inflation and disruptions caused by political unrest. These issues were worsened by the opposition-led strikes and blockades.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Internal BNP Struggles</strong>: The BNP struggled with internal conflicts and challenges in maintaining unity, especially with leadership disputes and differing strategies among its members.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Human Rights Concerns</strong>: The government\'s crackdown on dissent continued to attract criticism from human rights organizations. Reports highlighted arrests of opposition members and restrictions on freedom of expression.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Geopolitical Shifts</strong>: The geopolitical landscape saw shifts as Bangladesh balanced relations between major powers like the U.S., India, and China, each having strategic interests that influenced its domestic politics.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Grassroots Mobilization</strong>: Despite challenges, the BNP managed to mobilize significant grassroots support, drawing large crowds to its rallies and maintaining a strong presence despite the boycott and arrests.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These events collectively highlight the ongoing political volatility and the complex interplay of domestic and international influences in Bangladesh in 2024.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Bangladesh\'s political landscape was marked by significant turmoil and notable events that shaped the nation\'s future. The January 7 general election was a pivotal moment, characterized by the opposition Bangladesh Nationalist Party\'s (BNP) boycott, leading to the ruling Awami League (AL) securing a fourth consecutive term amidst allegations of electoral unfairness and low voter turnout. This election set the stage for a year of intense political activity, including nationwide strikes and blockades led by the BNP, ', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Top10political-sera10.jpg', 9, NULL, 'publish', 54, 0, '4.57', 21, '2024-06-23 10:31:48', '2024-06-23 10:31:48', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (62, 2548, 1, 'Daraz Global Clearance Campaign 2024', 'daraz-global-clearance-campaign-unbeatable-deals-on-chinese-products', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Are you ready for the biggest online shopping event of the year? Daraz, Bangladesh\'s leading online shopping platform and a proud child company of Alibaba, is bringing an extraordinary opportunity for shoppers this June with the <a href="/?s=Daraz">Daraz</a> Global Clearance Campaign. This special event offers a plethora of Chinese products at unbeatable prices, with discounts up to 70%, making it the perfect time to grab amazing deals and discounts.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To Join the Daraz Global Clearance <a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_beEJIXf"><em><strong>Click Here</strong></em></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Clearance Campaign: Why Daraz is the Best Online Shopping Platform in Bangladesh</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Daraz has established itself as the go-to online shopping destination in Bangladesh. With a vast array of products, seamless user experience, and reliable delivery services, Daraz has won the trust of millions. As part of the Alibaba Group, Daraz benefits from world-class technology and logistics support, ensuring a smooth and satisfying shopping experience for its users.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Clearance Campaign Key Features of Daraz:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"ordered":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Wide Range of Products</strong>: From electronics to fashion, home appliances to beauty products, Daraz offers an extensive selection of items catering to every need and preference.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>User-Friendly Interface</strong>: The Daraz website and mobile app are designed for ease of use, making browsing and purchasing straightforward and hassle-free.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Secure Transactions</strong>: Daraz employs robust security measures to ensure all transactions are safe and protected.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Fast and Reliable Delivery</strong>: With an efficient logistics network, Daraz guarantees timely delivery of your orders right to your doorstep.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Excellent Customer Service</strong>: Daraz\'s dedicated customer service team is always ready to assist with any queries or issues.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">The Daraz Global Clearance Campaign</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This June 2024, Daraz is launching the Global Clearance Campaign, a golden opportunity for shoppers in Bangladesh to buy high-quality Chinese products at incredibly low prices. Whether you\'re looking for the latest gadgets, stylish clothing, or practical household items, this campaign promises something for everyone. And the best part? You can enjoy discounts of up to 70% on a wide range of products.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Why You Shouldn\'t Miss This Event:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Exclusive Discounts</strong>: Enjoy special discounts that you won\'t find anywhere else, with savings of up to 70%. This is your chance to buy premium products at a fraction of their original price.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Diverse Product Range</strong>: The campaign features a wide variety of products sourced directly from China, ensuring top quality and authenticity.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Limited-Time Offers</strong>: These deals are available for a limited time only, so make sure to act fast and grab your desired items before they run out.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Easy Access</strong>: With just a few clicks on the Daraz app or website, you can have your favorite products delivered to your home, saving you the hassle of traditional shopping.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Tips to Make the Most of the Campaign</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {"ordered":true} -->\n<ol><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Create a Daraz Account</strong>: If you haven\'t already, sign up for a Daraz account to access all the deals and manage your orders efficiently.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Download the Daraz App</strong>: The app offers a more convenient shopping experience and might feature app-exclusive deals.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Prepare a Wishlist</strong>: Browse the Daraz website before the campaign starts and add your favorite items to your wishlist for quicker access once the sale begins.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Check Daily for Flash Sales</strong>: Keep an eye out for flash sales and limited-time offers to score the best deals.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Stay Updated</strong>: Follow Daraz on social media and subscribe to their newsletter to stay informed about the latest deals and promotions.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ol>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Daraz Global Clearance Campaign is a shopping extravaganza you don\'t want to miss. With the promise of great discounts on high-quality Chinese products, this event is set to redefine your shopping experience. Mark your calendars for June 2024, and get ready to indulge in a shopping spree like never before. Enjoy discounts of up to 70% and happy shopping with Daraz!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To Join the Daraz Global Clearance <a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_beEJIXf"><em><strong>Click Here</strong></em></a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Are you ready for the biggest online shopping event of the year? Daraz, Bangladesh\'s leading online shopping platform and a proud child company of Alibaba, is bringing an extraordinary opportunity for shoppers this June with the Daraz Global Clearance Campaign. This special event offers a plethora of Chinese products at unbeatable prices, with discounts up to 70%, making it the perfect time to grab amazing deals and discounts.', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Darazglobalsale-sera10.jpg', 4, NULL, 'publish', 58, 0, '4.57', 42, '2024-06-23 19:13:35', '2024-06-23 19:13:35', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
