color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"BDT2359 at Rokomari","textColor":"rgba(255,0,0,1)","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/SyNMApmIMRRN/","hoverEffect":"","textFontSource":"custom","textFontWeight":"700","wrpMarginTop":"0","wrpMarginBottom":"0","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwborderColor":"rgba(0,0,0,1)","btnBrdShwborderStyle":"solid","btnBrdShwBdr_Top":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Right":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Bottom":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Left":"2","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","showBlockContent":false,"commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-k0zq0 { display:block }.root-eb-button-k0zq0 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-k0zq0 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-k0zq0 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-k0zq0"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-k0zq0 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-k0zq0"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/SyNMApmIMRRN/" rel="noopener">BDT2359 at Rokomari</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Find Silicon Case Cover for Realme Buds T100– <a href="https://click.daraz.com.bd/e/_beNRTu5">Click here</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Sleek and Stylish Design</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":3074,"width":"312px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/20230712_1689158435_377246.jpeg" alt="" class="wp-image-3074" style="width:312px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Realme Buds T100 feature a sleek and modern design, perfectly blending aesthetics with functionality. The Punk Black color adds a striking look, while the compact and lightweight build ensures a comfortable and secure fit for extended use. Whether you\'re on the go, working out, or relaxing at home, these ergonomically designed earbuds stay in place, providing a hassle-free audio experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Powerful Audio Performance</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Equipped with a 10mm Dynamic Bass Driver, the Realme\'s Buds T100 deliver crisp and powerful sound. Whether you\'re enjoying music, watching movies, or making calls, the audio quality is consistently excellent. The inclusion of AAC and SBC audio codecs enhances sound reproduction, ensuring high-quality audio output. Realme\'s dedication to superior sound is evident, making these earbuds a joy for audiophiles.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Extended Battery Life</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Realme\'s Buds T100 stand out for their impressive battery life, offering up to 28 hours of playback time, including the charging case. The 480mAh Lithium Polymer battery ensures long-lasting use, and the quick charging feature provides hours of playback with just 1.5 hours of charging. This extensive battery life makes the Realme Buds T100 ideal for long trips, busy days, and extended workout sessions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Seamless Connectivity</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thanks to Bluetooth 5.3 technology, the Realme\'s Buds T100 provide seamless connectivity with a range of up to 10 meters. Quick pairing ensures an effortless connection to your devices, eliminating the need for complicated setup procedures. Whether you\'re connecting to a smartphone, tablet, or laptop, Buds T100 offer uninterrupted listening pleasure.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Durable and Water-Resistant</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Designed to keep up with an active lifestyle, the Realme\'s Buds T100 have an IPX5 Water Resistant rating. This ensures they can handle splashes and sweat, making them perfect for workouts and outdoor activities. Whether you\'re running in the rain or working out at the gym, the Realme Buds T100 deliver reliable performance in any condition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Reliable Warranty</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Realme\'s Buds T100 come with a 6-month warranty, offering peace of mind with your purchase. Known for their quality products, Realme ensures that your investment is protected, reinforcing their commitment to delivering high-quality and reliable items.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>The Realme Buds T100 in Punk Black offer a fantastic combination of style, performance, and durability at an affordable price. With their sleek design, excellent audio performance, extended battery life, seamless connectivity, and water-resistant build, these earbuds provide exceptional value for money. Whether you\'re a music lover, tech enthusiast, or active individual, the Realme Buds T100 are the perfect audio companion for all your needs. Elevate your listening experience with the Realme Buds T100 and enjoy the future of audio.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'In the crowded market of wireless earbuds, the Realme Buds T100 in Punk Black distinguish themselves as a top choice for music lovers, tech enthusiasts, and active users. Combining', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Black-Smartphone-Review-Youtube-Thumbnail_20240715_135748_0000.png', 2, NULL, 'publish', 23, 0, '4.62', 30, '2024-07-14 20:50:22', '2024-07-14 20:50:22', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (83, 3096, 1, 'Top 10 Bestseller Bengali Short Story Collection Books of 2024', 'top-10-bestseller-bengali-short-story-collection-books-of-2024', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bengali short story anthologies have flourished in 2024, providing readers with a diverse range of stories that explore different aspects of society and human experience. These anthologies highlight the richness and diversity of Bengali literature while encapsulating the social and cultural climate of the area.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These collections\' ability to combine the old and the modern is one of their most distinctive features. The stories are in a variety of genres, including speculative fiction, mystery, and adventure as well as social realism. In addition to offering readers amusement, they also offer profound, thought-provoking insights regarding society conventions, human nature, and the difficulties of contemporary living.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Collections that speak to issues of identity, familial ties, and personal hardships can be found on the 2024 <a href="/?s=bestseller">bestseller</a> lists. These narratives frequently examine the relationship that exists between the community and the individual, delving into the intersections between social norms and individual choices. The narratives are incredibly detailed, with vivid descriptions that give readers a sense of immersion in the locales and characters.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Many of these collections also honor Bengal\'s rich literary past, taking cues from traditional storytelling customs and combining them with contemporary views. A dynamic reading experience is produced by this blending of the ancient and the new, where classic subjects are seen through modern prisms. The stories become more authentic and nuanced when regional accents, cultural allusions, and indigenous storytelling methods are incorporated.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The emphasis on social themes in these volumes is another important feature. The stories don\'t hold back when discussing difficult subjects like gender dynamics, economic inequality, and the effects of past occurrences. The books provide readers a complex picture of the struggles and victories faced by people in various social strata by including these topics into their stories.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The collections also demonstrate the effectiveness of storytelling in maintaining and promoting cultural values. They are relatable to a broad audience because they provide a window into the varied lives and experiences of people in Bengal through captivating narratives and well-developed characters.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In summary, the best collections of Bengali short stories for 2024 are distinguished by their thought-provoking stories, depth of culture, and capacity for introspection. They stand as evidence of the storytelling\'s timeless ability to portray the complexity of life in a changing environment and to capture the human experience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. Baisher Bonna (বাইশের বন্যা) by Tasrif Hasan</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":3097,"width":"213px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><a href="https://rkmri.co/pepe3SANAEoM/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Baisher_Bonna-Tasrif_Khan-2c6fc-274727.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-3097" style="width:213px;height:auto"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>সময় তখন রাত বারোটার কাছাকাছি। সারাদিন ধরে ৭৫০ বস্তা ত্রাণ বিতরণ করে, দিরাইয়ে সেনাবাহিনীর অস্থায়ী ক্যাম্পের উদ্দেশ্যে ফিরছি। দিন শেষে ক্লান্ত হয়ে ত্রাণের বস্তায় হেলান দিয়ে ঝিমাচ্ছিলাম, কখন যে চোখ লেগে গিয়েছিল খেয়াল নেই। হঠাৎ প্রিয়ত আমাকে ঘুম থেকে ডেকে তুলে বললো যে, আমাদের পেছনে ডাকাত তাড়া করছে। আমি হতভম্ব হয়ে গেলাম। প্রচণ্ড বুক কাঁপছে আমার। ডানে-বামে তাকিয়ে দেখি চারপাশটা ঘুটঘুটে অন্ধকার। মাঝিকে ডেকে বললাম যে মামা পেছনে টর্চ জ্বালান। টর্চের আলোয় দেখলাম মাঝবয়সী অনেকগুলো লোক ট্রলারের মধ্যে বাঁশ, ধারালো দা হাতে দাঁড়িয়ে আছে। আমার বুঝতে বাকি রইলো না ট্রলারগুলো যে গতিতে এগোচ্ছে, তাতে বড়জোড় আর দশ মিনিট সময় লাগবে আমাদের ট্রলারটা ধরতে। আমি সেনাবাহিনীকে অনবরত ফোন করতে থাকলাম কিন্তু কোন নেটওয়ার্ক পাচ্ছি না। হঠাৎ মাঝি আমাদের ডেকে বললো, আপনেরা একটা পলিথিনের মধ্যে আপনেগো মোবাইল আর টাকা-পয়সা একসাথে কইরা রাইখা দেন; নাইলে আইজ আর কেউ বাঁইচা ফিরতে পারবেন না!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-vim4b","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-vim4b { margin-top:0px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:0px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-vim4b.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-vim4b .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-vim4b .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(255,255,255,1); border-width:2px; border-color:rgba(0,0,0,1); border-style:solid; border-radius:50px; font-weight:700; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:rgba(255,0,0,1); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-vim4b .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"Buy Now","textColor":"rgba(255,0,0,1)","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/pepe3SANAEoM/","hoverEffect":"","textFontSource":"custom","textFontWeight":"700","wrpMarginTop":"0","wrpMarginBottom":"0","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwborderColor":"rgba(0,0,0,1)","btnBrdShwborderStyle":"solid","btnBrdShwBdr_Top":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Right":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Bottom":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Left":"2","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","showBlockContent":false,"commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-vim4b { display:block }.root-eb-button-vim4b { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-vim4b { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-vim4b { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-vim4b"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-vim4b "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-vim4b"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/pepe3SANAEoM/" rel="noopener">Buy Now</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">2. Onnomanoshko (অন্যমনস্ক) by Zunayed Ivan</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":3098,"width":"212px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><a href="https://rkmri.co/ImAEoyNM3EI3/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Onnomonoshko-Zunayed_Evan-2b9f5-224838.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-3098" style="width:212px;height:auto"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>একজন নিখোঁজ ব্যক্তিকে খুঁজতে গিয়ে অন্য একজন নিখোঁজ হলেন। দুজনের কেউই জানে না, তারা হারিয়ে গেছে। এ রকম একটি গল্প বলার চেষ্টা করেছি। মাঝে মধ্যে দুজনকে একই মানুষ মনে হবে। মাঝেমধ্যে মনে হবে, ওরা আসলে দুজন না। ওরা তিনজন।<br>মনস্তাত্ত্বিক বিভ্রমের নানান স্তরের কর্মকান্ড থেকে এক একটি চরিত্র ধার করা হয়েছে। একটা মানুষ যখন তার কল্পনাকে সত্য মনে করে তখন তার চিন্তা করার সিস্টেমগুলো কেমন করে কাজ করে? কিংবা সমস্যা যখন আরও জটিল হয়? সত্যকে তিনি কল্পনা মনে করছেন!! চারপাশের সবকিছু অ্যাবস্ট্রাক্ট ছবির মতো-অর্ধেক বস্তু অর্ধেক কল্পনা।<br>কিংবা কোনো একটি গল্পের চরিত্র জীবিত একজন মানুষকে মৃত মনে করছে। যাকে তার মৃত মনে হয়, তাকে ব্যাপারটা জানানো হয়েছে। তারা দুজন মিলে সাইকিয়াট্রিস্টের কাছে গেলে সবকিছু উল্টো দিকে ঘুরতে শুরু করে। ভোরবেলায় যে রকম রাত আর দিনের মধ্যে সাক্ষাৎ ঘটে, সে রকম সম্বন্ধ হয় ডিলিউশন আর হ্যালুসিনেশনের মাঝে। যেন ইথারে মিলিয়ে যায় বস্তুগত সূর্য, ভাবগত প্রেম অথবা জীবন।</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-0os68","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-0os68 { margin-top:0px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:0px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-0os68.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-0os68 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-0os68 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(255,255,255,1); border-width:2px; border-color:rgba(0,0,0,1); border-style:solid; border-radius:50px; font-weight:700; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:rgba(255,0,0,1); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-0os68 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"Buy Now","textColor":"rgba(255,0,0,1)","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/ImAEoyNM3EI3/","hoverEffect":"","textFontSource":"custom","textFontWeight":"700","wrpMarginTop":"0","wrpMarginBottom":"0","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwborderColor":"rgba(0,0,0,1)","btnBrdShwborderStyle":"solid","btnBrdShwBdr_Top":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Right":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Bottom":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Left":"2","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","showBlockContent":false,"commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-0os68 { display:block }.root-eb-button-0os68 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-0os68 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-0os68 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-0os68"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-0os68 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-0os68"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/ImAEoyNM3EI3/" rel="noopener">Buy Now</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">3. Mamlar Sakkhi Moyna Pakhi (মামলার সাক্ষী ময়না পাখি) by Shahaduzzaman</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":3099,"width":"213px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><a href="https://rkmri.co/RNeETRyeAyAy/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/25a0f3f2b_179437.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-3099" style="width:213px;height:auto"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>‘মামলার সাক্ষী ময়না পাখি’ বইয়ের ফ্ল্যাপের কথাঃ</strong>&nbsp;শাহাদুজ্জামান এই বইয়ে এক স্তন্যপায়ী প্রাণীর কথা শুনিয়েছেন, যিনি গল্প লেখেন, শুনিয়েছেন এমন একজনের কথা, যাঁর মৃত্যু সম্পর্কে অবস্থান খুব পরিষ্কার, কিংবা যাঁর হাতে টুকরো রোদের মতো খাম, জানিয়েছেন এক চিন্তাশীল প্রবীণ বানর, এক বোধিপ্রাপ্ত উবারচালক, অপস্রিয়মাণ তিরের দিকে তাকিয়ে থাকা এক যুগল আর ওয়ানওয়ে টিকিট হাতে এক বেকুবের কথা, সেই সঙ্গে শুনিয়েছেন এক বৃহস্পতিবারের গল্প, হরিণের মতো এক নারীর গল্প, যে লবঙ্গের বঙ্গ ফেলে দেয়, এক ময়না পাখির গল্প, যে মামলার সাক্ষী দেয়, সবশেষে মুখোমুখি করেছেন দুই নাজুক মানুষকে।</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-rmd56","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-rmd56 { margin-top:0px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:0px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-rmd56.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-rmd56 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-rmd56 .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(255,255,255,1); border-width:2px; border-color:rgba(0,0,0,1); border-style:solid; border-radius:50px; font-weight:700; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:rgba(255,0,0,1); transition:all 0.3s, background 0.5s, border 0.5s, border-radius 0.5s, box-shadow 0.5s }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-rmd56 .eb-button-anchor:hover { background-color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-tertiary-color); color:var(\\u002d\\u002deb-global-button-text-color) }","tab":"","mobile":""},"iconSize":"","buttonText":"Buy Now","textColor":"rgba(255,0,0,1)","buttonURL":"https://rkmri.co/RNeETRyeAyAy/","hoverEffect":"","textFontSource":"custom","textFontWeight":"700","wrpMarginTop":"0","wrpMarginBottom":"0","btnBackbackgroundColor":"rgba(255,255,255,1)","btnBackgradientColor":"linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 0% , rgba(61,89,212,0.8) 100%)","btnBrdShwborderColor":"rgba(0,0,0,1)","btnBrdShwborderStyle":"solid","btnBrdShwBdr_Top":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Right":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Bottom":"2","btnBrdShwBdr_Left":"2","btnBrdShwRds_Top":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Right":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Bottom":"50","btnBrdShwRds_Left":"50","showBlockContent":false,"commonStyles":{"desktop":".eb-parent-eb-button-rmd56 { display:block }.root-eb-button-rmd56 { position:relative }","tab":".eb-parent-eb-button-rmd56 { display:block }","mobile":".eb-parent-eb-button-rmd56 { display:block }"}} -->\n<div class="wp-block-essential-blocks-button  root-eb-button-rmd56"><div class="eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-button-rmd56 "><div class="eb-button-wrapper eb-button-alignment eb-button-rmd56"><div class="eb-button"><a class="eb-button-anchor" href="https://rkmri.co/RNeETRyeAyAy/" rel="noopener">Buy Now</a></div></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:essential-blocks/button -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading">4. 101 Introduction to Bangladesh (১০১ ইনট্রোডাকশন টু বাংলাদেশ) by Dr. Aminul Islam</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"lightbox":{"enabled":false},"id":3102,"width":"225px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"custom"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><a href="https://rkmri.co/5ee0SeIRTpy5/"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/101_Introduction_to_Bangladesh-Dr_Aminul_Islam-bf9aa-366342.jpeg" alt="" class="wp-image-3102" style="width:225px;height:auto"/></a></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>রায়হানের জন্ম ও বেড়ে ওঠা ইংল্যান্ডের লন্ডন শহরে। তার বাবা-মা অনেক বছর আগে বাংলাদেশ থেকে ইংল্যান্ডে পাড়ি জমিয়েছিল। কিন্তু তাদের মন সবসময় পড়ে থাকে বাংলাদেশে। রায়হানের বাবা-মা তাই সিদ্ধান্ত নিয়েছে ছেলে-মেয়ে বড় হলে সবাই মিলে দেশে চলে যাবে।<br>রায়হানকে একারণে বাংলাদেশে পাঠানো হয়েছে বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়ে পড়ার জন্য। দেশটা সম্পর্কে বাবা-মায়ের মুখে অনেক শুনেছে। কিন্তু কখনো আসা হয়নি। সম্পূর্ণ নতুন একটা দেশে রায়হানের নানা অভিজ্ঞতা হতে থাকে। যেই অভিজ্ঞতাগুলো তাকে ভাবতে শেখায়- এ কেমন সমাজব্যবস্থা! রায়হানের অভিজ্ঞতাগুলোই উঠে এসেছে এই বইতে।</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-v8pjm","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-v8pjm { margin-top:0px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:0px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-v8pjm.eb-button-al