-->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->', 'The LED Dream Mushroom Lamp is a whimsical and decorative lamp often designed to resemble a cluster of mushrooms, giving off a soft, ambient glow. These lamps are popular for creat', 'https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Black-Smartphone-Review-Youtube-Thumbnail_20240813_170756_0000.jpg', 7, NULL, 'publish', 33, 0, '4.84', 19, '2024-08-12 20:39:19', '2024-08-12 20:39:19', '2026-09-18 10:45:39');
INSERT INTO `posts` (`id`, `wp_id`, `author_id`, `title`, `slug`, `content`, `excerpt`, `featured_image`, `category_id`, `subcategory_id`, `status`, `views`, `is_featured`, `rating_score`, `rating_count`, `published_at`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES (111, 3517, 1, 'Stay Dry and Stylish with the Black Fashion Adult Waterproof Long Raincoat', 'stay-dry-and-stylish-with-the-black-fashion-adult-waterproof-long-raincoat', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The <strong>Black Fashion Adult Waterproof Long Raincoat</strong> is designed to keep you dry, comfortable, and stylish no matter the conditions. When it comes to outdoor adventures, unpredictable weather is always a factor to consider. Whether you\'re hiking through rugged trails, fishing by the lakeside, or simply exploring a new city, having the right gear is essential. Then the <strong>Black Fashion Adult Waterproof Long Raincoat is essential.</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":3518,"width":"431px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/black-fashion-adult-raincoat.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-3518" style="width:431px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Why Choose the Black Fashion Raincoat?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This raincoat isn’t just about keeping the rain off your back; it\'s about doing so with style and functionality. Made from durable EVA waterproof material, this raincoat is your go-to choice for any outdoor activity, from hiking and fishing to <a href="/?s=travel">travel</a> and climbing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":3520,"width":"403px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/black-fashion.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-3520" style="width:403px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->\n<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Waterproof EVA Material:</strong> The raincoat is crafted from EVA material, known for its excellent waterproofing capabilities. It ensures that you stay completely dry, even during the heaviest downpours.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Versatile Size Options:</strong> Available in four sizes (L, XL, XXL, XXXL), this raincoat caters to a wide range of body types. Whether you\'re 145 cm or 195 cm tall, there\'s a size that will fit you perfectly.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Fashion Meets Function:</strong> The sleek black design is both fashionable and practical. With its simple yet modern aesthetic, this raincoat complements any outfit while providing maximum protection against the elements.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Lightweight and Portable:</strong> Weighing only about 0.4 kg, this raincoat is lightweight and easy to pack, making it ideal for travel. You can fold it up and stow it away in your backpack without adding much weight.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Environmental Protection:</strong> Made with eco-friendly materials, this raincoat aligns with modern values of sustainability, ensuring that you not only protect yourself but also the environment.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Perfect for All Outdoor Activities:</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Whether you’re hiking through dense forests, casting a line on a rainy day, or climbing mountains, this raincoat is built to handle it all. Its hooded design offers extra protection, keeping your head dry and warm, while the long length covers most of your body, shielding you from wind and rain.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":5} -->\n<h5 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Things to Keep in Mind:</strong></h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Size Accuracy:</strong> The sizes are measured manually, so there might be a slight error of 1-2 cm. To ensure the best fit, consider your measurements carefully before choosing a size.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Color Variations:</strong> Due to differences in monitor settings, the color of the raincoat may vary slightly from what you see online. Rest assured, it’s the same sleek and stylish black.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Shipping Considerations:</strong> Given the long shipping times, there\'s a small chance that the raincoat might be damaged in transit. If that happens, contact us immediately for assistance before leaving feedback.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>The Black Fashion Adult Waterproof Long Raincoat is more than just a raincoat—it\'s a blend of style, practicality, and environmental consciousness. Whether you\'re braving the elements on a mountain trail or simply navigating through city streets, this raincoat has you covered. Stay dry, stay stylish, and enjoy your outdoor adventures with confidence.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong><em>Ready to upgrade your outdoor gear? Get your Black Fashion Raincoat today and embrace the elements with style and ease.</em></strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-l0avb","blockMeta":{"deskto