amel, keeping your baby’s teeth strong and healthy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Safe for Daily Use</strong>: Contains natural ingredients that enhance fluoride action, ensuring safe and gentle care.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Kid-Friendly Features</strong>: Sugar-free formula with less foam encourages longer brushing sessions, making it perfect for daily use.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Delicious Strawberry Flavor</strong>: Makes brushing a pleasant experience for your baby.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Product Details:</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Net Weight</strong>: 80g</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Country of Origin</strong>: Thailand</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This toothpaste is an ideal choice for parents looking to protect their baby’s teeth with a natural, effective, and flavorful product.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-5r1gi","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5r1gi { margin-top:0px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:0px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5r1gi.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5r1gi .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-5r1gi .eb-button-anchor { background-color:rgba(255,255,255,1); border-width:2px; border-color:rgba(0,0,0,1); border-style:solid; border-radius:50px; font-weight:700; padding-top:15px; padding-right:30px; padding-left:30px; padding-bottom:15px; color:rgba(255,0,0,1); transition:all 0.