ed baby and new adult teeth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":3581,"width":"317px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/toothpaste.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-3581" style="width:317px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Highlights:</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>24-Hour Sugar Acid Protection</strong>: Fluoride guards against cavities.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Mild Mint Flavor</strong>: Child-friendly and enjoyable.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Foaming Action</strong>: Ensures thorough cleaning.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Why It’s Great:</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Designed for Young Kids</strong>: Strengthens and protects growing teeth.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Easy to Use</strong>: Brush twice daily with a pea-sized amount.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Give your child the care they need for a bright, healthy smile.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:essential-blocks/button {"blockId":"eb-button-dllw2","blockMeta":{"desktop":".eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-dllw2 { margin-top:0px; margin-right:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-bottom:0px }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-dllw2.eb-button-alignment { align-items:center }.eb-button-wrapper.eb-button-dllw2 .eb-button { justify-content:center }.eb-