block-heading"><strong>Children\'s Ultra Soft Toothbrush: Ideal for Ages 2-12</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ensure gentle and effective oral care for your child with the Children\'s Ultra Soft Toothbrush, designed for kids aged 2-12 years. This toothbrush is perfect for young, sensitive gums and developing teeth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {"id":3583,"width":"376px","height":"auto","sizeSlug":"full","linkDestination":"none"} -->\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><img src="https://sera10.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/toothbrush2.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-3583" style="width:376px;height:auto"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Ultra Soft Bristles</strong>: Gentle on gums, ensuring a comfortable brushing experience for children.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Age-Appropriate Design</strong>: Suitable for children aged 2-12, providing the right level of care as they grow.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Single Pack</strong>: Comes with one toothbrush, ideal for maintaining individual oral hygiene.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {"level":4} -->\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Available Through Discovery Kids</strong></h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Reliable Seller</strong>: Discovery Kids offers a wide selection of products in Bangladesh, ensuring a fast, safe, and easy shopping experience on Daraz.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Quality Assurance</strong>: The brand is committed to providing top-class products, aiming to achieve high customer satisfaction and brand loyalt